    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人巡逻队迅速接敌，以准确的中距离火力打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕。突破固定枪位需要掩护。"), TEXT("Three rifles rise as the patrol follows a shallow ditch.\nThree veteran Jäger close rapidly, counter exposed infantry and seize vacant trenches with accurate medium-range fire. Fixed guns require a covered approach."), TEXT("A selected rifle watches the long approach; a service-rifle spotter guards its flank. The marksman prioritises machine guns and must settle before changing aim.\nPair: one marksman and one service-rifle spotter.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人巡逻队迅速接敌，以准确的中距离火力打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕。突破固定枪位需要掩护。"), TEXT("Three rifles rise as the patrol follows a shallow ditch.\nThree veteran Jäger close rapidly, counter exposed infantry and seize vacant trenches with accurate medium-range fire. Fixed guns require a covered approach."), TEXT("猎兵小队。老兵迅速接敌，在中等距离以准确步枪火力压住暴露步兵。缺乏掩护时，难以突破机枪与装甲。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人巡逻队迅速接敌，以准确的中距离火力打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕。突破固定枪位需要掩护。"), TEXT("Three rifles rise as the patrol follows a shallow ditch.\nThree veteran Jäger close rapidly, counter exposed infantry and seize vacant trenches with accurate medium-range fire. Fixed guns require a covered approach."), TEXT("Jäger patrol. Veteran riflemen close rapidly and deliver accurate fire at medium range. Effective against exposed infantry; machine guns and armour halt an unsupported advance.")},
