    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军，射程和燃料有限。操作手可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命，并可能引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt jets clear close defenders, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("Schilt 操作手在壕口打开阀门。喷流清理近处掩体，燃料和射程有限；爆炸能当场击杀操作手并引燃储罐。\n操作手较能承受零星枪火，仍需步兵掩护。")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军，射程和燃料有限。操作手可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命，并可能引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt jets clear close defenders, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("Schilt 喷火分遣队擅长清理近处掩体，射程短，燃料有限。喷火手能承受少量枪击，但爆炸仍可将其击杀并引燃储罐。")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军，射程和燃料有限。操作手可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命，并可能引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt jets clear close defenders, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("Schilt flame troops clear nearby cover, with short range and limited fuel. The operator can withstand some gunfire, but explosions can kill him and ignite the tank.")},
    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军，射程和燃料有限。操作手可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命，并可能引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt jets clear close defenders, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("法军分遣队携 Schilt 接近敌壕。\n喷流清理近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较耐零星枪火；爆炸命中致命，并可能引燃储罐。")},
