    {TEXT("燃料罐贴在背上，喷嘴指向近处掩体。\nSchilt 喷流清理近处守军，射程和燃料有限。操作手可承受零星枪击；爆炸致命，并可能引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The reservoir rides on his back, the nozzle trained on nearby cover.\nSchilt jets clear close defenders, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered shots; blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("The Schilt operator opens the valve at the trench mouth. The jet clears nearby cover but has limited fuel and reach; a blast can kill the operator and ignite his reservoir.\nThe operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but still needs infantry cover.")},
