    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("The Wex reservoir moves along the parapet.\nFlame clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator resists scattered rifle fire and benefits from smoke on the approach. A direct blast is fatal; the reservoir can ignite.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("Wex 操作手沿胸墙接近。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命。烟幕能掩护接近，储罐可能被引燃。")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("The Wex operator closes along the parapet.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal. Smoke covers the approach; the reservoir can ignite.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("The Wex reservoir moves forward beside the trench wall. Its jet clears close cover, with smoke helping the approach; fuel is limited and blasts may ignite the tank.\nThe operator resists scattered rifle fire better, but a blast can still kill outright.")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。")},
    {TEXT("喷嘴伸过壕角，储罐随枪手向前挪动。\nWex 清理近处掩体，射程和燃料有限。烟幕掩护接近；操作手可承受零星枪击，爆炸仍可致命并引燃储罐。"), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir."), TEXT("The nozzle passes the traverse as the reservoir moves forward.\nWex clears close cover, with limited reach and fuel. Smoke covers the approach; the operator withstands scattered shots, but blasts kill and may ignite the reservoir.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。每开一条路，都有人在前面跪着。\n清除铁丝、地雷\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow. Every passage has a man kneeling at its head.\nClear wire and mines\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间剪出通路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("皇家工兵可清除铁丝和地雷，连续施工可加固战壕，减少驻军遭到的正面枪击。炮火可摧毁工事。\n后期可抢修履带，恢复至半数耐久。附近有敌军或受到压制时，作业会中断。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Royal Engineers clear wire and mines. Sustained work fortifies a trench against frontal gunfire; shellfire can destroy the work.\nLater equipment allows track repairs to half durability. Nearby enemies or suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("皇家工兵剪开铁丝，清除地雷。\n连续施工可筑成壕肩，掩护驻军抵御正面枪火；炮火能摧毁工事。后期配发抢修器材，可将损坏的履带修至半数耐久。接敌或压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Royal Engineers cut wire and clear mines.\nUninterrupted work builds a revetment that protects its defenders against frontal fire. Shellfire can destroy it. Later repair equipment restores a damaged track to half strength. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间打开通路。\n清障、排雷，并在掩护下修筑壕肩。第 2 关起，连续施工 12 秒可完成工事；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，连续作业 12 秒可修复半数履带耐久，每侧限一次。接敌或受压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("皇家工兵把剪钳伸进铁丝。工兵清障、筑壕肩，后期可抢修坦克履带；近敌与压制会打断作业。\n第2关起：静止施工12秒；工事有2人驻防时，正面枪弹命中率降低22%，炮火可毁。第9关起：抢修12秒恢复一侧履带90/180，每侧限一次。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Royal Engineers cut a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Royal Engineers open a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and mines, and build revetments under cover. From operation 2, 12 uninterrupted seconds complete a post. Two defenders gain 22% protection against frontal bullet hits. Shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores half a track, once per side. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Royal Engineers put their cutters into the wire. Sappers clear obstacles, build revetments and later repair tank tracks; nearby enemies and suppression interrupt work.\nFrom operation 2: build while stationary for 12s; 2 defenders give 22% less frontal bullet hit chance. Shellfire can destroy the work. From operation 9: a 12s repair restores one track to 90/180, once per side.")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。")},
    {TEXT("探针沿泥地前探，剪钳跟着落下。\n工兵排雷、剪开铁丝，并在掩护下加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("The probe enters the mud; the cutters follow.\nEngineers clear wire and mines, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression interrupt work; shellfire can destroy the post.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。担架队还在等这条路。\n德军工兵（Pioniere）清理障碍\n清除铁丝、地雷与未爆弹\n连续作业加固战壕，减少正面枪击\n后期抢修履带至半数耐久\n近敌或压制中断作业；炮击可摧毁工事")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire. Stretcher-bearers wait for the passage.\nPioneers clear wire, mines and unexploded shells\nSustained work fortifies trenches against frontal gunfire\nLater repair tracks to half durability\nNearby enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy fortifications")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝与未爆弹之间开路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere 可清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，连续施工可加固战壕，减少驻军遭到的正面枪击。炮火可摧毁工事。\n后期可抢修履带，恢复至半数耐久。附近有敌军或受到压制时，作业会中断。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells. Sustained work fortifies a trench against frontal gunfire; shellfire can destroy the work.\nLater equipment allows track repairs to half durability. Nearby enemies or suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere 剪开铁丝，排除地雷与未爆弹。\n连续施工可筑成壕肩，掩护驻军抵御正面枪火；炮火能摧毁工事。后期配发抢修器材，可将损坏的履带修至半数耐久。接敌或压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells.\nUninterrupted work builds a revetment that protects its defenders against frontal fire. Shellfire can destroy it. Later repair equipment restores a damaged track to half strength. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝剪出缺口。工兵清障、加固壕肩，后期可抢修履带；施工需要停步和友军掩护。\n第2关起：施工12秒；工事有2人驻防时，正面枪弹命中率降低22%，炮火可毁。第9关起：抢修12秒恢复一侧履带90/180，每侧限一次；近敌与压制会打断作业。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere 穿过铁丝与未爆弹。\n清障、排雷，并在掩护下修筑壕肩。第 2 关起，连续施工 12 秒可完成工事；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，连续作业 12 秒可修复半数履带耐久，每侧限一次。接敌或受压制会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere cut a gap through the wire. They clear obstacles, reinforce revetments and later repair tracks; work requires a halt and covering fire.\nFrom operation 2: build for 12s; 2 defenders give 22% less frontal bullet hit chance. Shellfire can destroy the work. From operation 9: a 12s repair restores one track to 90/180, once per side; enemies and suppression interrupt it.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere open a route through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("Pioniere work through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and mines, and build revetments under cover. From operation 2, 12 uninterrupted seconds complete a post. Two defenders gain 22% protection against frontal bullet hits. Shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores half a track, once per side. Contact or suppression interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把探针与剪钳放到残障旁。\n德军工兵 清除铁丝、地雷和未爆弹，并加固战壕，减少正面枪击。后期可抢修半数履带耐久；近敌或压制中断作业，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post."), TEXT("The pioneer sets his probe and cutters beside the wire.\nPioniere clear wire, mines and unexploded shells, then fortify trenches against frontal gunfire. Later they restore half a track’s durability. Enemies or suppression halt work; shellfire can destroy the post.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手、两名步枪手\nNo.23 打击步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配 No.44 反装甲\nNo.44 可损伤车体；散布大，难中移动目标")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier, two riflemen\nNo.23 against infantry; No.44 against armour from late July 1918\nNo.44 damages hulls; broad scatter against moving targets")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹落向胸墙后方。\n一名枪榴弹射手与两名步枪手。适合打击固定枪位和聚集步兵；散布较大，难以追击分散移动的目标。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("一名 No.23 枪榴弹射手、两名步枪手，适合打击固定枪位和密集步兵。弹着点散布较大，难以命中分散移动的敌军。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("One No.23 rifle-grenade gunner and two riflemen attack fixed gun posts and massed infantry. Wide scatter makes dispersed, moving enemies harder to hit.")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹越过胸墙。\n一名枪榴弹射手、两名步枪手，擅长打击固定枪位与密集步兵。落点散布较大，分散移动的敌军较难命中。")},
    {TEXT("枪榴弹套上枪口，射手立起步枪托。\n一名枪榴弹手与两名步枪手打击固定枪位。No.23 杀伤步兵；1918 年 7 月下旬起配属 No.44，能够损伤车体。散布较大，移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The rifle grenade is fitted and the butt planted for firing.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed posts. No.23 strikes infantry; from late July 1918, No.44 can damage hulls. Broad scatter makes moving targets difficult."), TEXT("No.23 rifle grenades pass over the parapet.\nOne grenadier and two riflemen attack fixed guns and infantry concentrations. Wide scatter limits their effectiveness against dispersed moving troops.")},
