    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。地图上的名字，都有人须去点清。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围较广\n停步重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n观察训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts. Every name on it needs an answer.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; wider range\nRallies while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter observation training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("一纸战地委任书，连队多了一名指挥官。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；军官停步时每 6 秒在较大范围内重整友军。同类加成不叠加，重压或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，停步时可重整较大范围内的部队。同类指挥加成不叠加；重压制或阵亡会使指挥中断。\n完成观察训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and rallies troops over a wider area while halted. Officer bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death interrupts command.\nAfter observation training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("战地委任状送到连部。\n近旁部队命中率提高 50%。军官停步时可重整更大范围内受压制的部队；同类指挥不叠加，重压制或阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观测训练后，军官须有同伴掩护，停步观察可见目标，才能为炮兵校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. A halted officer rallies suppressed troops across a wider area. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nObservation training allows a halted, escorted officer to correct artillery fire against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官在壕口向前队传令。附近友军得到更强指挥，停步后可缓解更大范围的压制；重压或失去组长会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。观察研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。Webley用于近身自卫。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接过 Webley。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 6 秒重整较大范围的友军。重压或军官阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("A commission reaches the front, and a Webley changes hands.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. While halted, the officer rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Heavy suppression or his death breaks command.\nAfter observation training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct fire onto visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("A field commission appoints a company officer.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy. While halted, he rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression or death breaks command.\nWith observation training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("The officer carries orders to the leading section. He gives stronger command support and rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or his death ends the bonus.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With observation training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets. The Webley is for close defence.")},
    {TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer unfolds the map and passes orders to the neighbouring posts.\nHe rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After observation training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官摊开地图，口令传到相邻枪位。\n军官停步重整较大范围内的友军，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成观察训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%")},
