    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n军官行进中也能重整部队，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成测地训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nHe rallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After survey training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n军官行进中也能重整部队，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成测地训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nHe rallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After survey training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n军官行进中也能重整部队，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成测地训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nHe rallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After survey training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官握着 P08 跟上前队。附近友军得到更强指挥，行进中也能重整部队；指挥范围略小于英军，重压会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。炮位测地研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n军官行进中也能重整部队，受重压或阵亡时指挥中断。完成测地训练后，与同伴停稳、看清目标，便可为炮兵校射。\n附近小队命中率 +50%"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nHe rallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command. After survey training, he can register fire while halted with a companion and a clear view.\nNearby section accuracy +50%"), TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。")},
