    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮尾依次合拢。\n多轮齐射轰击选定弹着区\n适合固定阵地、集结部队\n传令延迟、散布妨碍命中移动目标")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos hit the chosen impact area\nBest against fixed posts and concentrations\nOrder delay and scatter hinder hits on moving targets")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("野炮多轮轰击指定区域，适合攻击固定阵地和集结部队。传令延迟和炮弹散布使移动目标较难命中；弹着区内的友军同样会受伤。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("Field guns bombard the selected area in several groups, suited to fixed positions and massed troops. Order delays and shell scatter make moving targets harder to hit. Friendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("电话线接通，炮兵复诵方位。\n多轮炮火覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位与集结部队。传令延迟和散布使移动目标较难命中；友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the telephone.\nSeveral salvos strike the selected area, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets; friendly troops are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("炮长读出坐标，炮闩依次合上。\n多轮齐射覆盖指定地域，打击固定阵位和集结部队。传令延迟与散布使移动目标难以命中。"), TEXT("The battery commander reads the coordinates; the breeches close in turn.\nSuccessive salvos cover the chosen ground, striking fixed posts and concentrations. Delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets."), TEXT("电话那端，炮长复诵方位。野炮以多轮爆炸覆盖指定地段；传令延迟和散布使移动目标更难命中。\n落弹区内的友军同样受伤。")},
