    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("A biplane noses down over the front.\nTwo passes strafe exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets stop some bullets and heavy armour resists the guns. Friendly troops are also at risk.")},
