    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("A biplane sweeps low over the front. Narrow strafing runs suppress exposed infantry and columns; parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets.\nFlight: 2 passes; friendly troops in the lane are also exposed.")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n两次低空扫射，弹着沿航线展开\n打击聚集步兵及暴露枪位；弹道受地形遮挡，也会伤及友军")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nTwo low passes lay fire along the approach\nCounter infantry concentrations and exposed guns; terrain blocks rounds, and allies are at risk")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次")},
    {TEXT("机翼掠过壕线，枪口指向前方空地。\n扫射沿航线打击聚集步兵和暴露枪位。地形遮挡枪弹，航线内的友军同样危险。\n低空扫射 2 次"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2"), TEXT("Wings sweep over the trench; the guns rake the ground ahead.\nStrafing follows the flight path against infantry concentrations and exposed guns. Terrain blocks rounds; friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.\nLow passes 2")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n六段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n持续压制沿途阵地；步兵与弹着区保持距离")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the last cloud of dust.\nSix barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nSuppresses positions along the route; infantry must keep clear of the impact area")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("步兵与炮兵对准表针。徐进弹幕逐段向敌后压制枪位；跟进过近会遭己方炮火。\n弹幕：6组，每组3发。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("六组弹幕逐段向敌后推进，每组 3 发，持续压制沿途阵地。步兵须与弹着区保持距离，跟得过近也会被炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("Six barrage groups advance through enemy positions, with 3 shells per group. Infantry must keep clear of the impact area; following too closely exposes them to shellfire.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("步兵与炮兵按表针推进。\n六组弹幕，每组三发，逐段向敌后压进。连续阵位受压制；跟进过近的友军也会被炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("Infantry and gunners advance by the watch.\nSix groups of three shells lift towards the enemy rear, suppressing successive positions. Friendly troops following too closely enter the barrage.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("Infantry and gunners set their watches. A creeping barrage suppresses successive positions towards the enemy rear; troops following too closely meet their own shells.\nBarrage: 6 groups of 3 rounds.")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在最后一段烟尘后。\n八段徐进弹幕，每段 3 发\n连续打击步兵、阵位与装甲；突击部队须避开弹着区")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind its last cloud of dust.\nEight barrage lifts, 3 shells per lift\nRepeated fire against infantry, positions and armour; assault troops must keep clear")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发")},
    {TEXT("炮火逐段移向敌后，步兵伏在烟尘后方。\n弹幕连续打击步兵、阵位和装甲，突击部队须避开落弹区。\n弹幕推进 8 段\n每段炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3"), TEXT("The barrage lifts towards the rear; infantry wait behind the dust.\nRepeated fire strikes infantry, positions and armour. Assault troops must keep clear of the impacts.\nBarrage lifts 8\nShells per lift 3")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮\n杀伤开阔地密集步兵\n深壕、坚土提供掩护；对坦克无效")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells open above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one\nStrikes massed infantry in the open\nDeep trenches and firm earth protect; ineffective against tanks")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("引信刻度装定，榴霰弹在空中裂开。密集行军的步兵首当其冲，深壕和坚土遮挡弹珠。\n齐射：2轮，每轮3发；引信操练增加到3轮。不能伤害坦克，友军必须避开。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("榴霰弹在目标区域上空起爆，杀伤开阔地上的密集步兵。两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信训练增加一轮。深壕与坚土可提供掩护。对坦克无效，爆区内的友军也会受伤。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Each mission fires two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds a third. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. It is ineffective against tanks, and friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the target area, striking massed infantry in the open. Two salvos of 3 shells; fuze training adds one salvo. Deep trenches and earth offer protection. Ineffective against tanks; friendly troops in the burst area are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("榴霰弹在胸墙上方裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮三发；引信操练增加一轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供掩护。无法损伤坦克，友军也会遭到杀伤。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Shrapnel bursts above the parapet.\nTwo salvos of three shells; fuze drill adds one salvo. Effective against massed infantry in the open. Deep trenches and earth provide cover. Cannot damage tanks; allies are also at risk.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("引信装定，榴霰弹在步兵头顶裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信操练增至三轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供保护。对坦克无效，也会杀伤友军。")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Fuzes are set and shells split overhead. Shrapnel punishes infantry crowded in the open; deep trenches and earth screen the balls.\nSalvo: two groups of three, rising to three groups with fuze drill. Cannot damage tanks. Keep friendlies clear.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，弹丸在胸墙上空散开。\n空爆弹丸杀伤暴露和驻壕步兵，坚固掩体能遮挡弹道。\n榴霰弹齐射 2 轮\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; the shells break above the parapet.\nAirburst balls strike exposed and entrenched infantry. Substantial cover blocks their paths.\nShrapnel salvos 2\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks.")},
