    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n部队借己方烟幕接近敌阵，减少途中受到的枪弹压制，抵近后开火。\n烟幕内推进所受枪弹压制 −50%"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nFriendly smoke shields the approach from bullet suppression; the men close before opening fire.\nBullet suppression while advancing in smoke −50%"), TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n部队借己方烟幕接近敌阵，减少途中受到的枪弹压制，抵近后开火。\n烟幕内推进所受枪弹压制 −50%")},
    {TEXT("突击手沿烟幕抵近，手雷已从袋中取出。\n部队借己方烟幕接近敌阵，减少途中受到的枪弹压制，抵近后开火。\n烟幕内推进所受枪弹压制 −50%"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nFriendly smoke shields the approach from bullet suppression; the men close before opening fire.\nBullet suppression while advancing in smoke −50%"), TEXT("The assault party closes through smoke, bombs already drawn.\nFriendly smoke shields the approach from bullet suppression; the men close before opening fire.\nBullet suppression while advancing in smoke −50%")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线从身后伸向炮位。线断之处，须有人去接。\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮提前、散布缩小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射\n精确射手报告可见目标")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip; a wire runs back to the battery. A break needs a man to mend it.\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier first salvo, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration\nMarksmen report visible targets")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，缩短首轮等待并减少散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can register artillery and mortars, bringing the first salvo sooner with less scatter. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration. Marksmen can still report visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("观察员报出地标，炮位修正诸元。\n有同伴掩护、视野清楚的指挥官，停步校射后可缩短炮击首轮等待，并收紧散布。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴都会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("The observer reports a landmark; the battery corrects its aim.\nA halted commander with an escort and a clear view brings the first artillery or mortar salvo sooner, with tighter scatter. Movement, smoke, cover or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen can still report visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("观察员指认地标，传令兵记下方位。\n战术：指挥组携一名存活伴随兵停稳两秒，并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%。烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("An observer points out a landmark and a runner notes the bearing.\nTactics: A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter, provided he can see the target. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their early target reports.")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。")},
    {TEXT("观察员伏于坑岸，电话线通向炮位。\n指挥组停稳、看清目标且身旁还有同伴时，可为野炮和迫击炮校射，让首轮更早、散布更小。移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射；精确射手也能报告目标。"), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets."), TEXT("The observer lies at the crater lip, a wire running back to the battery.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, a command section registers guns and mortars for earlier, tighter opening fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration; marksmen also report targets.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n校射条件：指挥组停稳 2 秒\n同队同伴在旁，目标可见\n野炮、迫击炮：首轮进一步提前、散布更小\n移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴中断校射")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nRegistration requires: commander halted two seconds, section companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: earlier opening fire, tighter scatter\nMovement, obstruction, smoke or lost companion interrupts registration")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。军士或军官停稳 2 秒，目标可见且有同组士兵在旁时，可进一步缩短野炮和迫击炮的首轮等待，提高炮击精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("Reduces mortar scatter. A command section halted for two seconds with a surviving companion and a clear view can further shorten the first artillery or mortar salvo delay and improve accuracy. Movement, smoke, obstruction or loss of the companion interrupts registration.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("炮兵把新坐标填进测地表。\n收紧迫击炮散布。有同伴掩护、视野清楚的指挥官，停步校射后可进一步缩短首轮等待、改善炮群精度。移动、烟幕、遮挡或失去同伴都会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("The battery enters new coordinates on its survey sheet.\nTightens mortar scatter. A halted commander with an escort and a clear view brings the first salvo sooner and further improves the battery’s accuracy. Movement, smoke, cover or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("炮位测地表添上前沿的新坐标。\n战术：缩小迫击炮散布。指挥组携存活伴随兵停稳两秒并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%；烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("Fresh front-line coordinates are entered on the battery survey.\nTactics: Tightens mortar scatter. A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter if the target is visible. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步提前野炮与迫击炮首轮、收紧散布；移动、遮挡、烟幕或失去同伴会中断校射。"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration."), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further advances and tightens opening gun and mortar fire. Movement, cover, smoke or a lost companion interrupts registration.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。面罩之后，每一次呼吸都听得清楚。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火组：毒气累积 −78%\n其他小队未配属；久留毒区仍可致命")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Tighten the filter and test the facepiece seal. Behind the mask each breath is plainly heard.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops: gas build-up −78%\nOther sections unequipped; prolonged exposure can still kill")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("滤盒卸下补给车，面具逐一检查。\n战术：为突击班、工兵和喷火分遣队配发经气密检查的呼吸器；佩戴完成后减少 78% 毒气累积，仍会受压制，久留仍有危险。其他分队必须绕开或撤出毒区。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("为投弹班、工兵和喷火组配发呼吸器。正确佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；仍会受到压制，长期暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Equips bombers, pioneers and flame troops with respirators. A proper fit reduces gas accumulation by 78%; suppression remains and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections receive no gas protection.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("滤盒与面罩发到前沿分遣队。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组获得呼吸器。密封佩戴后，毒气累积降低 78%；压制仍在，长时间暴露仍可能致命。其余分队没有防毒装备。")},
