    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("滤盒离开补给车，面罩逐一检查气密。\n为投弹班、工兵与喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。完成佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍受压制，久留仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒区。")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Filter boxes leave the supply wagon and each mask is checked.\nTactics: Issues checked respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. A completed seal reduces gas exposure by 78%; suppression and prolonged exposure remain dangerous. Other sections must avoid or leave the cloud.")},
    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Filters are unloaded and each facepiece tested.\nIssues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid the cloud.")},
