    {TEXT("滤罐拧紧，面罩逐一检查气密。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火组配属防毒面具。其余小队仍须避开毒区，久留浓云中仍可致命。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Filters tighten and facepieces are checked for a seal.\nBombers, pioneers and flame troops receive gas masks. Other sections must avoid the cloud; prolonged exposure remains lethal.\nGas build-up after masking −78%")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("Reserve fuel reaches the flame party through the communication trench.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("备用燃料沿交通壕送到喷火手身旁。\n喷火射程略增\n首罐耗尽后，追加 4 次喷射")},
