    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("专门射手附近有存活的同队携弹手时，装填时间缩短 15%。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("Specialist weapons reload 15% faster while a living squadmate remains nearby.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("枪榴弹与专用发射弹分开携行，携弹手在发射间隙把下一发送到射手身边。有同伴伴随，装填便更顺畅；孤身射手没有这份照应。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("大口径枪弹逐发交到射手手中。携弹手活着并留在小队时，重新装填更从容；失去同伴以后，射手只能独自承担整套工作。")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("The heavy cartridges pass to the gunner one at a time. A living carrier beside his section eases each reload. Without that companion, the gunner must manage the whole task alone.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("Grenades and launching cartridges travel separately. Between shots the carrier brings the next round to the gunner. Reloading is smoother with his companion nearby; a lone gunner loses that help.")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%")},
    {TEXT("携弹手伏于射手身旁，下一发放在枪托边。\n同队携弹手在旁协助专门射手装填。\n专门射手装填时间 −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%"), TEXT("The bearer lies beside the gunner, the next round ready at the stock.\nA section’s bearer assists specialist gunners while nearby.\nSpecialist reload time −15%")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组：移动更快\n架设与收枪快 30%\n射程、压制弱于固定枪组\n整备页切换；共用槽位和整备\n仅影响后续征募")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nUnlock mobile gun sections: faster movement\nDeployment and packing 30% quicker\nShorter range and weaker suppression than fixed gun sections\nSwitch in preparation; share slots and readiness\nAffects future recruits only")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("枪械与弹药分给更多携行手。\n解锁伴随机枪编组：移动较快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制较弱。\n在整备页与固定枪组互换，共用岗位和整备；只影响之后征募的分队。")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("解锁伴随机枪组：移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制弱于固定枪组。\n可在整备页切换编制，共用槽位和整备，仅影响后续征募。")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("Unlocks mobile gun sections: faster movement, deployment and packing 30% quicker, with shorter range and weaker suppression than fixed crews.\nSwitch formation on the preparation page; both share a slot and readiness, and changes affect future recruits.")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("携行手分担枪械与弹药。\n解锁伴随机枪组：移动更快，架设与收枪快 30%，射程与压制较弱。\n整备页可与固定枪组互换，共用槽位和整备，只影响之后征募的分队。")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("Bearers share the gun and ammunition.\nUnlocks a mobile gun section: faster movement and 30% faster deployment and packing, with less range and suppression.\nExchange it with the fixed section in the loadout. Both share a slot and readiness; only new recruits receive the change.")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("枪的重量分到几副肩带上。\n解锁伴随机枪编组：移动较快，架设与收枪快30%，射程与压制较弱。\n在整备页与固定枪组切换；共用岗位和整备，现役分队不变。")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("More bearers share the gun and ammunition.\nUnlocks a mobile gun section: faster movement and 30% faster deployment and packing, with less range and suppression.\nExchange it with the fixed section in the loadout. Both share a slot and readiness; the choice applies to new recruits.")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The gun's weight is shared across more shoulder straps.\nUnlocks a mobile gun section: faster movement and 30% faster deployment and packing, with less range and suppression.\nSelect it in the loadout; both variants share a slot and readiness. Deployed sections keep their equipment.")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%")},
    {TEXT("枪架卸下多余负重，携弹手改用随身弹袋。\n解锁伴随枪组，移动更快，射程和压制弱于固定枪组。在出战序列中互换，共用整备；新编制用于后续征募。\n架设与收枪速度 +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%"), TEXT("The crew sheds carrying weight and brings its ammunition on the march.\nMobile gun sections move faster, with less range and suppression. Switch in the order of battle; both share readiness, and later recruits use the new formation.\nDeployment and packing speed +30%")},
    {TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +18%"), TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +18%"), TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。断履的战车停在敌军射界里。\n履带耐久 +18%\n抢修恢复半数耐久")},
    {TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +18%"), TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +18%"), TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks. A shed track leaves the hull in the enemy's sights.\nTrack durability +18%\nField repair restores half durability")},
    {TEXT("备用销轴与履带节随车前送。\n加强履带，抢修时恢复强化后半数耐久。\n履带耐久 +18%"), TEXT("Spare pins and links go forward with the tanks.\nReinforced tracks withstand more damage; field repair restores half their reinforced durability.\nTrack durability +18%"), TEXT("A broken link can stop a whole assault. Track durability rises 18%; field repairs restore half of the improved strength. Hull protection is unchanged.")},
