    {TEXT("侧舱炮口伸出车体，履带攀过壕沿。\nMark IV 雄型以火炮和机枪支援突破、迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需步兵清壕；野炮威胁车体，履带与枪位可单独损坏。"), TEXT("Sponson guns project from the hull as the tracks climb the trench lip.\nThe Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns. Slow to advance, it needs infantry to clear trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and mountings can fail separately."), TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。")},
