    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("Flame reach increases modestly. Four more bursts become available after the first reservoir is exhausted.")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("法军分遣队把喷火器的燃料与软管逐一交接。携行储备增加了，却没有让操作者免于枪弹；先掩护接近，再清理近处的掩体。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("Wex 喷火手的背后必须有人照看软管与燃料。整备好的储罐让短促喷射能够延续，步枪手仍要压住远处的枪口。")},
    {TEXT("备用燃料背过交通壕，喷嘴重新接上软管。\n喷流射程略增，首罐耗尽后可继续喷射。\n追加喷射 4 次"), TEXT("Reserve fuel comes through the trench; the nozzle is reconnected to its hose.\nFlame reach increases slightly, with further fuel after the first reservoir is exhausted.\nAdditional bursts 4"), TEXT("A Wex operator needs someone watching his hose and fuel supply. Prepared tanks sustain short bursts; riflemen must still silence the distant guns.")},
