    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。\n榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。\n齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nThe shrapnel battery adds another salvo.\nSalvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Shrapnel increases from two salvos to three, still with 3 shells per salvo.")},
    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。\n榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。\n齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nThe shrapnel battery adds another salvo.\nSalvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("引信扳手转过，下一组炮弹送到炮尾。\n榴霰弹由两轮增至三轮，每轮仍为 3 发。")},
