    {TEXT("引信装定，预备弹推到炮闩旁。\n榴霰弹炮组增加一轮齐射。\n齐射轮数 2 → 3\n每轮炮弹 3 发"), TEXT("Fuzes are set; reserve shells wait beside the breech.\nThe shrapnel battery adds another salvo.\nSalvos 2 → 3\nShells per salvo 3"), TEXT("Shrapnel fire increases from two to three salvos of 3 shells.")},
