    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。\n指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，为野炮与迫击炮校射。移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡会中断校射。\n首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, the command section registers guns and mortars. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration.\nOpening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%"), TEXT("观察员把地标报给身旁的传令兵。观测组校射可见目标；移动、烟幕、重压或失去同伴会中断观测。\n校射：静止2秒；野炮与迫击炮首轮早到2.5秒，散布减小30%。")},
    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。\n指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，为野炮与迫击炮校射。移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡会中断校射。\n首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, the command section registers guns and mortars. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration.\nOpening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%"), TEXT("The observer calls a landmark to his orderly. The party corrects fire onto visible targets; movement, smoke, heavy suppression or loss of the escort interrupts observation.\nCorrection: halt for 2s; the first artillery or mortar salvo arrives 2.5s sooner with 30% less scatter.")},
    {TEXT("观察员压低身子，携弹手守住电话线。\n指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，为野炮与迫击炮校射。移动、烟幕、重压制或同伴阵亡会中断校射。\n首轮炮火提前 2.5 秒\n散布 −30%"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire.\nHalted with a companion and a clear view, the command section registers guns and mortars. Movement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration.\nOpening salvo 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter −30%"), TEXT("The observer lies low; his companion guards the wire. The battery at the other end waits for his word.\nRegistration requires: halt 2 seconds, companion and clear view\nGuns and mortars: first salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, scatter −30%\nMovement, smoke, heavy suppression or the companion’s death interrupts registration")},
