    {TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("狙击手留意发号施令的敌军，再寻找机枪手。打断对方的组织，往往比追逐最近的散兵更有用。")},
    {TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("Snipers watch first for enemy leaders, then machine gunners. Disrupting the opposing formation often matters more than chasing the nearest skirmisher.")},
    {TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。")},
    {TEXT("瞄准镜循着壕上的传令手势移动。\n狙击手先打击可见的敌军指挥者，再转向机枪手。"), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners."), TEXT("The sight follows a signalling hand above the trench.\nSnipers prioritise visible enemy commanders, then machine gunners.")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升军官：指挥命中率 +25% → +50%\n每 6 秒重整；行进中下令")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nOfficer promotion: command accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRallies every 6 seconds, including while moving")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("士官升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("Upgrades the NCO to an officer: the command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with a rally every 6 seconds, including while moving.")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("指挥组长获任配 P08 的军官，推进中也能就近发出命令；留在壕里的步枪手则更善于压住冲来的敌人。")},
    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("The command leader is commissioned and issued a P08, allowing him to give orders close to advancing troops. Riflemen remaining in the trench become better at pinning an approaching enemy.")},
