    {TEXT("军士领到委任状，转身把口令传向前队。\n晋升的军官行进中也能重整部队。\n指挥命中率加成 +25% → +50%\n重整间隔 6 秒"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds"), TEXT("The NCO takes his commission and passes an order to the leading men.\nThe promoted officer rallies troops even on the move.\nCommand accuracy bonus +25% → +50%\nRally interval 6 seconds")},
    {TEXT("枪口退入胸墙暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手更难被枪弹压住或击中。\n驻壕枪手中弹概率 −25%\n所受枪弹压制 −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets.\nEntrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%"), TEXT("枪口退入胸墙的暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手：枪弹命中概率、枪弹压制 −25%")},
