    {TEXT("枪口退入胸墙暗影，只留一道射孔。\n驻壕机枪手更难被枪弹压住或击中。\n驻壕枪手中弹概率 −25%\n所受枪弹压制 −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets.\nEntrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%"), TEXT("The muzzle draws into the parapet’s shadow, leaving a narrow loophole.\nEntrenched gunners are harder to hit or suppress with bullets.\nEntrenched gunner hit chance −25%\nBullet suppression taken −25%")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手留在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进：有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护\n壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令令其前进")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("A trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("整壕出击时，有枪手的机枪组替步兵留守掩护。若壕内已没有别的步兵，它们仍可奉命向前。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("When a trench advances, machine-gun sections with a living gunner remain to cover the infantry. If no other infantry remain in the trench, the guns can still be ordered forward.")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。")},
    {TEXT("步枪班出壕，枪手在胸墙后继续射击。\n整壕前进时，有枪手的机枪小队留守掩护。壕内仅余机枪小队时，再次下令即可前进。"), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward."), TEXT("The rifles leave; the gunner keeps firing from the parapet.\nA trench advance leaves manned gun sections to cover it. When only gun sections remain, another order sends them forward.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("测绘员把新坐标记入炮兵表，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮散布缩小\n指挥组停稳 2 秒，目标可见\n一名同队存活同伴在旁：\n野炮、迫击炮首轮再提前 2.5 秒；散布再 −30%")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortar scatter reduced\nCommander halted 2 seconds, target visible\nOne living companion from the same section nearby:\nOpening artillery or mortar salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter another −30%")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("Mortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("迫击炮组把测地记录与火力表核对清楚。弹着不再散得那么开，爆炸本身却不会因此缩小。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("Mortar crews reconcile their survey notes and firing tables. Their rounds fall in a tighter area; the explosions themselves do not become smaller.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%")},
    {TEXT("测绘员记下新坐标，观察员回报弹着。\n迫击炮落弹更集中。指挥组停稳、有同伴和清晰视线时，进一步改善野炮与迫击炮校射。\n首轮炮火再提前 2.5 秒\n散布再 −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%"), TEXT("The surveyor records new coordinates; the observer reports the fall of shot.\nMortars scatter less. A halted command section with a companion and a clear view further improves gun and mortar registration.\nOpening salvo another 2.5 seconds sooner\nScatter another −30%")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。警报传到壕口，点名改用手势。\n投弹班、工兵、喷火分遣队完成佩戴后：\n毒气累积 −78%\n仍会受压制；久留毒区可致命\n其他小队未配属")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("The facepieces seal and filters tighten. At the gas alarm, the roll is answered by raised hands.\nBombers, pioneers and flame detachments, after sealing their masks:\nGas build-up −78%\nSuppression persists; prolonged exposure can still kill\nOther sections remain unequipped")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("为投弹班、工兵与喷火分遣队配发呼吸器。完成佩戴后，毒气累积减少 78%；仍受压制，久留仍可能致命。其余分队需避开毒区。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Issues respirators to bombers, pioneers and flame detachments. Once sealed, gas exposure falls by 78%. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure can still kill. Other sections must avoid the cloud.")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("小盒式呼吸器需要专门操练。口具与鼻夹必须用对，软管与滤盒也要检查，弄湿的滤材必须更换；在警报响起之前，先安排装备配发与训练。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("防毒面具操练从气密检查开始，滤罐必须远离泥水。完成研习后，部队获配面罩与滤罐，警报响起时便可佩戴，减少毒气造成的损失。")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("Respirator instruction begins with an airtight seal and a filter kept clear of muddy water. Once trained and equipped, the men can don their masks at the alarm and reduce losses to gas.")},
    {TEXT("面罩逐一压紧，滤罐旋上接头。\n投弹班、工兵和喷火小队配属防毒面具。佩戴后仍受压制，久留毒区仍可致命；其余小队未配属。\n佩戴后毒气累积 −78%"), TEXT("Facepieces seal and filters tighten onto their couplings.\nBombers, pioneers and flame sections receive gas masks. Suppression persists and prolonged exposure remains lethal; other sections are unequipped.\nGas build-up after masking −78%"), TEXT("The small-box respirator demands practice. Fit the mouthpiece and nose clip correctly; inspect the hose and filter box, and replace wet filter material. Arrange this equipment and training before the alarm sounds.")},
