    {TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型，供 1918 年 8 月起的行动使用。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备较长。"), TEXT("The driver tests the controls while the repair crew checks the transmission.\nUnlocks Mark V Male for operations from August 1918. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, with longer readiness."), TEXT("驾驶员试动操纵杆，修理队核对传动机构。\n解锁 Mark V 雄型：1918 年 8 月起\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV；整备更长")},
