    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵：坦克机枪命中率 +10%\n同类加成不叠加")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull's flank, watching the trench mouth for the gunner.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres: tank machine-gun accuracy +10%\nIdentical bonuses do not stack")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack.")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("步兵观察车体两侧的死角。\n九米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%。同类加成不叠加。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry watch the ground hidden beside the hull.\nLiving friendly infantry within nine metres give tank machine guns 10% more accuracy. The bonus does not stack.")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("步兵替驾驶员盯住看不见的地面。有友军步兵在九米内掩护时，坦克机枪命中提高10%；多支部队不会叠加。")},
    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry watch the ground the driver cannot see. A tank's machine guns gain 10% accuracy while living friendly infantry are within nine metres. Multiple sections do not stack this benefit.")},
