    {TEXT("步兵沿车体侧面前进，替枪手观察壕口。\n步兵贴着坦克推进，为车上的枪手指出目标。\n坦克机枪命中率 +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%"), TEXT("Infantry move along the hull’s flank, watching the trench mouth.\nInfantry keeping close to a tank point out targets for its gunners.\nTank machine-gun accuracy +10%")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n每车修复一处机枪至半数耐久\n连续作业 8 秒；11 米内无敌军\n车体不可维修")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nOne machine gun per tank restored to half durability\n8 uninterrupted seconds; no enemies within 11 metres\nHull repair unavailable")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired.")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("工兵把备用枪机送到受损枪位。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久。需连续作业 8 秒，且十一米内无敌军。车体无法维修。")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("Pioneers bring a spare action to the disabled gun mount.\nOne machine gun per tank can be restored to half strength. Requires 8 uninterrupted seconds with no enemy within eleven metres. Hull damage cannot be repaired.")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("工兵可为每辆车抢修一个损坏机枪，恢复一半耐久。需在车旁连续作业八秒，且十一米内没有敌人；不能修复车体。")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("Pioneers can restore one disabled machine gun per vehicle to half strength. Requires eight uninterrupted seconds beside the tank, with no enemy within eleven metres. Hull damage cannot be repaired.")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%")},
    {TEXT("工兵卸开枪座，车组递来销轴和工具。\n周围没有敌军时，工兵可为每辆战车修复一处机枪。\n机枪修复后耐久 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%"), TEXT("The sapper opens the mounting; the crew passes pins and tools.\nWith no enemy nearby, engineers can repair one machine gun on each vehicle.\nRepaired machine-gun durability 50%")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口越过壕沿。\nMark V 双炮打击阵位和装甲，机动、防护强于 Mark IV。整备较长，侧翼需要步兵。"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip.\nMark V’s twin cannon attack posts and armour. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, it has longer readiness and needs infantry on its flanks."), TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口随履带越过壕沿。\nMark V：双侧炮打击阵位、装甲\n机动、防护强于 Mark IV\n整备更长；侧翼须有步兵")},
    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口越过壕沿。\nMark V 双炮打击阵位和装甲，机动、防护强于 Mark IV。整备较长，侧翼需要步兵。"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip.\nMark V’s twin cannon attack posts and armour. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, it has longer readiness and needs infantry on its flanks."), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip with the tracks.\nMark V: twin sponson guns attack posts and armour\nMore mobile and better protected than Mark IV\nLonger readiness; infantry must guard the flanks")},
