    {TEXT("操纵杆带动车体转向，侧舱炮口越过壕沿。\nMark V 双炮打击阵位和装甲，机动、防护强于 Mark IV。整备较长，侧翼需要步兵。"), TEXT("The controls turn the hull; sponson guns cross the trench lip.\nMark V’s twin cannon attack posts and armour. More mobile and better protected than Mark IV, it has longer readiness and needs infantry on its flanks."), TEXT("The Ricardo engine and epicyclic transmission ease the driver's burden. Twin sponson guns break strongpoints and fight armour. Faster and tougher than a Mark IV, but slower to prepare; infantry must still guard its flanks.")},
