    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵随五机枪战车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The Female covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks beside a five-gun tank. Their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. Five machine guns, no cannon. The shortest preparation, with 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵随五机枪战车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The Female covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks beside a five-gun tank. Their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("雌型车掩护两名皇家工兵穿过空地。工兵剪开铁丝、清除地雷并抢修履带；一旦阵亡，清障与修理便随之停止。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵随五机枪战车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The Female covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks beside a five-gun tank. Their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("A female tank shelters two Royal Engineers on the approach. They clear wire and mines and repair broken tracks. Protect them: casualties end their work. Five machine guns, no cannon. The shortest armour preparation, traded for 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
    {TEXT("雌型战车掩护工兵，剪钳剪开残丝。\n两名皇家工兵随五机枪战车清障、抢修履带，阵亡后作业停止。机枪型整备最快，缺少主炮。\n机枪点射恢复间隔 +75%"), TEXT("The Female covers the sappers as they cut the remaining wire.\nTwo Royal Engineers clear obstacles and repair tracks beside a five-gun tank. Their deaths stop the work. This cannonless configuration has the shortest readiness.\nMachine-gun burst recovery +75%"), TEXT("雌型车掩护两名随车工兵清除铁丝、地雷并抢修履带。工兵会阵亡；已编成的工程纵队整备最快，但工程补给挤占弹药，机枪连射后的补给间隔更长。")},
