    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501 的八机枪配置压制步兵，无法毁伤坦克车体。同一时间只可出动一辆。"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501’s eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."), TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501：八机枪配置，压制步兵\n对坦克车体无效；仅一辆在役")},
    {TEXT("前部双机枪朝向路口，车组在弹带箱间转身。\nA7V 501 的八机枪配置压制步兵，无法毁伤坦克车体。同一时间只可出动一辆。"), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501’s eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."), TEXT("Twin front guns face the junction; the crew moves between belt boxes.\nA7V 501: eight-gun configuration suppresses infantry\nIneffective against tank hulls; only one active")},
