    {TEXT("四挺 霍奇基斯 守住狭小战斗舱四周。\n快速履带坦克在开阔地扩大突破、追击暴露步兵。装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"), TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns cover the approaches around a compact fighting compartment.\nA fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground and pursuing exposed infantry. Light protection and no cannon leave it vulnerable to armour."), TEXT("四挺 霍奇基斯 守住狭小战斗舱四周。\n快速履带坦克在开阔地扩大突破、追击暴露步兵。装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。")},
    {TEXT("四挺 霍奇基斯 守住狭小战斗舱四周。\n快速履带坦克在开阔地扩大突破、追击暴露步兵。装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"), TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns cover the approaches around a compact fighting compartment.\nA fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground and pursuing exposed infantry. Light protection and no cannon leave it vulnerable to armour."), TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns cover the approaches around a compact fighting compartment.\nA fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground and pursuing exposed infantry. Light protection and no cannon leave it vulnerable to armour.")},
    {TEXT("57 毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住车旁空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，崎岖地形妨碍行进。研究后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"), TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative."), TEXT("五十七毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住高大车体旁的空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，崎岖地形妨碍行进。研发后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。")},
    {TEXT("57 毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住车旁空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，崎岖地形妨碍行进。研究后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"), TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative."), TEXT("The 57 mm gun faces forward; side gun crews watch the approaches along the tall hull.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire. The high chassis struggles through rough ground; the Gretchen configuration trades its cannon for machine guns.")},
    {TEXT("57 毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住车旁空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，崎岖地形妨碍行进。研究后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"), TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative."), TEXT("57 毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住车旁空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，崎岖地形妨碍行进。研究后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。")},
    {TEXT("57 毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住车旁空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，崎岖地形妨碍行进。研究后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"), TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative."), TEXT("The 57 mm cannon faces forward; side gunners watch the tall hull’s flanks.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire, while rough ground hinders movement. Research unlocks the Gretchen machine-gun alternative.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。"), TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault. Captured spares shorten readiness more than A7V service; choose the five-gun alternative before deployment."), TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击。缴获备件对整备的改善较大，部署前可换为五机枪配置。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。"), TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault. Captured spares shorten readiness more than A7V service; choose the five-gun alternative before deployment."), TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault. Captured spares shorten readiness more than A7V service; a five-gun configuration shares the same platform slot.")},
    {TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。"), TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault. Captured spares shorten readiness more than A7V service; choose the five-gun alternative before deployment."), TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。")},
    {TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，缴获备件更有效地缩短整备。出战前可换为五机枪配置。"), TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault. Captured spares shorten readiness more than A7V service; choose the five-gun alternative before deployment."), TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault. Captured spares shorten readiness more than A7V service; choose the five-gun alternative before deployment.")},
    {TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，清理铁丝与损坏的行走机构。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵。"), TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for wire and damaged running gear.\nPioneer Escort research attaches two engineers to each heavy tank, arriving with the vehicle."), TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，处理铁丝网与损坏的行走机构。\n研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，随该车一同出动。")},
    {TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，清理铁丝与损坏的行走机构。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵。"), TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for wire and damaged running gear.\nPioneer Escort research attaches two engineers to each heavy tank, arriving with the vehicle."), TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for the wire and its damaged running gear.\nResearch Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. The escort is part of that tank's call, using no additional armour slot.")},
    {TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，清理铁丝与损坏的行走机构。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵。"), TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for wire and damaged running gear.\nPioneer Escort research attaches two engineers to each heavy tank, arriving with the vehicle."), TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，清理铁丝与损坏的行走机构。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵。")},
    {TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，清理铁丝与损坏的行走机构。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵。"), TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for wire and damaged running gear.\nPioneer Escort research attaches two engineers to each heavy tank, arriving with the vehicle."), TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for wire and damaged running gear.\nPioneer Escort research attaches two engineers to each heavy tank, arriving with the vehicle.")},
    {TEXT("德军枪组进入缴获 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n五机枪配置专注反步兵，整备较快。出战前与火炮配置择一。"), TEXT("German gun crews take their posts inside a captured Mark IV.\nThe five-gun configuration specialises in infantry fire and readies sooner. Choose it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment."), TEXT("德军机枪组进入缴获的 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n缴获坦克的五机枪配置，专注反步兵、整备较快；部署前与火炮配置择一。")},
    {TEXT("德军枪组进入缴获 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n五机枪配置专注反步兵，整备较快。出战前与火炮配置择一。"), TEXT("German gun crews take their posts inside a captured Mark IV.\nThe five-gun configuration specialises in infantry fire and readies sooner. Choose it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment."), TEXT("German machine-gun crews take their places inside a captured Mark IV.\nFive-gun configuration of the captured tank: infantry fire and shorter readiness. Select it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment.")},
    {TEXT("德军枪组进入缴获 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n五机枪配置专注反步兵，整备较快。出战前与火炮配置择一。"), TEXT("German gun crews take their posts inside a captured Mark IV.\nThe five-gun configuration specialises in infantry fire and readies sooner. Choose it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment."), TEXT("德军枪组进入缴获 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n五机枪配置专注反步兵，整备较快。出战前与火炮配置择一。")},
    {TEXT("德军枪组进入缴获 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n五机枪配置专注反步兵，整备较快。出战前与火炮配置择一。"), TEXT("German gun crews take their posts inside a captured Mark IV.\nThe five-gun configuration specialises in infantry fire and readies sooner. Choose it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment."), TEXT("German gun crews take their posts inside a captured Mark IV.\nThe five-gun configuration specialises in infantry fire and readies sooner. Choose it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment.")},
    {TEXT("八处机枪位遮护车体周围的空地。\nA7V 机枪型专注反步兵，整备较快。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。"), TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the hull.\nThe machine-gun A7V specialises in infantry fire with shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active."), TEXT("八处机枪位遮护方形车体周围的空地。\nA7V 少见的机枪配置，专注反步兵、整备较快。同一时间仅能保有一辆 Gretchen。")},
    {TEXT("八处机枪位遮护车体周围的空地。\nA7V 机枪型专注反步兵，整备较快。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。"), TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the hull.\nThe machine-gun A7V specialises in infantry fire with shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active."), TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the box-shaped hull.\nThe rare machine-gun configuration of A7V sacrifices its cannon for infantry fire and shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active at a time.")},
    {TEXT("八处机枪位遮护车体周围的空地。\nA7V 机枪型专注反步兵，整备较快。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。"), TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the hull.\nThe machine-gun A7V specialises in infantry fire with shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active."), TEXT("八处机枪位遮护车体周围的空地。\nA7V 机枪型专注反步兵，整备较快。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。")},
    {TEXT("八处机枪位遮护车体周围的空地。\nA7V 机枪型专注反步兵，整备较快。同一时间只可出动一辆 Gretchen。"), TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the hull.\nThe machine-gun A7V specialises in infantry fire with shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active."), TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the hull.\nThe machine-gun A7V specialises in infantry fire with shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active.")},
    {TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧前进，工具包里装着备件。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障并抢修行走机构。"), TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, spare parts in their tool bags.\nPioneer Escort research brings two engineers with each heavy tank to clear wire and repair running gear."), TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧伴随前进，备件装在工具包中。\n研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，可清障和抢修行走机构。")},
    {TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧前进，工具包里装着备件。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障并抢修行走机构。"), TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, spare parts in their tool bags.\nPioneer Escort research brings two engineers with each heavy tank to clear wire and repair running gear."), TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, with spare track parts close at hand.\nResearch Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. They clear wire and repair running gear without taking another armour slot.")},
    {TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧前进，工具包里装着备件。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障并抢修行走机构。"), TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, spare parts in their tool bags.\nPioneer Escort research brings two engineers with each heavy tank to clear wire and repair running gear."), TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧前进，工具包里装着备件。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障并抢修行走机构。")},
    {TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧前进，工具包里装着备件。\n研究工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克随车配属两名工兵，清障并抢修行走机构。"), TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, spare parts in their tool bags.\nPioneer Escort research brings two engineers with each heavy tank to clear wire and repair running gear."), TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, spare parts in their tool bags.\nPioneer Escort research brings two engineers with each heavy tank to clear wire and repair running gear.")},
    {TEXT("加长车体横越宽壕，侧门与后舱枪位遮护侧翼。\n双炮与四挺 霍奇基斯 支援重型突破，更善跨壕；转向较慢，整备较长。"), TEXT("The lengthened hull crosses broad trenches; side doors and rear guns guard its flanks.\nTwo cannon and four Hotchkiss guns support a heavy breakthrough with greater trench reach, at the cost of slow turns and long readiness."), TEXT("加长车体横越宽壕，新设侧门与后舱枪位遮护车侧。\n双炮、四挺霍奇基斯机枪的重型突破坦克，跨壕能力较强；转向较慢，整备时间较长。")},
    {TEXT("加长车体横越宽壕，侧门与后舱枪位遮护侧翼。\n双炮与四挺 霍奇基斯 支援重型突破，更善跨壕；转向较慢，整备较长。"), TEXT("The lengthened hull crosses broad trenches; side doors and rear guns guard its flanks.\nTwo cannon and four Hotchkiss guns support a heavy breakthrough with greater trench reach, at the cost of slow turns and long readiness."), TEXT("The lengthened hull crosses broad trenches, while new side doors and rear gun positions guard the flanks.\nA heavy breakthrough tank with two cannon and four Hotchkiss machine guns. Greater reach across trenches is paid for by slow turns and a long readiness cycle.")},
