    {TEXT("骑兵军官出身，1915 年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。"), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind."), TEXT("骑兵军官出身，1915年起统率第三集团军。阿拉斯攻势中，他试图以密集炮火打开斯卡普河谷；雪幕下的突进很快又受到德军阵地与补给距离的牵制。")},
    {TEXT("骑兵军官出身，1915 年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。"), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind."), TEXT("A cavalry officer who commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras he sought to open the Scarpe valley with concentrated artillery. The advance through snow soon met the limits imposed by German positions and lengthening supply routes.")},
    {TEXT("骑兵军官出身，1915 年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。"), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind."), TEXT("骑兵军官出身，一九一五年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。")},
