    {TEXT("骑兵军官出身，1915 年起统率第三集团军。他在阿拉斯以密集炮火打开斯卡尔普河谷，雪中推进受阻于德军阵地，补给也落在后面。"), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind."), TEXT("A cavalry officer, he commanded Third Army from 1915. At Arras, concentrated artillery opened the way into the Scarpe valley. The advance through snow met German resistance; supplies fell behind.")},
    {TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。"), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued."), TEXT("一位重视周密准备的集团军司令。梅西讷的地道、炮兵与步兵计划在他麾下合为一体：先夺山脊，再稳固阵地，让反击撞上已经转向的炮口。")},
    {TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。"), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued."), TEXT("An army commander known for thorough preparation. At Messines he brought mining, artillery and infantry plans together: take the ridge, consolidate, then meet the counterattack with guns already trained on its approach.")},
    {TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。"), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued."), TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。")},
    {TEXT("他把地道、炮火与步兵行动纳入周密计划。梅西讷山脊被夺取后，部队就地巩固，以炮火阻击德军反扑。山脊守住了，炮击仍在继续。"), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued."), TEXT("He coordinated mines, artillery and infantry in a carefully prepared attack. After taking Messines Ridge, his troops consolidated their gains under supporting guns. German counterattacks failed to recover the ridge; bombardment continued.")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("1917年，他指挥第五集团军向皮尔肯山脊进攻；1918年春，同一支部队又被拉到漫长的圣康坦正面。从追求突破到掩护撤退，他的战绩始终伴随着激烈争议。")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("He led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge in 1917. In spring 1918 the same army held an extended front around St Quentin. From seeking a breakthrough to covering a retreat, his record remained fiercely disputed.")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("一九一七年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。一九一八年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("In nineteen seventeen, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring nineteen eighteen, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command.")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第五集团军攻向皮尔克姆山脊。1918 年春，部队守卫圣康坦漫长正面，随后后撤。他在那年春天被解除指挥权。"), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command."), TEXT("In 1917, he led Fifth Army towards Pilckem Ridge. In spring 1918, it held an extended front around St Quentin before withdrawing under the German offensive. He was then relieved of command.")},
    {TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。"), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient."), TEXT("曾率加拿大军攻取维米岭，随后接掌第三集团军。康布雷的坦克、步兵与炮火协同显示了新的突破可能；十天后的德军反击，也暴露了突出部难以巩固的代价。")},
    {TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。"), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient."), TEXT("After commanding the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took over Third Army. Cambrai showed the promise of tanks, infantry and artillery working together. The German counterattack ten days later exposed the cost of holding a vulnerable salient.")},
    {TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。"), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient."), TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。")},
    {TEXT("率加拿大军攻下维米岭，后接掌第三集团军。康布雷进攻撕开防线；十天后德军开始反击，随后夺回大片失地，英军收缩突出部。"), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient."), TEXT("After leading the Canadian Corps at Vimy Ridge, he took Third Army. Tanks and infantry breached the line at Cambrai. Ten days later, German counterattacks began; they recovered much of the lost ground and forced the British to shorten their salient.")},
    {TEXT("1918 年 8 月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进，法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August 1918, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme with tanks and guns, while French First Army fought on the southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("1918年8月，他在亚眠组织第四集团军的突击。英国第三军与澳大利亚、加拿大两军分据索姆河两侧，在隐蔽集结与炮坦协同下展开攻势；法国第一集团军在南翼并肩作战。")},
    {TEXT("1918 年 8 月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进，法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August 1918, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme with tanks and guns, while French First Army fought on the southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("He organised Fourth Army's attack at Amiens in August 1918. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced on either side of the Somme after concealed preparations, with coordinated guns and tanks. French First Army fought on the southern flank.")},
    {TEXT("1918 年 8 月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进，法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August 1918, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme with tanks and guns, while French First Army fought on the southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("一九一八年八月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进；法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。")},
    {TEXT("1918 年 8 月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进，法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August 1918, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme with tanks and guns, while French First Army fought on the southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("In August nineteen eighteen, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme after concealed preparations, supported by tanks and guns. French First Army fought on their southern flank. The German front broke.")},
    {TEXT("1918 年 8 月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进，法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。"), TEXT("In August 1918, his Fourth Army attacked at Amiens. British III Corps and the Australian and Canadian corps advanced astride the Somme with tanks and guns, while French First Army fought on the southern flank. The German front broke."), TEXT("1918 年八月，他率第四集团军突击亚眠。英第三军与澳、加两军隐蔽集结，在索姆河两岸以炮坦协同推进，法第一集团军在南翼接战。德军战线被突破。")},
