    {TEXT("这位普奥、普法战争老将于 1917 年 4 月率第六集团军守卫阿拉斯。阵地与预备队未能止住英军最初的突进；他在当月离开前线指挥岗位。"), TEXT("A veteran of the Austro-Prussian and Franco-Prussian wars, he commanded Sixth Army at Arras in April 1917. Its positions and reserves failed to halt the initial British advance. He left his front-line command that month."), TEXT("经历过普奥、普法战争的普鲁士老将。1917年4月，他统率第六集团军面对阿拉斯攻势。阵地与预备队未能及时止住英军最初的突入，他在当月离开前线指挥岗位。")},
    {TEXT("这位普奥、普法战争老将于 1917 年 4 月率第六集团军守卫阿拉斯。阵地与预备队未能止住英军最初的突进；他在当月离开前线指挥岗位。"), TEXT("A veteran of the Austro-Prussian and Franco-Prussian wars, he commanded Sixth Army at Arras in April 1917. Its positions and reserves failed to halt the initial British advance. He left his front-line command that month."), TEXT("A Prussian veteran of the Austro-Prussian and Franco-Prussian wars. Sixth Army faced the Arras offensive under his command in April 1917. Its positions and reserves failed to halt the initial British advance; he left his front-line command that month.")},
