    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第四集团军守卫佛兰德。梅西讷与伊普尔的混凝土据点、纵深阵地和反击部队承受矿爆与炮火；战线在泥地中不断消耗。"), TEXT("In 1917, his Fourth Army defended Flanders. At Messines and Ypres, concrete posts, positions in depth and counterattack troops faced Allied mines and artillery. The fighting in the mud cost his army heavily."), TEXT("1917年指挥第四集团军守卫佛兰德。从梅西讷山脊到伊普尔突出部，他的部队依托混凝土据点、纵深阵地与反击部队抵挡协约国攻势，也承受了矿坑与泥海中的惨重消耗。")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第四集团军守卫佛兰德。梅西讷与伊普尔的混凝土据点、纵深阵地和反击部队承受矿爆与炮火；战线在泥地中不断消耗。"), TEXT("In 1917, his Fourth Army defended Flanders. At Messines and Ypres, concrete posts, positions in depth and counterattack troops faced Allied mines and artillery. The fighting in the mud cost his army heavily."), TEXT("He commanded Fourth Army in Flanders in 1917. From Messines Ridge to the Ypres salient, his troops relied on concrete strongpoints, defence in depth and counterattacks, enduring severe losses among the mine craters and mud.")},
    {TEXT("1917 年，他率第四集团军守卫佛兰德。梅西讷与伊普尔的混凝土据点、纵深阵地和反击部队承受矿爆与炮火；战线在泥地中不断消耗。"), TEXT("In 1917, his Fourth Army defended Flanders. At Messines and Ypres, concrete posts, positions in depth and counterattack troops faced Allied mines and artillery. The fighting in the mud cost his army heavily."), TEXT("一九一七年，他率第四集团军守卫佛兰德。梅西讷与伊普尔的混凝土据点、纵深阵地和反击部队承受矿爆与炮火；战线在泥地中不断消耗。")},
