    {TEXT("他的第二集团军参加了 1917 年康布雷反击与 1918 年春的米夏埃尔攻势。到亚眠，进攻者转为守军，面对协约国炮兵、坦克与步兵的协同突击。"), TEXT("His Second Army fought in the Cambrai counterattack of 1917 and the Michael offensive in spring 1918. At Amiens, the attackers had become defenders, facing coordinated Allied artillery, tanks and infantry."), TEXT("第二集团军司令。1917年康布雷反击、1918年春的迈克尔攻势，都有他麾下部队的身影；到了亚眠，这支军队转而面对协约国的炮兵、坦克和步兵协同突击。")},
    {TEXT("他的第二集团军参加了 1917 年康布雷反击与 1918 年春的米夏埃尔攻势。到亚眠，进攻者转为守军，面对协约国炮兵、坦克与步兵的协同突击。"), TEXT("His Second Army fought in the Cambrai counterattack of 1917 and the Michael offensive in spring 1918. At Amiens, the attackers had become defenders, facing coordinated Allied artillery, tanks and infantry."), TEXT("Commander of Second Army. His formations fought in the Cambrai counterattack of 1917 and Operation Michael in spring 1918. At Amiens they instead faced an Allied assault combining artillery, tanks and infantry.")},
