    {TEXT("1850 年出生，曾率第九军，1917 年秋已指挥第六集团军。利斯河攻势中，部队穿过河沟与道路间的薄弱地段，仍需步兵与补给跟进。攻势最终停顿。"), TEXT("Born in 1850, he had commanded IX Corps and was commanding Sixth Army by autumn 1917. At the Lys, his troops advanced through weak sectors among streams and roads, needing following infantry and supplies. The offensive eventually stopped."), TEXT("1850年出生的步兵将领，先后指挥第九军与近卫军，1917年秋接掌第六集团军。利斯河攻势中，他的部队向河沟与道路间的薄弱地段推进；眼前的快速突入仍需要后续步兵与补给接上。")},
    {TEXT("1850 年出生，曾率第九军，1917 年秋已指挥第六集团军。利斯河攻势中，部队穿过河沟与道路间的薄弱地段，仍需步兵与补给跟进。攻势最终停顿。"), TEXT("Born in 1850, he had commanded IX Corps and was commanding Sixth Army by autumn 1917. At the Lys, his troops advanced through weak sectors among streams and roads, needing following infantry and supplies. The offensive eventually stopped."), TEXT("Born in 1850, Quast commanded IX Corps and the Guard Corps before taking Sixth Army in autumn 1917. During the Lys offensive his troops pressed through weak sectors among streams and roads. Rapid gains still needed following infantry and supplies.")},
