    {TEXT("射手把沉重的 Tankgewehr 抵在肩上，炮塔正在转向这边。"), TEXT("The rifleman braces the heavy Tankgewehr against his shoulder as the turret turns towards him."), TEXT("Tankgewehr 是一支沉重的步枪。拿着它迎击坦克，终究还是步兵面对装甲。")},
