    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · 9 April 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · 9 April 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("坑道兵在梯口摘下油灯，给最后一列人让路。靴底把白垩磨成细粉，墙上箭头指着出口。炮声停了一瞬，头顶落下的灰仍未停。"), TEXT("The tunneller lifts his lamp from the ladder and lets the last file pass. Boots grind the chalk to powder. An arrow on the wall points towards daylight."), TEXT("The tunneller lifts his lamp from the ladder and lets the last file pass. Boots grind the chalk to powder. An arrow on the wall points towards daylight.")},
    {TEXT("坑道兵在梯口摘下油灯，给最后一列人让路。靴底把白垩磨成细粉，墙上箭头指着出口。炮声停了一瞬，头顶落下的灰仍未停。"), TEXT("The tunneller lifts his lamp from the ladder and lets the last file pass. Boots grind the chalk to powder. An arrow on the wall points towards daylight."), TEXT("坑道兵在梯口摘下油灯，给最后一列人让路。靴底把白垩磨成细粉，墙上箭头指着出口。炮声停了一瞬，头顶落下的灰仍未停。")},
    {TEXT("坑道兵在梯口摘下油灯，给最后一列人让路。靴底把白垩磨成细粉，墙上箭头指着出口。炮声停了一瞬，头顶落下的灰仍未停。"), TEXT("The tunneller lifts his lamp from the ladder and lets the last file pass. Boots grind the chalk to powder. An arrow on the wall points towards daylight."), TEXT("城下的坑道里，士兵等着炮火转向远处。雨雪打在白垩坡上。进攻向东展开，牵制当面的德军，接应即将到来的法军攻势。")},
    {TEXT("坑道兵在梯口摘下油灯，给最后一列人让路。靴底把白垩磨成细粉，墙上箭头指着出口。炮声停了一瞬，头顶落下的灰仍未停。"), TEXT("The tunneller lifts his lamp from the ladder and lets the last file pass. Boots grind the chalk to powder. An arrow on the wall points towards daylight."), TEXT("Men wait in the tunnels beneath the town for the guns to lift. Sleet strikes the chalk slopes. The attack goes east to hold the German forces here ahead of the coming French offensive.")},
    {TEXT("他把松动的木撑敲回原位，身后又有人弯腰走来。出口外的雨雪打进灯罩，火苗缩在玻璃后面。地面上的口令传下来，梯上只剩沾泥的脚印。"), TEXT("He knocks a loose prop back into place as more men stoop past him. Sleet reaches the lamp at the exit. An order comes down from above; muddy prints remain on the rungs."), TEXT("He knocks a loose prop back into place as more men stoop past him. Sleet reaches the lamp at the exit. An order comes down from above; muddy prints remain on the rungs.")},
    {TEXT("他把松动的木撑敲回原位，身后又有人弯腰走来。出口外的雨雪打进灯罩，火苗缩在玻璃后面。地面上的口令传下来，梯上只剩沾泥的脚印。"), TEXT("He knocks a loose prop back into place as more men stoop past him. Sleet reaches the lamp at the exit. An order comes down from above; muddy prints remain on the rungs."), TEXT("他把松动的木撑敲回原位，身后又有人弯腰走来。出口外的雨雪打进灯罩，火苗缩在玻璃后面。地面上的口令传下来，梯上只剩沾泥的脚印。")},
    {TEXT("他把松动的木撑敲回原位，身后又有人弯腰走来。出口外的雨雪打进灯罩，火苗缩在玻璃后面。地面上的口令传下来，梯上只剩沾泥的脚印。"), TEXT("He knocks a loose prop back into place as more men stoop past him. Sleet reaches the lamp at the exit. An order comes down from above; muddy prints remain on the rungs."), TEXT("携弹队沿白垩路上行，担架从同一条路下来。坡脊之后传来机枪声，军士把各班的名字再念一遍，前队的回答被炮声盖住。")},
    {TEXT("他把松动的木撑敲回原位，身后又有人弯腰走来。出口外的雨雪打进灯罩，火苗缩在玻璃后面。地面上的口令传下来，梯上只剩沾泥的脚印。"), TEXT("He knocks a loose prop back into place as more men stoop past him. Sleet reaches the lamp at the exit. An order comes down from above; muddy prints remain on the rungs."), TEXT("Ammunition parties go up the chalk road; stretchers come down it. Machine guns answer beyond the crest. The NCO reads out the sections again, but the guns drown the reply from the leading infantry in front.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势与法军埃纳河攻势同属春季作战计划。"), TEXT("Arras and the French attack on the Aisne formed parts of the spring offensive plan."), TEXT("Arras and the French attack on the Aisne formed parts of the spring offensive plan.")},
