    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月12日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · 12 April 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月十二日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月12日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · 12 April 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Roeux · Twelve April nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("修械兵把断了的枪托搁在厂房窗台上，碎玻璃随着射击声往下滑。他从帆布卷里取出螺丝刀，先擦净枪机上的砖粉。另一支步枪已递到手边。"), TEXT("The armourer lays a broken rifle stock on a factory sill. Gunfire shakes glass from the frame. He opens his tool roll and wipes brick dust from the bolt."), TEXT("The armourer lays a broken rifle stock on a factory sill. Gunfire shakes glass from the frame. He opens his tool roll and wipes brick dust from the bolt.")},
    {TEXT("修械兵把断了的枪托搁在厂房窗台上，碎玻璃随着射击声往下滑。他从帆布卷里取出螺丝刀，先擦净枪机上的砖粉。另一支步枪已递到手边。"), TEXT("The armourer lays a broken rifle stock on a factory sill. Gunfire shakes glass from the frame. He opens his tool roll and wipes brick dust from the bolt."), TEXT("修械兵把断了的枪托搁在厂房窗台上，碎玻璃随着射击声往下滑。他从帆布卷里取出螺丝刀，先擦净枪机上的砖粉。另一支步枪已递到手边。")},
    {TEXT("修械兵把断了的枪托搁在厂房窗台上，碎玻璃随着射击声往下滑。他从帆布卷里取出螺丝刀，先擦净枪机上的砖粉。另一支步枪已递到手边。"), TEXT("The armourer lays a broken rifle stock on a factory sill. Gunfire shakes glass from the frame. He opens his tool roll and wipes brick dust from the bolt."), TEXT("厂墙缺口里有机枪开火，弹屑打在铁路堤下。炮击揭开了屋顶，地下掩体却还通着。投弹兵在壕角停下，把手榴弹逐个递向前队。")},
    {TEXT("修械兵把断了的枪托搁在厂房窗台上，碎玻璃随着射击声往下滑。他从帆布卷里取出螺丝刀，先擦净枪机上的砖粉。另一支步枪已递到手边。"), TEXT("The armourer lays a broken rifle stock on a factory sill. Gunfire shakes glass from the frame. He opens his tool roll and wipes brick dust from the bolt."), TEXT("A machine gun fires through a gap in the factory wall. Fragments strike below the railway bank. The roof has gone, but the underground shelters remain connected. Bombers halt at a traverse and pass grenades forward by hand.")},
    {TEXT("地下入口不断有人上来，他挪开工具给他们让路。墙外的机枪重新响起，窗框被打出一排新孔。他把修好的枪交还，窗台上又放下一只开裂的护木。"), TEXT("Men keep climbing from the cellar, forcing him to move his tools. A machine gun starts beyond the wall. He hands back the repaired rifle; a split handguard takes its place."), TEXT("Men keep climbing from the cellar, forcing him to move his tools. A machine gun starts beyond the wall. He hands back the repaired rifle; a split handguard takes its place.")},
    {TEXT("地下入口不断有人上来，他挪开工具给他们让路。墙外的机枪重新响起，窗框被打出一排新孔。他把修好的枪交还，窗台上又放下一只开裂的护木。"), TEXT("Men keep climbing from the cellar, forcing him to move his tools. A machine gun starts beyond the wall. He hands back the repaired rifle; a split handguard takes its place."), TEXT("地下入口不断有人上来，他挪开工具给他们让路。墙外的机枪重新响起，窗框被打出一排新孔。他把修好的枪交还，窗台上又放下一只开裂的护木。")},
    {TEXT("地下入口不断有人上来，他挪开工具给他们让路。墙外的机枪重新响起，窗框被打出一排新孔。他把修好的枪交还，窗台上又放下一只开裂的护木。"), TEXT("Men keep climbing from the cellar, forcing him to move his tools. A machine gun starts beyond the wall. He hands back the repaired rifle; a split handguard takes its place."), TEXT("步枪手伏在碎砖旁，观察两堵残墙之间的空地。携弹队背着箱子挤进交通壕，拐弯处的伤员向墙边让开。工厂里面又传来射击声。")},
    {TEXT("地下入口不断有人上来，他挪开工具给他们让路。墙外的机枪重新响起，窗框被打出一排新孔。他把修好的枪交还，窗台上又放下一只开裂的护木。"), TEXT("Men keep climbing from the cellar, forcing him to move his tools. A machine gun starts beyond the wall. He hands back the repaired rifle; a split handguard takes its place."), TEXT("Riflemen watch the open space between two broken walls. The carrying party squeezes its boxes into the communication trench. A wounded man moves against the bricks to let them through. Firing starts again inside the works.")},
    {TEXT("阿拉斯攻势延续至五月十六日。"), TEXT("The Arras offensive continued until 16 May."), TEXT("The Arras offensive continued until 16 May.")},
