    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 布勒库尔 · 一九一七年五月三日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bullecourt · Three May nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("军邮兵把信袋压在胸前，沿白垩沟跟上前队。铁丝里挂着旧衣片，一封信从袋口滑出。他伏下捡回，封皮已被湿土抹去半个地址。"), TEXT("The post orderly holds his bag against his chest and follows the chalk ditch. Old cloth hangs in the wire. A letter slips out; wet earth covers half the address."), TEXT("The post orderly holds his bag against his chest and follows the chalk ditch. Old cloth hangs in the wire. A letter slips out; wet earth covers half the address.")},
    {TEXT("军邮兵把信袋压在胸前，沿白垩沟跟上前队。铁丝里挂着旧衣片，一封信从袋口滑出。他伏下捡回，封皮已被湿土抹去半个地址。"), TEXT("The post orderly holds his bag against his chest and follows the chalk ditch. Old cloth hangs in the wire. A letter slips out; wet earth covers half the address."), TEXT("军邮兵把信袋压在胸前，沿白垩沟跟上前队。铁丝里挂着旧衣片，一封信从袋口滑出。他伏下捡回，封皮已被湿土抹去半个地址。")},
    {TEXT("军邮兵把信袋压在胸前，沿白垩沟跟上前队。铁丝里挂着旧衣片，一封信从袋口滑出。他伏下捡回，封皮已被湿土抹去半个地址。"), TEXT("The post orderly holds his bag against his chest and follows the chalk ditch. Old cloth hangs in the wire. A letter slips out; wet earth covers half the address."), TEXT("铁丝间留着四月战斗的残骸，新的进攻队又来到缺口前。白垩壕肩后冒出枪口，掩蔽部的出口还通着，投弹兵把枪榴弹送向壕角。")},
    {TEXT("军邮兵把信袋压在胸前，沿白垩沟跟上前队。铁丝里挂着旧衣片，一封信从袋口滑出。他伏下捡回，封皮已被湿土抹去半个地址。"), TEXT("The post orderly holds his bag against his chest and follows the chalk ditch. Old cloth hangs in the wire. A letter slips out; wet earth covers half the address."), TEXT("Wreckage from April lies in the wire. Another assault party reaches the gap. A muzzle appears over the chalk parapet; the dugout exits are open. Rifle grenades fall towards the traverse while the leading men cross the obstacles.")},
    {TEXT("壕角的士兵伸手接信，又缩回去握枪。军邮兵把余下的信袋塞进干处，等枪榴弹声过去。前方递来一只空背包，他翻过姓名牌，把它放到另一边。"), TEXT("A man reaches from a traverse, then takes his rifle again. The orderly puts the letters somewhere dry and waits through the rifle-grenade fire. An empty pack arrives from ahead; he turns over its name tag."), TEXT("A man reaches from a traverse, then takes his rifle again. The orderly puts the letters somewhere dry and waits through the rifle-grenade fire. An empty pack arrives from ahead; he turns over its name tag.")},
    {TEXT("壕角的士兵伸手接信，又缩回去握枪。军邮兵把余下的信袋塞进干处，等枪榴弹声过去。前方递来一只空背包，他翻过姓名牌，把它放到另一边。"), TEXT("A man reaches from a traverse, then takes his rifle again. The orderly puts the letters somewhere dry and waits through the rifle-grenade fire. An empty pack arrives from ahead; he turns over its name tag."), TEXT("壕角的士兵伸手接信，又缩回去握枪。军邮兵把余下的信袋塞进干处，等枪榴弹声过去。前方递来一只空背包，他翻过姓名牌，把它放到另一边。")},
    {TEXT("壕角的士兵伸手接信，又缩回去握枪。军邮兵把余下的信袋塞进干处，等枪榴弹声过去。前方递来一只空背包，他翻过姓名牌，把它放到另一边。"), TEXT("A man reaches from a traverse, then takes his rifle again. The orderly puts the letters somewhere dry and waits through the rifle-grenade fire. An empty pack arrives from ahead; he turns over its name tag."), TEXT("前队已经越过障碍，携弹手的箱子却挂住了断丝。后面的人伏下帮他松开，邻段的射击忽近忽远。军士从弹坑里探头，寻找刚才出发的那一班。")},
    {TEXT("壕角的士兵伸手接信，又缩回去握枪。军邮兵把余下的信袋塞进干处，等枪榴弹声过去。前方递来一只空背包，他翻过姓名牌，把它放到另一边。"), TEXT("A man reaches from a traverse, then takes his rifle again. The orderly puts the letters somewhere dry and waits through the rifle-grenade fire. An empty pack arrives from ahead; he turns over its name tag."), TEXT("A bearer's box catches on a strand behind them. The next man lies down to free it. Firing rises and falls on the neighbouring sector. From a shell hole, the NCO searches for the section that has just gone forward.")},
    {TEXT("澳大利亚与英国部队于五月再攻布勒库尔。"), TEXT("Australian and British troops attacked Bullecourt again in May."), TEXT("Australian and British troops attacked Bullecourt again in May.")},
