    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把图板支在新坑岸上，旧图里的树和壕角已对不上。他擦掉一条线，从露出的白垩层重新量起。炮兵联络官站在旁边，铅笔还悬在纸上。"), TEXT("The surveyor sets his board on a fresh crater lip. Trees and trench corners no longer match his sheet. He rubs out a line and measures from the exposed chalk."), TEXT("The surveyor sets his board on a fresh crater lip. Trees and trench corners no longer match his sheet. He rubs out a line and measures from the exposed chalk.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把图板支在新坑岸上，旧图里的树和壕角已对不上。他擦掉一条线，从露出的白垩层重新量起。炮兵联络官站在旁边，铅笔还悬在纸上。"), TEXT("The surveyor sets his board on a fresh crater lip. Trees and trench corners no longer match his sheet. He rubs out a line and measures from the exposed chalk."), TEXT("测绘员把图板支在新坑岸上，旧图里的树和壕角已对不上。他擦掉一条线，从露出的白垩层重新量起。炮兵联络官站在旁边，铅笔还悬在纸上。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把图板支在新坑岸上，旧图里的树和壕角已对不上。他擦掉一条线，从露出的白垩层重新量起。炮兵联络官站在旁边，铅笔还悬在纸上。"), TEXT("The surveyor sets his board on a fresh crater lip. Trees and trench corners no longer match his sheet. He rubs out a line and measures from the exposed chalk."), TEXT("地面猛然抬起，山脊的旧壕道没入烟尘。普卢默的第二集团军向前推进，澳新部队在邻段出发。军士循着刚露出的坑岸，寻找通往高处的路。")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把图板支在新坑岸上，旧图里的树和壕角已对不上。他擦掉一条线，从露出的白垩层重新量起。炮兵联络官站在旁边，铅笔还悬在纸上。"), TEXT("The surveyor sets his board on a fresh crater lip. Trees and trench corners no longer match his sheet. He rubs out a line and measures from the exposed chalk."), TEXT("The ground rises and the old ridge trenches vanish into dust. Plumer's Second Army advances; Australian and New Zealand troops move on the adjoining sectors. The NCO follows the fresh crater lip, looking for a passage onto the heights.")},
    {TEXT("测绘员把图板支在新坑岸上，旧图里的树和壕角已对不上。他擦掉一条线，从露出的白垩层重新量起。炮兵联络官站在旁边，铅笔还悬在纸上。"), TEXT("The surveyor sets his board on a fresh crater lip. Trees and trench corners no longer match his sheet. He rubs out a line and measures from the exposed chalk."), TEXT("The ground rises and the old ridge trenches vanish into dust. Plumer’s Second Army advances; Australian and New Zealand troops move on the adjoining sectors. The NCO follows the fresh crater lip, looking for a passage onto the heights.")},
    {TEXT("皮尺从松土上拖过，读数的人几次滑到坑底。测绘员把新路画在旧壕旁，留下通向脊顶的箭头。枪架沿那条路抬过去，靴底把纸边踩进了泥里。"), TEXT("The tape drags over loose earth; the reader keeps slipping downhill. A new path goes onto the sheet beside the old trench. A gun mounting passes that way, and a boot presses the paper edge into the mud."), TEXT("The tape drags over loose earth; the reader keeps slipping downhill. A new path goes onto the sheet beside the old trench. A gun mounting passes that way, and a boot presses the paper edge into the mud.")},
    {TEXT("皮尺从松土上拖过，读数的人几次滑到坑底。测绘员把新路画在旧壕旁，留下通向脊顶的箭头。枪架沿那条路抬过去，靴底把纸边踩进了泥里。"), TEXT("The tape drags over loose earth; the reader keeps slipping downhill. A new path goes onto the sheet beside the old trench. A gun mounting passes that way, and a boot presses the paper edge into the mud."), TEXT("皮尺从松土上拖过，读数的人几次滑到坑底。测绘员把新路画在旧壕旁，留下通向脊顶的箭头。枪架沿那条路抬过去，靴底把纸边踩进了泥里。")},
    {TEXT("皮尺从松土上拖过，读数的人几次滑到坑底。测绘员把新路画在旧壕旁，留下通向脊顶的箭头。枪架沿那条路抬过去，靴底把纸边踩进了泥里。"), TEXT("The tape drags over loose earth; the reader keeps slipping downhill. A new path goes onto the sheet beside the old trench. A gun mounting passes that way, and a boot presses the paper edge into the mud."), TEXT("枪组把枪架拖过松土，携弹手试着踩出一条硬路。原先标定的地形已经改变，担架队在后面停住，等前队报回尚能通行的缺口。")},
    {TEXT("皮尺从松土上拖过，读数的人几次滑到坑底。测绘员把新路画在旧壕旁，留下通向脊顶的箭头。枪架沿那条路抬过去，靴底把纸边踩进了泥里。"), TEXT("The tape drags over loose earth; the reader keeps slipping downhill. A new path goes onto the sheet beside the old trench. A gun mounting passes that way, and a boot presses the paper edge into the mud."), TEXT("The gun crew drags its mounting over loose earth. A bearer tests each step for firm ground. The landmarks on the sketch have gone. Behind them, the stretcher party waits for word of a gap that will carry a loaded stretcher.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack."), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack."), TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷进攻以地下爆破摧毁山脊上的德军阵位。"), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions at the opening of the Messines attack."), TEXT("Underground mines destroyed German ridge positions as the Messines attack opened.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 9 June 1917")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月9日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月九日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Messines Ridge · Nine June nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("木工从毁坏掩体里拖出一根还可用的横梁，锯口里全是砂土。他用钉拔把弯钉取下，钉在新胸墙后面。山脊另一侧又有炮弹落下。"), TEXT("The carpenter drags a usable beam from a ruined dugout. Grit fills the saw cut. He pulls out bent nails and drives them into the new parapet supports."), TEXT("The carpenter drags a usable beam from a ruined dugout. Grit fills the saw cut. He pulls out bent nails and drives them into the new parapet supports.")},
    {TEXT("木工从毁坏掩体里拖出一根还可用的横梁，锯口里全是砂土。他用钉拔把弯钉取下，钉在新胸墙后面。山脊另一侧又有炮弹落下。"), TEXT("The carpenter drags a usable beam from a ruined dugout. Grit fills the saw cut. He pulls out bent nails and drives them into the new parapet supports."), TEXT("木工从毁坏掩体里拖出一根还可用的横梁，锯口里全是砂土。他用钉拔把弯钉取下，钉在新胸墙后面。山脊另一侧又有炮弹落下。")},
    {TEXT("木工从毁坏掩体里拖出一根还可用的横梁，锯口里全是砂土。他用钉拔把弯钉取下，钉在新胸墙后面。山脊另一侧又有炮弹落下。"), TEXT("The carpenter drags a usable beam from a ruined dugout. Grit fills the saw cut. He pulls out bent nails and drives them into the new parapet supports."), TEXT("新胸墙还缺着一角，枪组已把枪口转向东坡。进攻过去两日，阵地上的铁锹没有停过。换防队循弹坑间的小路上来，先问哪一道壕沟还能走。")},
    {TEXT("木工从毁坏掩体里拖出一根还可用的横梁，锯口里全是砂土。他用钉拔把弯钉取下，钉在新胸墙后面。山脊另一侧又有炮弹落下。"), TEXT("The carpenter drags a usable beam from a ruined dugout. Grit fills the saw cut. He pulls out bent nails and drives them into the new parapet supports."), TEXT("A corner is missing from the new parapet. The gun already faces the eastern slope. Two days have passed since the attack, and spades are still at work. Reliefs follow the crater path and ask which trench remains open.")},
    {TEXT("换防队从窄处经过，他把半锯的木料竖到墙边。新枪位缺一块踏板，旧门板便被截成两段。机枪转向东坡时，他蹲在下面把最后一枚钉子敲平。"), TEXT("Reliefs pass the narrow opening, so he stands his timber against the wall. A missing step is cut from an old door. When the gun turns towards the eastern slope, he flattens the last nail beneath it."), TEXT("Reliefs pass the narrow opening, so he stands his timber against the wall. A missing step is cut from an old door. When the gun turns towards the eastern slope, he flattens the last nail beneath it.")},
    {TEXT("换防队从窄处经过，他把半锯的木料竖到墙边。新枪位缺一块踏板，旧门板便被截成两段。机枪转向东坡时，他蹲在下面把最后一枚钉子敲平。"), TEXT("Reliefs pass the narrow opening, so he stands his timber against the wall. A missing step is cut from an old door. When the gun turns towards the eastern slope, he flattens the last nail beneath it."), TEXT("换防队从窄处经过，他把半锯的木料竖到墙边。新枪位缺一块踏板，旧门板便被截成两段。机枪转向东坡时，他蹲在下面把最后一枚钉子敲平。")},
    {TEXT("换防队从窄处经过，他把半锯的木料竖到墙边。新枪位缺一块踏板，旧门板便被截成两段。机枪转向东坡时，他蹲在下面把最后一枚钉子敲平。"), TEXT("Reliefs pass the narrow opening, so he stands his timber against the wall. A missing step is cut from an old door. When the gun turns towards the eastern slope, he flattens the last nail beneath it."), TEXT("预备队在脊后集合，携弹手从伤员身旁挤过。德军在对面坡下活动，军士伏在新垒的土袋间观察。壕底还有旧枪架留下的凹痕。")},
    {TEXT("换防队从窄处经过，他把半锯的木料竖到墙边。新枪位缺一块踏板，旧门板便被截成两段。机枪转向东坡时，他蹲在下面把最后一枚钉子敲平。"), TEXT("Reliefs pass the narrow opening, so he stands his timber against the wall. A missing step is cut from an old door. When the gun turns towards the eastern slope, he flattens the last nail beneath it."), TEXT("Reserves gather behind the crest. Bearers edge past the wounded with their ammunition. German parties move below the opposite slope. The NCO watches through the fresh sandbags; the floor still bears the marks of the former gun mounting.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("British forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("British forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack.")},
    {TEXT("梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。"), TEXT("British forces captured Messines Ridge in the June attack."), TEXT("梅西讷山脊在六月的进攻中落入英军之手。")},
