    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("驭手拉住缰绳，骡子的前蹄已陷过木板边缘。炮弹箱在驮架上向一侧倾斜，他割断结绳，让后面的人逐只接走。积水里浮着刚折断的木片。"), TEXT("The driver checks the reins as a mule steps off the duckboards. Its load tips sideways. He cuts the lashings so men behind can take the boxes one at a time."), TEXT("The driver checks the reins as a mule steps off the duckboards. Its load tips sideways. He cuts the lashings so men behind can take the boxes one at a time.")},
    {TEXT("驭手拉住缰绳，骡子的前蹄已陷过木板边缘。炮弹箱在驮架上向一侧倾斜，他割断结绳，让后面的人逐只接走。积水里浮着刚折断的木片。"), TEXT("The driver checks the reins as a mule steps off the duckboards. Its load tips sideways. He cuts the lashings so men behind can take the boxes one at a time."), TEXT("驭手拉住缰绳，骡子的前蹄已陷过木板边缘。炮弹箱在驮架上向一侧倾斜，他割断结绳，让后面的人逐只接走。积水里浮着刚折断的木片。")},
    {TEXT("驭手拉住缰绳，骡子的前蹄已陷过木板边缘。炮弹箱在驮架上向一侧倾斜，他割断结绳，让后面的人逐只接走。积水里浮着刚折断的木片。"), TEXT("The driver checks the reins as a mule steps off the duckboards. Its load tips sideways. He cuts the lashings so men behind can take the boxes one at a time."), TEXT("木板路在积水中断开，前队停在最后一块木板上。城外的排水沟已经被炮火打坏，弹坑连成水面。远处德军枪位开火，水上浮着新溅起的泥。")},
    {TEXT("驭手拉住缰绳，骡子的前蹄已陷过木板边缘。炮弹箱在驮架上向一侧倾斜，他割断结绳，让后面的人逐只接走。积水里浮着刚折断的木片。"), TEXT("The driver checks the reins as a mule steps off the duckboards. Its load tips sideways. He cuts the lashings so men behind can take the boxes one at a time."), TEXT("The duckboards end in standing water. The leading men stop on the last plank. Shellfire has broken the drains outside the town and joined the craters into pools. A German gun opens beyond them; fresh mud splashes onto the surface.")},
    {TEXT("空驮架减轻了重量，骡子仍不肯迈出那一步。驭手摸到颈下，把绳子绕过硬桩慢慢牵回。路上让出一点空处，后一匹骡子又低头闻了闻水面。"), TEXT("The empty pack is lighter, but the mule will not move. He leads it back slowly with a rope around a firm post. The track clears a little; the next animal lowers its muzzle towards the water."), TEXT("The empty pack is lighter, but the mule will not move. He leads it back slowly with a rope around a firm post. The track clears a little; the next animal lowers its muzzle towards the water.")},
    {TEXT("空驮架减轻了重量，骡子仍不肯迈出那一步。驭手摸到颈下，把绳子绕过硬桩慢慢牵回。路上让出一点空处，后一匹骡子又低头闻了闻水面。"), TEXT("The empty pack is lighter, but the mule will not move. He leads it back slowly with a rope around a firm post. The track clears a little; the next animal lowers its muzzle towards the water."), TEXT("空驮架减轻了重量，骡子仍不肯迈出那一步。驭手摸到颈下，把绳子绕过硬桩慢慢牵回。路上让出一点空处，后一匹骡子又低头闻了闻水面。")},
    {TEXT("空驮架减轻了重量，骡子仍不肯迈出那一步。驭手摸到颈下，把绳子绕过硬桩慢慢牵回。路上让出一点空处，后一匹骡子又低头闻了闻水面。"), TEXT("The empty pack is lighter, but the mule will not move. He leads it back slowly with a rope around a firm post. The track clears a little; the next animal lowers its muzzle towards the water."), TEXT("壕炮组带着器材赶来，野炮还堵在后面的路上。携弹手把箱子举过水面，伤员坐在路边等待。军士试过脚下的硬地，才让下一人跨出。")},
    {TEXT("空驮架减轻了重量，骡子仍不肯迈出那一步。驭手摸到颈下，把绳子绕过硬桩慢慢牵回。路上让出一点空处，后一匹骡子又低头闻了闻水面。"), TEXT("The empty pack is lighter, but the mule will not move. He leads it back slowly with a rope around a firm post. The track clears a little; the next animal lowers its muzzle towards the water."), TEXT("The mortar crew brings its equipment forward. Field guns are caught on the road behind. Bearers lift their boxes above the water, passing wounded men seated beside the path. The NCO tests the ground before the next man steps off.")},
    {TEXT("第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。"), TEXT("The Third Battle of Ypres began on 31 July."), TEXT("The Third Battle of Ypres began on 31 July.")},
    {TEXT("第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。"), TEXT("The Third Battle of Ypres began on 31 July."), TEXT("第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。")},
    {TEXT("第三次伊普尔战役于七月三十一日开始。"), TEXT("The Third Battle of Ypres began on 31 July."), TEXT("The Third Battle of Ypres began on thirty-one July.")},
