    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月16日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · 16 August 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月16日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月16日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · 16 August 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月十六日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月16日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · 16 August 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Langemarck · Sixteen August nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("摄影兵在农舍残墙后架起相机，地脚陷进一只旧弹坑。他把镜头朝向混凝土射孔，等烟从墙前散开。快门布上沾着雨水，手指一直扶在边缘。"), TEXT("The photographer sets his camera behind a farm wall. A tripod foot sinks into an old crater. He points towards the concrete loophole and waits for the smoke to clear."), TEXT("The photographer sets his camera behind a farm wall. A tripod foot sinks into an old crater. He points towards the concrete loophole and waits for the smoke to clear.")},
    {TEXT("摄影兵在农舍残墙后架起相机，地脚陷进一只旧弹坑。他把镜头朝向混凝土射孔，等烟从墙前散开。快门布上沾着雨水，手指一直扶在边缘。"), TEXT("The photographer sets his camera behind a farm wall. A tripod foot sinks into an old crater. He points towards the concrete loophole and waits for the smoke to clear."), TEXT("摄影兵在农舍残墙后架起相机，地脚陷进一只旧弹坑。他把镜头朝向混凝土射孔，等烟从墙前散开。快门布上沾着雨水，手指一直扶在边缘。")},
    {TEXT("摄影兵在农舍残墙后架起相机，地脚陷进一只旧弹坑。他把镜头朝向混凝土射孔，等烟从墙前散开。快门布上沾着雨水，手指一直扶在边缘。"), TEXT("The photographer sets his camera behind a farm wall. A tripod foot sinks into an old crater. He points towards the concrete loophole and waits for the smoke to clear."), TEXT("农舍只剩一面墙，墙后的混凝土掩体仍在射击。前队沿湿田接近，邻队的钢盔隔着积水时隐时现。观察员伏在碎砖上，辨认射孔的位置。")},
    {TEXT("摄影兵在农舍残墙后架起相机，地脚陷进一只旧弹坑。他把镜头朝向混凝土射孔，等烟从墙前散开。快门布上沾着雨水，手指一直扶在边缘。"), TEXT("The photographer sets his camera behind a farm wall. A tripod foot sinks into an old crater. He points towards the concrete loophole and waits for the smoke to clear."), TEXT("One wall remains of the farmhouse. A concrete shelter behind it is still firing. Men approach across the wet field; helmets on the next sector appear and disappear beyond the pools. The observer lies on broken bricks, searching for the loophole.")},
    {TEXT("一个小队沿窄路经过，相机前只留下摇动的草茎。他收起三脚架，从碎砖间换到另一处墙角。掩体再次开火，取景框里便只剩压低的钢盔。"), TEXT("A section passes on the narrow track, leaving grass moving in the frame. He carries the tripod to another corner among the bricks. The shelter fires again; helmets disappear below the edge of the view."), TEXT("A section passes on the narrow track, leaving grass moving in the frame. He carries the tripod to another corner among the bricks. The shelter fires again; helmets disappear below the edge of the view.")},
    {TEXT("一个小队沿窄路经过，相机前只留下摇动的草茎。他收起三脚架，从碎砖间换到另一处墙角。掩体再次开火，取景框里便只剩压低的钢盔。"), TEXT("A section passes on the narrow track, leaving grass moving in the frame. He carries the tripod to another corner among the bricks. The shelter fires again; helmets disappear below the edge of the view."), TEXT("一个小队沿窄路经过，相机前只留下摇动的草茎。他收起三脚架，从碎砖间换到另一处墙角。掩体再次开火，取景框里便只剩压低的钢盔。")},
    {TEXT("一个小队沿窄路经过，相机前只留下摇动的草茎。他收起三脚架，从碎砖间换到另一处墙角。掩体再次开火，取景框里便只剩压低的钢盔。"), TEXT("A section passes on the narrow track, leaving grass moving in the frame. He carries the tripod to another corner among the bricks. The shelter fires again; helmets disappear below the edge of the view."), TEXT("迫击炮弹由后方传来，一箱接着一箱。通往农场的硬路很窄，担架队已在路边停下。军士把手举过残墙，让失去联系的步枪手看见。")},
    {TEXT("一个小队沿窄路经过，相机前只留下摇动的草茎。他收起三脚架，从碎砖间换到另一处墙角。掩体再次开火，取景框里便只剩压低的钢盔。"), TEXT("A section passes on the narrow track, leaving grass moving in the frame. He carries the tripod to another corner among the bricks. The shelter fires again; helmets disappear below the edge of the view."), TEXT("Mortar ammunition arrives from the rear, box after box. The firm track to the farm is narrow. A stretcher party has stopped beside it. The NCO raises a hand over the wall for riflemen who have lost contact.")},
    {TEXT("伊普尔攻势直到秋季仍未取得预期突破。"), TEXT("The Ypres offensive failed to achieve its intended breakthrough."), TEXT("The Ypres offensive failed to achieve its intended breakthrough.")},
