    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月20日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · 20 September 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月20日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月20日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · 20 September 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月二十日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月20日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · 20 September 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Menin Road · Twenty September nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络兵把新地图摊在树桩上，手指沿弹幕线往前移。林地深处的爆炸还在继续，步兵已经越过浅脊。电话受话器里传来一句话，他把它写到湿纸边上。"), TEXT("The liaison runner spreads a new map on a stump. His finger follows the barrage line. Explosions continue deeper in the wood while infantry cross the low ridge."), TEXT("The liaison runner spreads a new map on a stump. His finger follows the barrage line. Explosions continue deeper in the wood while infantry cross the low ridge.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络兵把新地图摊在树桩上，手指沿弹幕线往前移。林地深处的爆炸还在继续，步兵已经越过浅脊。电话受话器里传来一句话，他把它写到湿纸边上。"), TEXT("The liaison runner spreads a new map on a stump. His finger follows the barrage line. Explosions continue deeper in the wood while infantry cross the low ridge."), TEXT("炮兵联络兵把新地图摊在树桩上，手指沿弹幕线往前移。林地深处的爆炸还在继续，步兵已经越过浅脊。电话受话器里传来一句话，他把它写到湿纸边上。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络兵把新地图摊在树桩上，手指沿弹幕线往前移。林地深处的爆炸还在继续，步兵已经越过浅脊。电话受话器里传来一句话，他把它写到湿纸边上。"), TEXT("The liaison runner spreads a new map on a stump. His finger follows the barrage line. Explosions continue deeper in the wood while infantry cross the low ridge."), TEXT("树桩之间落着刚翻起的土，炮火正向林地深处移动。前队越过一道浅脊，邻班便从视野中消失。枪组停下来，把枪架放在残根之间。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络兵把新地图摊在树桩上，手指沿弹幕线往前移。林地深处的爆炸还在继续，步兵已经越过浅脊。电话受话器里传来一句话，他把它写到湿纸边上。"), TEXT("The liaison runner spreads a new map on a stump. His finger follows the barrage line. Explosions continue deeper in the wood while infantry cross the low ridge."), TEXT("Fresh earth falls between the stumps as the barrage moves deeper into the wood. The leading men cross a low ridge and lose sight of the next section. The gun crew sets its mounting among the exposed roots.")},
    {TEXT("线从残根间穿过，一处被靴跟扯紧。联络兵弯腰放松线圈，把受话器交给身旁的人。新占的枪位开始挖土，他在图上给那一角添了一个小方框。"), TEXT("A boot pulls the telephone wire tight among the roots. He releases another coil and hands over the receiver. Men start digging at the captured gun post; a small square is added to his map."), TEXT("A boot pulls the telephone wire tight among the roots. He releases another coil and hands over the receiver. Men start digging at the captured gun post; a small square is added to his map.")},
    {TEXT("线从残根间穿过，一处被靴跟扯紧。联络兵弯腰放松线圈，把受话器交给身旁的人。新占的枪位开始挖土，他在图上给那一角添了一个小方框。"), TEXT("A boot pulls the telephone wire tight among the roots. He releases another coil and hands over the receiver. Men start digging at the captured gun post; a small square is added to his map."), TEXT("线从残根间穿过，一处被靴跟扯紧。联络兵弯腰放松线圈，把受话器交给身旁的人。新占的枪位开始挖土，他在图上给那一角添了一个小方框。")},
    {TEXT("线从残根间穿过，一处被靴跟扯紧。联络兵弯腰放松线圈，把受话器交给身旁的人。新占的枪位开始挖土，他在图上给那一角添了一个小方框。"), TEXT("A boot pulls the telephone wire tight among the roots. He releases another coil and hands over the receiver. Men start digging at the captured gun post; a small square is added to his map."), TEXT("携弹队还带着铁锹，新占的地段来不及挖深。德军哨位在断木后射击，后面的道路又有增援上来。步枪手把枯枝拨开，枪口朝着林缘。")},
    {TEXT("线从残根间穿过，一处被靴跟扯紧。联络兵弯腰放松线圈，把受话器交给身旁的人。新占的枪位开始挖土，他在图上给那一角添了一个小方框。"), TEXT("A boot pulls the telephone wire tight among the roots. He releases another coil and hands over the receiver. Men start digging at the captured gun post; a small square is added to his map."), TEXT("Bearers bring spades with the ammunition. There has been little time to deepen the captured position. German posts fire from behind broken timber. More men arrive along the crowded track. A rifleman pushes dead branches aside and points his muzzle towards the tree line.")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery.")},
    {TEXT("梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。"), TEXT("The Menin Road attack used limited advances supported by artillery."), TEXT("梅宁路进攻采用炮火支援下的有限推进。")},
