    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 1917年11月20日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · 20 November 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 一九一七年十一月二十日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷 · 1917年11月20日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · 20 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai · Twenty November nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员隔着狭缝看见铁丝倒下，履带咬住干硬的土。车里有人拍了两下隔板，炮组开始转动炮尾。发动机震得水壶碰响，外面的步兵时隐时现。"), TEXT("Through his slit, the driver sees wire fall beneath the tracks. Firm earth holds the tank. Two knocks sound on the partition and the gun crew shifts its breech."), TEXT("Through his slit, the driver sees wire fall beneath the tracks. Firm earth holds the tank. Two knocks sound on the partition and the gun crew shifts its breech.")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员隔着狭缝看见铁丝倒下，履带咬住干硬的土。车里有人拍了两下隔板，炮组开始转动炮尾。发动机震得水壶碰响，外面的步兵时隐时现。"), TEXT("Through his slit, the driver sees wire fall beneath the tracks. Firm earth holds the tank. Two knocks sound on the partition and the gun crew shifts its breech."), TEXT("驾驶员隔着狭缝看见铁丝倒下，履带咬住干硬的土。车里有人拍了两下隔板，炮组开始转动炮尾。发动机震得水壶碰响，外面的步兵时隐时现。")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员隔着狭缝看见铁丝倒下，履带咬住干硬的土。车里有人拍了两下隔板，炮组开始转动炮尾。发动机震得水壶碰响，外面的步兵时隐时现。"), TEXT("Through his slit, the driver sees wire fall beneath the tracks. Firm earth holds the tank. Two knocks sound on the partition and the gun crew shifts its breech."), TEXT("履带压进坚实田地，铁丝在战车前面倒下。步兵跟着Mark IV来到壕边，壕底的转角却还在射击。炮声盖过发动机，前车已越过下一道障碍。")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员隔着狭缝看见铁丝倒下，履带咬住干硬的土。车里有人拍了两下隔板，炮组开始转动炮尾。发动机震得水壶碰响，外面的步兵时隐时现。"), TEXT("Through his slit, the driver sees wire fall beneath the tracks. Firm earth holds the tank. Two knocks sound on the partition and the gun crew shifts its breech."), TEXT("Tracks bite into firm ground and wire falls before the tanks. Infantry follow a Mark IV to the trench, but a bend below is still firing. The guns drown the engine. The leading tank has crossed another obstacle.")},
    {TEXT("深壕来到车头下，他压住操纵杆，等车身越过断边。侧舷传来急促敲击，驾驶员把车速放慢。视缝里重新出现道路，路边一只钢盔指向仍在射击的壕角。"), TEXT("A deep trench comes under the nose; he holds the controls until the hull crosses its edge. Sharp knocks sound against the side. He slows down as a helmet beside the road points towards a firing traverse."), TEXT("A deep trench comes under the nose; he holds the controls until the hull crosses its edge. Sharp knocks sound against the side. He slows down as a helmet beside the road points towards a firing traverse.")},
    {TEXT("深壕来到车头下，他压住操纵杆，等车身越过断边。侧舷传来急促敲击，驾驶员把车速放慢。视缝里重新出现道路，路边一只钢盔指向仍在射击的壕角。"), TEXT("A deep trench comes under the nose; he holds the controls until the hull crosses its edge. Sharp knocks sound against the side. He slows down as a helmet beside the road points towards a firing traverse."), TEXT("深壕来到车头下，他压住操纵杆，等车身越过断边。侧舷传来急促敲击，驾驶员把车速放慢。视缝里重新出现道路，路边一只钢盔指向仍在射击的壕角。")},
    {TEXT("深壕来到车头下，他压住操纵杆，等车身越过断边。侧舷传来急促敲击，驾驶员把车速放慢。视缝里重新出现道路，路边一只钢盔指向仍在射击的壕角。"), TEXT("A deep trench comes under the nose; he holds the controls until the hull crosses its edge. Sharp knocks sound against the side. He slows down as a helmet beside the road points towards a firing traverse."), TEXT("步枪手伏在履带留下的沟里，投弹兵向掩蔽部接近。携弹队从缺口进入，先来的人员指着深壕让他们绕行。战车的背影逐渐被坡脊遮住。")},
    {TEXT("深壕来到车头下，他压住操纵杆，等车身越过断边。侧舷传来急促敲击，驾驶员把车速放慢。视缝里重新出现道路，路边一只钢盔指向仍在射击的壕角。"), TEXT("A deep trench comes under the nose; he holds the controls until the hull crosses its edge. Sharp knocks sound against the side. He slows down as a helmet beside the road points towards a firing traverse."), TEXT("Riflemen lie in the track marks while bombers approach a dugout. Bearers enter through the gap with their boxes. Men already across point out the deep trench and direct them around it. The tank disappears behind the next rise.")},
    {TEXT("英军在康布雷集中使用坦克突破兴登堡防线。"), TEXT("Britain massed tanks against the Hindenburg Line at Cambrai."), TEXT("Britain massed tanks against the Hindenburg Line at Cambrai.")},
    {TEXT("英军在康布雷集中使用坦克突破兴登堡防线。"), TEXT("Britain massed tanks against the Hindenburg Line at Cambrai."), TEXT("英军在康布雷集中使用坦克突破兴登堡防线。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("军医在林口废屋里铺开器械，门板上落着树皮和尘土。刚送来的人握着一截断带，另一只手仍在发抖。他把水倒进搪瓷盆，盆底很快看不清了。"), TEXT("The medical officer opens his instruments in a ruined house at the wood edge. Bark and dust cover the door. A newly arrived man grips a broken strap with a shaking hand."), TEXT("The medical officer opens his instruments in a ruined house at the wood edge. Bark and dust cover the door. A newly arrived man grips a broken strap with a shaking hand.")},
    {TEXT("军医在林口废屋里铺开器械，门板上落着树皮和尘土。刚送来的人握着一截断带，另一只手仍在发抖。他把水倒进搪瓷盆，盆底很快看不清了。"), TEXT("The medical officer opens his instruments in a ruined house at the wood edge. Bark and dust cover the door. A newly arrived man grips a broken strap with a shaking hand."), TEXT("军医在林口废屋里铺开器械，门板上落着树皮和尘土。刚送来的人握着一截断带，另一只手仍在发抖。他把水倒进搪瓷盆，盆底很快看不清了。")},
    {TEXT("军医在林口废屋里铺开器械，门板上落着树皮和尘土。刚送来的人握着一截断带，另一只手仍在发抖。他把水倒进搪瓷盆，盆底很快看不清了。"), TEXT("The medical officer opens his instruments in a ruined house at the wood edge. Bark and dust cover the door. A newly arrived man grips a broken strap with a shaking hand."), TEXT("林口的机枪转了方向，弹带横过刚堆好的土袋。德军反击正在逼近，换防人员和携弹队还往林中走。撤下来的伤员在路口迎面遇见他们。")},
    {TEXT("军医在林口废屋里铺开器械，门板上落着树皮和尘土。刚送来的人握着一截断带，另一只手仍在发抖。他把水倒进搪瓷盆，盆底很快看不清了。"), TEXT("The medical officer opens his instruments in a ruined house at the wood edge. Bark and dust cover the door. A newly arrived man grips a broken strap with a shaking hand."), TEXT("The gun at the woodland exit changes direction. Its belt crosses newly stacked sandbags. German counterattacks are closing in while reliefs and ammunition parties still enter the wood. Wounded men meet them at the junction.")},
    {TEXT("外面的枪位换了方向，门口的人便把桌子推向墙边。军医剪开湿透的袖口，让助手换上干布。下一名伤员停在门外，靴上的泥沿台阶慢慢落下。"), TEXT("The gun outside changes direction, and the table is pushed against the wall. He cuts a wet sleeve open and asks for dry cloth. Another casualty waits outside; mud falls slowly from his boots onto the step."), TEXT("The gun outside changes direction, and the table is pushed against the wall. He cuts a wet sleeve open and asks for dry cloth. Another casualty waits outside; mud falls slowly from his boots onto the step.")},
    {TEXT("外面的枪位换了方向，门口的人便把桌子推向墙边。军医剪开湿透的袖口，让助手换上干布。下一名伤员停在门外，靴上的泥沿台阶慢慢落下。"), TEXT("The gun outside changes direction, and the table is pushed against the wall. He cuts a wet sleeve open and asks for dry cloth. Another casualty waits outside; mud falls slowly from his boots onto the step."), TEXT("外面的枪位换了方向，门口的人便把桌子推向墙边。军医剪开湿透的袖口，让助手换上干布。下一名伤员停在门外，靴上的泥沿台阶慢慢落下。")},
    {TEXT("外面的枪位换了方向，门口的人便把桌子推向墙边。军医剪开湿透的袖口，让助手换上干布。下一名伤员停在门外，靴上的泥沿台阶慢慢落下。"), TEXT("The gun outside changes direction, and the table is pushed against the wall. He cuts a wet sleeve open and asks for dry cloth. Another casualty waits outside; mud falls slowly from his boots onto the step."), TEXT("断树后传来步枪声，浅洼遮住侧翼的动静。军士把返回的人引进交通壕，再让前送的队伍通过。担架的木柄擦过壕壁，刮下一层湿土。")},
    {TEXT("外面的枪位换了方向，门口的人便把桌子推向墙边。军医剪开湿透的袖口，让助手换上干布。下一名伤员停在门外，靴上的泥沿台阶慢慢落下。"), TEXT("The gun outside changes direction, and the table is pushed against the wall. He cuts a wet sleeve open and asks for dry cloth. Another casualty waits outside; mud falls slowly from his boots onto the step."), TEXT("Rifle fire comes from behind broken trees. A hollow conceals the flank. The NCO guides returning men into the communication trench, then lets the carrying party through. A stretcher handle scrapes wet earth from the wall; the bearers turn it carefully at the bend.")},
    {TEXT("德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai.")},
    {TEXT("德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."), TEXT("德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。")},
    {TEXT("德军反击收复了英军在康布雷取得的部分土地。"), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the British gains at Cambrai."), TEXT("The German counterattack recovered part of the ground gained by the British at Cambrai.")},
