    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai Front · February 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai Front · February 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("巡逻领队用布包住水壶，把松动的扣环一个个摸紧。雪地里先前的脚印已冻成硬边，他沿着旧沟口试走一段。身后的人只用手势问路。"), TEXT("The patrol leader wraps his water bottle and tightens loose buckles by touch. Earlier footprints have frozen hard. He tests the old ditch while the men behind ask their way with gestures."), TEXT("The patrol leader wraps his water bottle and tightens loose buckles by touch. Earlier footprints have frozen hard. He tests the old ditch while the men behind ask their way with gestures.")},
    {TEXT("巡逻领队用布包住水壶，把松动的扣环一个个摸紧。雪地里先前的脚印已冻成硬边，他沿着旧沟口试走一段。身后的人只用手势问路。"), TEXT("The patrol leader wraps his water bottle and tightens loose buckles by touch. Earlier footprints have frozen hard. He tests the old ditch while the men behind ask their way with gestures."), TEXT("巡逻领队用布包住水壶，把松动的扣环一个个摸紧。雪地里先前的脚印已冻成硬边，他沿着旧沟口试走一段。身后的人只用手势问路。")},
    {TEXT("巡逻领队用布包住水壶，把松动的扣环一个个摸紧。雪地里先前的脚印已冻成硬边，他沿着旧沟口试走一段。身后的人只用手势问路。"), TEXT("The patrol leader wraps his water bottle and tightens loose buckles by touch. Earlier footprints have frozen hard. He tests the old ditch while the men behind ask their way with gestures."), TEXT("哨位没有回答，值更军士又听了一会儿。铁丝前的低地留着脚印，零星枪声从德军阵地方向传来。轻装巡逻队走进湿沟，后面的人掩住灯光。")},
    {TEXT("巡逻领队用布包住水壶，把松动的扣环一个个摸紧。雪地里先前的脚印已冻成硬边，他沿着旧沟口试走一段。身后的人只用手势问路。"), TEXT("The patrol leader wraps his water bottle and tightens loose buckles by touch. Earlier footprints have frozen hard. He tests the old ditch while the men behind ask their way with gestures."), TEXT("The post gives no answer. The duty NCO listens again. Footprints mark the low ground before the wire; scattered shots come from the German line. A light patrol enters the wet ditch, and the man behind covers the lamp.")},
    {TEXT("壕外的铁丝没有声音，远处偶尔亮起一道照明弹。他带人伏到洼地里，等白光移过去。返回点挂着一片暗布，风把它贴在支柱上，又轻轻掀开。"), TEXT("The wire is silent; a flare rises in the distance. He brings the patrol into a hollow and waits for the light to pass. A dark cloth marks the return point, lifting briefly from its post in the wind."), TEXT("The wire is silent; a flare rises in the distance. He brings the patrol into a hollow and waits for the light to pass. A dark cloth marks the return point, lifting briefly from its post in the wind.")},
    {TEXT("壕外的铁丝没有声音，远处偶尔亮起一道照明弹。他带人伏到洼地里，等白光移过去。返回点挂着一片暗布，风把它贴在支柱上，又轻轻掀开。"), TEXT("The wire is silent; a flare rises in the distance. He brings the patrol into a hollow and waits for the light to pass. A dark cloth marks the return point, lifting briefly from its post in the wind."), TEXT("壕外的铁丝没有声音，远处偶尔亮起一道照明弹。他带人伏到洼地里，等白光移过去。返回点挂着一片暗布，风把它贴在支柱上，又轻轻掀开。")},
    {TEXT("壕外的铁丝没有声音，远处偶尔亮起一道照明弹。他带人伏到洼地里，等白光移过去。返回点挂着一片暗布，风把它贴在支柱上，又轻轻掀开。"), TEXT("The wire is silent; a flare rises in the distance. He brings the patrol into a hollow and waits for the light to pass. A dark cloth marks the return point, lifting briefly from its post in the wind."), TEXT("前哨与连部之间有几段断线，尚无人带回消息。留守的哨兵望着沟口，换防队已在壕内等候。泥水里响了一下，枪手把手放到扳机旁。")},
    {TEXT("壕外的铁丝没有声音，远处偶尔亮起一道照明弹。他带人伏到洼地里，等白光移过去。返回点挂着一片暗布，风把它贴在支柱上，又轻轻掀开。"), TEXT("The wire is silent; a flare rises in the distance. He brings the patrol into a hollow and waits for the light to pass. A dark cloth marks the return point, lifting briefly from its post in the wind."), TEXT("Wire is broken between the outpost and headquarters. No runner has returned. Sentries watch the mouth of the ditch while the relief waits in the trench. Something stirs in the water. A gunner rests his hand beside the trigger.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on 21 March."), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on 21 March.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on 21 March."), TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，德军发动米夏埃尔攻势。"), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on 21 March."), TEXT("Germany launched Operation Michael on twenty-one March.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("接线员把耳机按紧，交换机上的插孔接连失去声音。圣康坦方向的炮火没有间断，一条线里只听见拖动电话的杂响。他拔出插头，换到备用线上。"), TEXT("The operator presses his headset close as sockets fall silent on the switchboard. The guns towards St Quentin keep firing. One line carries only the sound of a telephone being dragged."), TEXT("The operator presses his headset close as sockets fall silent on the switchboard. The guns towards St Quentin keep firing. One line carries only the sound of a telephone being dragged.")},
    {TEXT("接线员把耳机按紧，交换机上的插孔接连失去声音。圣康坦方向的炮火没有间断，一条线里只听见拖动电话的杂响。他拔出插头，换到备用线上。"), TEXT("The operator presses his headset close as sockets fall silent on the switchboard. The guns towards St Quentin keep firing. One line carries only the sound of a telephone being dragged."), TEXT("接线员把耳机按紧，交换机上的插孔接连失去声音。圣康坦方向的炮火没有间断，一条线里只听见拖动电话的杂响。他拔出插头，换到备用线上。")},
    {TEXT("接线员把耳机按紧，交换机上的插孔接连失去声音。圣康坦方向的炮火没有间断，一条线里只听见拖动电话的杂响。他拔出插头，换到备用线上。"), TEXT("The operator presses his headset close as sockets fall silent on the switchboard. The guns towards St Quentin keep firing. One line carries only the sound of a telephone being dragged."), TEXT("路口挤满第五集团军撤下来的人员，有人扶着伤员，有人找自己的军士。炮火打断了电话线，浓雾中的前哨已无回音。德军从支点之间穿过，枪声移向后方。")},
    {TEXT("接线员把耳机按紧，交换机上的插孔接连失去声音。圣康坦方向的炮火没有间断，一条线里只听见拖动电话的杂响。他拔出插头，换到备用线上。"), TEXT("The operator presses his headset close as sockets fall silent on the switchboard. The guns towards St Quentin keep firing. One line carries only the sound of a telephone being dragged."), TEXT("Fifth Army men coming back crowd the junction. Some support wounded comrades; others ask for their NCO. Shellfire has cut the telephone wire. The posts in the fog give no answer, and German parties are passing between the strongpoints.")},
    {TEXT("撤下来的军官在桌边报出新地址，接线员把旧牌翻过来。图上的道路还在，通话的人却已换了位置。门外有人卷起线盘，他把仍能接通的那根留下。"), TEXT("An officer arriving from the front gives a new address. The operator turns the old label over; the roads remain on the map, but the callers have moved. Outside, men gather cable, leaving the one line that still answers."), TEXT("An officer arriving from the front gives a new address. The operator turns the old label over; the roads remain on the map, but the callers have moved. Outside, men gather cable, leaving the one line that still answers.")},
    {TEXT("撤下来的军官在桌边报出新地址，接线员把旧牌翻过来。图上的道路还在，通话的人却已换了位置。门外有人卷起线盘，他把仍能接通的那根留下。"), TEXT("An officer arriving from the front gives a new address. The operator turns the old label over; the roads remain on the map, but the callers have moved. Outside, men gather cable, leaving the one line that still answers."), TEXT("撤下来的军官在桌边报出新地址，接线员把旧牌翻过来。图上的道路还在，通话的人却已换了位置。门外有人卷起线盘，他把仍能接通的那根留下。")},
    {TEXT("撤下来的军官在桌边报出新地址，接线员把旧牌翻过来。图上的道路还在，通话的人却已换了位置。门外有人卷起线盘，他把仍能接通的那根留下。"), TEXT("An officer arriving from the front gives a new address. The operator turns the old label over; the roads remain on the map, but the callers have moved. Outside, men gather cable, leaving the one line that still answers."), TEXT("后卫枪组守在道路旁，等最后一批失散人员经过。携弹手把箱子留在枪位，转身接过一副担架。军士查完眼前的人数，又向雾里望去。")},
    {TEXT("撤下来的军官在桌边报出新地址，接线员把旧牌翻过来。图上的道路还在，通话的人却已换了位置。门外有人卷起线盘，他把仍能接通的那根留下。"), TEXT("An officer arriving from the front gives a new address. The operator turns the old label over; the roads remain on the map, but the callers have moved. Outside, men gather cable, leaving the one line that still answers."), TEXT("The rearguard gun waits beside the road for the last scattered men. A bearer leaves his ammunition at the position and takes a stretcher handle. The NCO counts those beside him, then looks into the fog again. Firing comes from farther behind.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918")},
