    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("钉掌兵抬起马的后蹄，从铁掌里剔出一块尖石。炮车在利斯河沟边等候，驭手握着缰绳看向路口。刚砸直的铁钉还带着炉灰。"), TEXT("The farrier lifts a hind hoof and prises a sharp stone from the shoe. A gun wagon waits beside a Lys ditch. Its driver watches the junction with the reins in his hands."), TEXT("The farrier lifts a hind hoof and prises a sharp stone from the shoe. A gun wagon waits beside a Lys ditch. Its driver watches the junction with the reins in his hands.")},
    {TEXT("钉掌兵抬起马的后蹄，从铁掌里剔出一块尖石。炮车在利斯河沟边等候，驭手握着缰绳看向路口。刚砸直的铁钉还带着炉灰。"), TEXT("The farrier lifts a hind hoof and prises a sharp stone from the shoe. A gun wagon waits beside a Lys ditch. Its driver watches the junction with the reins in his hands."), TEXT("钉掌兵抬起马的后蹄，从铁掌里剔出一块尖石。炮车在利斯河沟边等候，驭手握着缰绳看向路口。刚砸直的铁钉还带着炉灰。")},
    {TEXT("钉掌兵抬起马的后蹄，从铁掌里剔出一块尖石。炮车在利斯河沟边等候，驭手握着缰绳看向路口。刚砸直的铁钉还带着炉灰。"), TEXT("The farrier lifts a hind hoof and prises a sharp stone from the shoe. A gun wagon waits beside a Lys ditch. Its driver watches the junction with the reins in his hands."), TEXT("联络兵带来邻段失守的消息，电话里却无人回答。河沟把田野分成窄块，机枪声沿水面传来。侧翼的步枪手离开旧枪位，向路口的零散哨兵靠拢。")},
    {TEXT("钉掌兵抬起马的后蹄，从铁掌里剔出一块尖石。炮车在利斯河沟边等候，驭手握着缰绳看向路口。刚砸直的铁钉还带着炉灰。"), TEXT("The farrier lifts a hind hoof and prises a sharp stone from the shoe. A gun wagon waits beside a Lys ditch. Its driver watches the junction with the reins in his hands."), TEXT("A runner brings word of a breach on the neighbouring sector. The telephone is silent. Ditches divide the fields, carrying the sound of machine guns across the water. Riflemen leave their old position to join scattered sentries at the junction.")},
    {TEXT("渡口又送来一匹跛马，他把工具箱挪到篱笆后。水从马腹下滴到皮围裙上，车轮已经深陷泥槽。他钉牢松开的掌边，挥手让炮车先往硬路上走。"), TEXT("A lame horse comes from the crossing, so the tools move behind a hedge. Water drips onto the leather apron; wagon wheels are deep in the ruts. He secures the loose shoe and sends the team towards firm ground."), TEXT("A lame horse comes from the crossing, so the tools move behind a hedge. Water drips onto the leather apron; wagon wheels are deep in the ruts. He secures the loose shoe and sends the team towards firm ground.")},
    {TEXT("渡口又送来一匹跛马，他把工具箱挪到篱笆后。水从马腹下滴到皮围裙上，车轮已经深陷泥槽。他钉牢松开的掌边，挥手让炮车先往硬路上走。"), TEXT("A lame horse comes from the crossing, so the tools move behind a hedge. Water drips onto the leather apron; wagon wheels are deep in the ruts. He secures the loose shoe and sends the team towards firm ground."), TEXT("渡口又送来一匹跛马，他把工具箱挪到篱笆后。水从马腹下滴到皮围裙上，车轮已经深陷泥槽。他钉牢松开的掌边，挥手让炮车先往硬路上走。")},
    {TEXT("渡口又送来一匹跛马，他把工具箱挪到篱笆后。水从马腹下滴到皮围裙上，车轮已经深陷泥槽。他钉牢松开的掌边，挥手让炮车先往硬路上走。"), TEXT("A lame horse comes from the crossing, so the tools move behind a hedge. Water drips onto the leather apron; wagon wheels are deep in the ruts. He secures the loose shoe and sends the team towards firm ground."), TEXT("渡口旁有队伍重新集合，携弹队也要从这里经过。军士用地图核对前哨，把一名传令兵留在路边。对岸的枪还在响，名册上几个阵位没有回报。")},
    {TEXT("渡口又送来一匹跛马，他把工具箱挪到篱笆后。水从马腹下滴到皮围裙上，车轮已经深陷泥槽。他钉牢松开的掌边，挥手让炮车先往硬路上走。"), TEXT("A lame horse comes from the crossing, so the tools move behind a hedge. Water drips onto the leather apron; wagon wheels are deep in the ruts. He secures the loose shoe and sends the team towards firm ground."), TEXT("Troops gather beside the crossing. The carrying party needs that road too. The NCO checks the posts against his map and leaves a runner beside the track. Guns still fire across the bank. Several marked positions have sent no report.")},
    {TEXT("德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。"), TEXT("Germany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."), TEXT("Germany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April.")},
    {TEXT("德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。"), TEXT("Germany extended its spring offensive to the Lys in April."), TEXT("德军四月攻势把战斗扩展到利斯河地区。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("炮手靠在炮尾旁，从视孔里找村口的车影。车身一停，他便把瞄准线挪过残墙。射击后涌进来的烟遮住了炮闩，他用手摸到下一发弹药。"), TEXT("The gunner braces beside the breech and searches for a tank at the village entrance. As the hull stops, he shifts his sight past a broken wall. Smoke hides the breech after firing."), TEXT("The gunner braces beside the breech and searches for a tank at the village entrance. As the hull stops, he shifts his sight past a broken wall. Smoke hides the breech after firing.")},
    {TEXT("炮手靠在炮尾旁，从视孔里找村口的车影。车身一停，他便把瞄准线挪过残墙。射击后涌进来的烟遮住了炮闩，他用手摸到下一发弹药。"), TEXT("The gunner braces beside the breech and searches for a tank at the village entrance. As the hull stops, he shifts his sight past a broken wall. Smoke hides the breech after firing."), TEXT("炮手靠在炮尾旁，从视孔里找村口的车影。车身一停，他便把瞄准线挪过残墙。射击后涌进来的烟遮住了炮闩，他用手摸到下一发弹药。")},
    {TEXT("炮手靠在炮尾旁，从视孔里找村口的车影。车身一停，他便把瞄准线挪过残墙。射击后涌进来的烟遮住了炮闩，他用手摸到下一发弹药。"), TEXT("The gunner braces beside the breech and searches for a tank at the village entrance. As the hull stops, he shifts his sight past a broken wall. Smoke hides the breech after firing."), TEXT("果园外传来履带声，村里的路口已经被德军占据。英军战车从残墙旁转出，步兵贴着沟边跟上。车组看不见墙后的动静，枪声却从巷口传来。")},
    {TEXT("炮手靠在炮尾旁，从视孔里找村口的车影。车身一停，他便把瞄准线挪过残墙。射击后涌进来的烟遮住了炮闩，他用手摸到下一发弹药。"), TEXT("The gunner braces beside the breech and searches for a tank at the village entrance. As the hull stops, he shifts his sight past a broken wall. Smoke hides the breech after firing."), TEXT("Tracks sound beyond the orchard. German troops hold the village junction. A British tank turns beside a broken wall and infantry follow the ditch. Its crew cannot see behind the masonry, where firing comes from a lane.")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员把战车退回一点，果园又回到视孔前。车外有人指向一条小巷，车组只能逐次转动车身。另一声炮响从墙后传来，空弹壳滚到炮手的靴边。"), TEXT("The driver draws back slightly, bringing the orchard into view again. A man outside points towards an alley; the crew turns the hull by degrees. A gun answers beyond the wall, and an empty case rolls against the gunner's boot."), TEXT("The driver draws back slightly, bringing the orchard into view again. A man outside points towards an alley; the crew turns the hull by degrees. A gun answers beyond the wall, and an empty case rolls against the gunner's boot.")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员把战车退回一点，果园又回到视孔前。车外有人指向一条小巷，车组只能逐次转动车身。另一声炮响从墙后传来，空弹壳滚到炮手的靴边。"), TEXT("The driver draws back slightly, bringing the orchard into view again. A man outside points towards an alley; the crew turns the hull by degrees. A gun answers beyond the wall, and an empty case rolls against the gunner's boot."), TEXT("驾驶员把战车退回一点，果园又回到视孔前。车外有人指向一条小巷，车组只能逐次转动车身。另一声炮响从墙后传来，空弹壳滚到炮手的靴边。")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员把战车退回一点，果园又回到视孔前。车外有人指向一条小巷，车组只能逐次转动车身。另一声炮响从墙后传来，空弹壳滚到炮手的靴边。"), TEXT("The driver draws back slightly, bringing the orchard into view again. A man outside points towards an alley; the crew turns the hull by degrees. A gun answers beyond the wall, and an empty case rolls against the gunner's boot."), TEXT("通往亚眠的路仍在身后，携弹队停在倒塌的院门前。军士指了指侧面的缺口，让步枪手分头进去。入夜反击的准备还在继续，眼前的街道尚未安静。")},
    {TEXT("驾驶员把战车退回一点，果园又回到视孔前。车外有人指向一条小巷，车组只能逐次转动车身。另一声炮响从墙后传来，空弹壳滚到炮手的靴边。"), TEXT("The driver draws back slightly, bringing the orchard into view again. A man outside points towards an alley; the crew turns the hull by degrees. A gun answers beyond the wall, and an empty case rolls against the gunner's boot."), TEXT("The road to Amiens lies behind them. Bearers stop at a fallen gate. The NCO points riflemen towards a gap in the side wall. Preparations continue for the counterattack after dark, but the street ahead is still under fire from the ruins.")},
    {TEXT("这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。"), TEXT("The first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here."), TEXT("The first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here.")},
    {TEXT("这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。"), TEXT("The first recorded tank-versus-tank battle took place here."), TEXT("这里发生了首次有记录的坦克对战。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 一九一八年八月八日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · East of Amiens · Eight August nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("气象观察员用袖口擦去表盘上的雾，把风旗递给身旁的人。亚眠以东的田野传来发动机声，近处的篱笆还看不清。纸上的记录被水珠洇开一角。"), TEXT("The weather observer wipes mist from a dial and passes over the wind pennant. Engines sound in the fields east of Amiens. Even the nearest hedge is difficult to see."), TEXT("The weather observer wipes mist from a dial and passes over the wind pennant. Engines sound in the fields east of Amiens. Even the nearest hedge is difficult to see.")},
    {TEXT("气象观察员用袖口擦去表盘上的雾，把风旗递给身旁的人。亚眠以东的田野传来发动机声，近处的篱笆还看不清。纸上的记录被水珠洇开一角。"), TEXT("The weather observer wipes mist from a dial and passes over the wind pennant. Engines sound in the fields east of Amiens. Even the nearest hedge is difficult to see."), TEXT("气象观察员用袖口擦去表盘上的雾，把风旗递给身旁的人。亚眠以东的田野传来发动机声，近处的篱笆还看不清。纸上的记录被水珠洇开一角。")},
    {TEXT("气象观察员用袖口擦去表盘上的雾，把风旗递给身旁的人。亚眠以东的田野传来发动机声，近处的篱笆还看不清。纸上的记录被水珠洇开一角。"), TEXT("The weather observer wipes mist from a dial and passes over the wind pennant. Engines sound in the fields east of Amiens. Even the nearest hedge is difficult to see."), TEXT("低雾遮住村界，战车从前队身旁驶过。澳大利亚与加拿大部队已经出发，炮火向远处延伸。步枪手越过田埂，隔着雾寻找相邻队伍的身影。")},
    {TEXT("气象观察员用袖口擦去表盘上的雾，把风旗递给身旁的人。亚眠以东的田野传来发动机声，近处的篱笆还看不清。纸上的记录被水珠洇开一角。"), TEXT("The weather observer wipes mist from a dial and passes over the wind pennant. Engines sound in the fields east of Amiens. Even the nearest hedge is difficult to see."), TEXT("Low mist hides the village boundary. A tank passes the leading infantry. Australian and Canadian troops are moving forward as the barrage lifts into the distance. Riflemen cross the field bank and search through the mist for the next party.")},
    {TEXT("他把风旗举过低墙，布条先垂下，又慢慢偏向一边。前队已经出发，电话催来新的读数。旗杆收回墙后时，雾里出现了履带压过草地的声音。"), TEXT("He raises the pennant above a low wall; the cloth hangs, then turns slowly aside. The leading troops have gone and the telephone asks for another reading. As he lowers the pole, tracks can be heard crossing grass in the fog."), TEXT("He raises the pennant above a low wall; the cloth hangs, then turns slowly aside. The leading troops have gone and the telephone asks for another reading. As he lowers the pole, tracks can be heard crossing grass in the fog.")},
    {TEXT("他把风旗举过低墙，布条先垂下，又慢慢偏向一边。前队已经出发，电话催来新的读数。旗杆收回墙后时，雾里出现了履带压过草地的声音。"), TEXT("He raises the pennant above a low wall; the cloth hangs, then turns slowly aside. The leading troops have gone and the telephone asks for another reading. As he lowers the pole, tracks can be heard crossing grass in the fog."), TEXT("他把风旗举过低墙，布条先垂下，又慢慢偏向一边。前队已经出发，电话催来新的读数。旗杆收回墙后时，雾里出现了履带压过草地的声音。")},
    {TEXT("他把风旗举过低墙，布条先垂下，又慢慢偏向一边。前队已经出发，电话催来新的读数。旗杆收回墙后时，雾里出现了履带压过草地的声音。"), TEXT("He raises the pennant above a low wall; the cloth hangs, then turns slowly aside. The leading troops have gone and the telephone asks for another reading. As he lowers the pole, tracks can be heard crossing grass in the fog."), TEXT("传令兵在岔路留下指路的人，携弹队沿车辙跟来。孤立枪位还在抵抗，前面时而有人停下卧倒。发动机的声音渐远，一辆战车只剩露出雾面的车顶。")},
    {TEXT("他把风旗举过低墙，布条先垂下，又慢慢偏向一边。前队已经出发，电话催来新的读数。旗杆收回墙后时，雾里出现了履带压过草地的声音。"), TEXT("He raises the pennant above a low wall; the cloth hangs, then turns slowly aside. The leading troops have gone and the telephone asks for another reading. As he lowers the pole, tracks can be heard crossing grass in the fog."), TEXT("A runner leaves a man at the fork to guide the bearers following the tracks. Isolated posts still resist. Men ahead stop and lie down when shots reach them. Engine noise fades until only a tank's roof shows above the mist.")},
    {TEXT("鲁登道夫称这一天为德国陆军的黑暗之日。"), TEXT("Ludendorff called it the German Army's black day."), TEXT("Ludendorff called it the German Army's black day.")},
    {TEXT("鲁登道夫称这一天为德国陆军的黑暗之日。"), TEXT("Ludendorff called it the German Army's black day."), TEXT("鲁登道夫称这一天为德国陆军的黑暗之日。")},
