    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月26日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Scarpe · 26 August 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月26日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月26日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Scarpe · 26 August 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 斯卡尔普 · 一九一八年八月二十六日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月26日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Scarpe · 26 August 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Scarpe · Twenty-six August nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("炊事兵把锅盖压住，滚汤仍从车沿溅到靴上。炮车刚过斯卡尔普方向的路口，送饭的车便跟着颠过去。他用麻布堵住松开的盖扣。"), TEXT("The cook holds a lid down as hot soup splashes over the cart. A gun wagon passes the junction towards the Scarpe. His cart jolts after it, the loose catch wrapped in sacking."), TEXT("The cook holds a lid down as hot soup splashes over the cart. A gun wagon passes the junction towards the Scarpe. His cart jolts after it, the loose catch wrapped in sacking.")},
    {TEXT("炊事兵把锅盖压住，滚汤仍从车沿溅到靴上。炮车刚过斯卡尔普方向的路口，送饭的车便跟着颠过去。他用麻布堵住松开的盖扣。"), TEXT("The cook holds a lid down as hot soup splashes over the cart. A gun wagon passes the junction towards the Scarpe. His cart jolts after it, the loose catch wrapped in sacking."), TEXT("炊事兵把锅盖压住，滚汤仍从车沿溅到靴上。炮车刚过斯卡尔普方向的路口，送饭的车便跟着颠过去。他用麻布堵住松开的盖扣。")},
    {TEXT("炊事兵把锅盖压住，滚汤仍从车沿溅到靴上。炮车刚过斯卡尔普方向的路口，送饭的车便跟着颠过去。他用麻布堵住松开的盖扣。"), TEXT("The cook holds a lid down as hot soup splashes over the cart. A gun wagon passes the junction towards the Scarpe. His cart jolts after it, the loose catch wrapped in sacking."), TEXT("工兵在旧铁丝旁蹲下，刚翻出的炮弹还半埋在土里。加拿大部队从前方阵位经过，村边德军后卫继续射击。白垩田地上，新弹坑叠着旧弹坑。")},
    {TEXT("炊事兵把锅盖压住，滚汤仍从车沿溅到靴上。炮车刚过斯卡尔普方向的路口，送饭的车便跟着颠过去。他用麻布堵住松开的盖扣。"), TEXT("The cook holds a lid down as hot soup splashes over the cart. A gun wagon passes the junction towards the Scarpe. His cart jolts after it, the loose catch wrapped in sacking."), TEXT("A sapper crouches beside the old wire. A shell newly exposed by the bombardment lies half buried. Canadian troops pass the forward positions while German rearguards fire from the village edge. Fresh craters overlap the older ones in the chalk.")},
    {TEXT("新阵地只留了一小块干处，他把饭桶放到残墙下。士兵拿着搪瓷杯轮流来舀，目光还朝着前面。锅底露出来时，后一队的脚步刚在墙外响起。"), TEXT("Only a patch of dry ground remains at the new position. He sets the food against a broken wall as men bring enamel mugs, still looking forward. When the bottom of the pot shows, another party arrives outside."), TEXT("Only a patch of dry ground remains at the new position. He sets the food against a broken wall as men bring enamel mugs, still looking forward. When the bottom of the pot shows, another party arrives outside.")},
    {TEXT("新阵地只留了一小块干处，他把饭桶放到残墙下。士兵拿着搪瓷杯轮流来舀，目光还朝着前面。锅底露出来时，后一队的脚步刚在墙外响起。"), TEXT("Only a patch of dry ground remains at the new position. He sets the food against a broken wall as men bring enamel mugs, still looking forward. When the bottom of the pot shows, another party arrives outside."), TEXT("新阵地只留了一小块干处，他把饭桶放到残墙下。士兵拿着搪瓷杯轮流来舀，目光还朝着前面。锅底露出来时，后一队的脚步刚在墙外响起。")},
    {TEXT("新阵地只留了一小块干处，他把饭桶放到残墙下。士兵拿着搪瓷杯轮流来舀，目光还朝着前面。锅底露出来时，后一队的脚步刚在墙外响起。"), TEXT("Only a patch of dry ground remains at the new position. He sets the food against a broken wall as men bring enamel mugs, still looking forward. When the bottom of the pot shows, another party arrives outside."), TEXT("携弹队等在障碍缺口，前队沿工兵标出的通路向前。步枪手在田界卧倒，担架从他们身后送回。军士拦住一名抄近路的士兵，指向那枚露出的弹体。")},
    {TEXT("新阵地只留了一小块干处，他把饭桶放到残墙下。士兵拿着搪瓷杯轮流来舀，目光还朝着前面。锅底露出来时，后一队的脚步刚在墙外响起。"), TEXT("Only a patch of dry ground remains at the new position. He sets the food against a broken wall as men bring enamel mugs, still looking forward. When the bottom of the pot shows, another party arrives outside."), TEXT("Bearers wait at the gap. The leading men follow the passage the engineers have marked. Riflemen lie along a field boundary as a stretcher passes behind them. The NCO stops a man taking a shortcut and points to the exposed shell.")},
    {TEXT("协约国在百日攻势中持续迫使德军后撤。"), TEXT("Allied attacks drove the Germans back during the Hundred Days."), TEXT("Allied attacks drove the Germans back during the Hundred Days.")},
    {TEXT("协约国在百日攻势中持续迫使德军后撤。"), TEXT("Allied attacks drove the Germans back during the Hundred Days."), TEXT("协约国在百日攻势中持续迫使德军后撤。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · 29 September 1918")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("工兵把绳索绑在运河岸边的断桩上，先试过纤道下的斜坡。烟幕遮住对岸，靴底碰到的石块不断往水里滑。他扶住绳结，让后一人把木料传下。"), TEXT("The sapper ties a rope to a broken post and tests the slope beneath the canal towpath. Smoke hides the far bank. Stones under his boots keep sliding into the water."), TEXT("The sapper ties a rope to a broken post and tests the slope beneath the canal towpath. Smoke hides the far bank. Stones under his boots keep sliding into the water.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把绳索绑在运河岸边的断桩上，先试过纤道下的斜坡。烟幕遮住对岸，靴底碰到的石块不断往水里滑。他扶住绳结，让后一人把木料传下。"), TEXT("The sapper ties a rope to a broken post and tests the slope beneath the canal towpath. Smoke hides the far bank. Stones under his boots keep sliding into the water."), TEXT("工兵把绳索绑在运河岸边的断桩上，先试过纤道下的斜坡。烟幕遮住对岸，靴底碰到的石块不断往水里滑。他扶住绳结，让后一人把木料传下。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把绳索绑在运河岸边的断桩上，先试过纤道下的斜坡。烟幕遮住对岸，靴底碰到的石块不断往水里滑。他扶住绳结，让后一人把木料传下。"), TEXT("The sapper ties a rope to a broken post and tests the slope beneath the canal towpath. Smoke hides the far bank. Stones under his boots keep sliding into the water."), TEXT("运河两岸升起烟，陡坡上的土被炮火削落。桥还连着对岸，第四十六师的步兵从纤道上观察高处的枪位。工兵带着器材沿破坡下去，后面的人拉住绳索。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把绳索绑在运河岸边的断桩上，先试过纤道下的斜坡。烟幕遮住对岸，靴底碰到的石块不断往水里滑。他扶住绳结，让后一人把木料传下。"), TEXT("The sapper ties a rope to a broken post and tests the slope beneath the canal towpath. Smoke hides the far bank. Stones under his boots keep sliding into the water."), TEXT("Smoke rises along the canal. Shellfire cuts earth from the steep bank. A bridge still reaches the far side. Forty-sixth Division infantry watch the guns above from the towpath. Sappers descend the broken slope with their equipment while men behind hold a rope.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把绳索绑在运河岸边的断桩上，先试过纤道下的斜坡。烟幕遮住对岸，靴底碰到的石块不断往水里滑。他扶住绳结，让后一人把木料传下。"), TEXT("The sapper ties a rope to a broken post and tests the slope beneath the canal towpath. Smoke hides the far bank. Stones under his boots keep sliding into the water."), TEXT("Smoke rises along the canal. Shellfire cuts earth from the steep bank. A bridge still reaches the far side, where Forty-sixth Division infantry watch the guns above the water. Sappers descend the broken slope with their equipment while men behind hold a rope.")},
    {TEXT("湿木板横过一道裂口，水面上映出短促的枪光。工兵把最后一根绳压到坡土里，给上岸的人让开。对岸开始传回喊声，他仍低头拧紧松动的结。"), TEXT("Wet boards span a crack as brief muzzle flashes show in the water. He pins the last rope into the bank and lets men pass. Shouts come back from the far side; he bends to tighten another knot."), TEXT("Wet boards span a crack as brief muzzle flashes show in the water. He pins the last rope into the bank and lets men pass. Shouts come back from the far side; he bends to tighten another knot.")},
    {TEXT("湿木板横过一道裂口，水面上映出短促的枪光。工兵把最后一根绳压到坡土里，给上岸的人让开。对岸开始传回喊声，他仍低头拧紧松动的结。"), TEXT("Wet boards span a crack as brief muzzle flashes show in the water. He pins the last rope into the bank and lets men pass. Shouts come back from the far side; he bends to tighten another knot."), TEXT("湿木板横过一道裂口，水面上映出短促的枪光。工兵把最后一根绳压到坡土里，给上岸的人让开。对岸开始传回喊声，他仍低头拧紧松动的结。")},
    {TEXT("湿木板横过一道裂口，水面上映出短促的枪光。工兵把最后一根绳压到坡土里，给上岸的人让开。对岸开始传回喊声，他仍低头拧紧松动的结。"), TEXT("Wet boards span a crack as brief muzzle flashes show in the water. He pins the last rope into the bank and lets men pass. Shouts come back from the far side; he bends to tighten another knot."), TEXT("下坡路只能容少数人通过，携弹队把箱子逐个传下。水面响起射击声，前队伏在岸边等候。军士挤到转弯处，抬头看了一眼那座尚完整的桥。")},
    {TEXT("湿木板横过一道裂口，水面上映出短促的枪光。工兵把最后一根绳压到坡土里，给上岸的人让开。对岸开始传回喊声，他仍低头拧紧松动的结。"), TEXT("Wet boards span a crack as brief muzzle flashes show in the water. He pins the last rope into the bank and lets men pass. Shouts come back from the far side; he bends to tighten another knot."), TEXT("Few can pass down the narrow approach at once. Bearers hand their boxes from man to man. Firing crosses the water. The leading men wait against the bank, and the NCO looks up towards the bridge still standing above them.")},
    {TEXT("英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。"), TEXT("British troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on 29 September."), TEXT("British troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on 29 September.")},
    {TEXT("英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。"), TEXT("British troops crossed the St Quentin Canal on 29 September."), TEXT("英军于九月二十九日越过圣康坦运河。")},
