    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月17日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · 17 October 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月17日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月17日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · 17 October 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月十七日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月17日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · 17 October 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Selle Valley · Seventeen October nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("铁路工把提灯放在枕木旁，用锤子敲过松动的道钉。塞勒河谷的车站还冒着烟，路堤后传来列车枪炮声。他贴着切口把损坏处画在纸上。"), TEXT("The railway worker leaves his lamp by a sleeper and taps loose spikes with a hammer. Smoke hangs over the Selle station. Guns sound behind the embankment as he sketches the damaged line."), TEXT("The railway worker leaves his lamp by a sleeper and taps loose spikes with a hammer. Smoke hangs over the Selle station. Guns sound behind the embankment as he sketches the damaged line.")},
    {TEXT("铁路工把提灯放在枕木旁，用锤子敲过松动的道钉。塞勒河谷的车站还冒着烟，路堤后传来列车枪炮声。他贴着切口把损坏处画在纸上。"), TEXT("The railway worker leaves his lamp by a sleeper and taps loose spikes with a hammer. Smoke hangs over the Selle station. Guns sound behind the embankment as he sketches the damaged line."), TEXT("铁路工把提灯放在枕木旁，用锤子敲过松动的道钉。塞勒河谷的车站还冒着烟，路堤后传来列车枪炮声。他贴着切口把损坏处画在纸上。")},
    {TEXT("铁路工把提灯放在枕木旁，用锤子敲过松动的道钉。塞勒河谷的车站还冒着烟，路堤后传来列车枪炮声。他贴着切口把损坏处画在纸上。"), TEXT("The railway worker leaves his lamp by a sleeper and taps loose spikes with a hammer. Smoke hangs over the Selle station. Guns sound behind the embankment as he sketches the damaged line."), TEXT("铁路切口里传出炮声，列车还在掩护后方撤运。雨水顺路堤流下，工兵贴着坡脚接近铁轨。步兵在两侧展开，反装甲枪组寻找能看见车体的位置。")},
    {TEXT("铁路工把提灯放在枕木旁，用锤子敲过松动的道钉。塞勒河谷的车站还冒着烟，路堤后传来列车枪炮声。他贴着切口把损坏处画在纸上。"), TEXT("The railway worker leaves his lamp by a sleeper and taps loose spikes with a hammer. Smoke hangs over the Selle station. Guns sound behind the embankment as he sketches the damaged line."), TEXT("Gunfire comes from the railway cutting. The train is still covering the evacuation. Rain runs down the embankment as engineers approach the rails along its foot. Infantry spread to either side; the anti-armour crew searches for a view of the carriage.")},
    {TEXT("一段钢轨被弹片削开，接头不能再靠拧紧螺栓修好。他把工具背到肩上，沿旁边的沟向前走。后面的运输队停住，提灯在没人经过的铁轨边继续亮着。"), TEXT("A shell has cut the rail, beyond what tightening bolts can mend. He shoulders his tools and follows the ditch forward. The transport party behind him stops; the lamp keeps burning beside the unused track."), TEXT("A shell has cut the rail, beyond what tightening bolts can mend. He shoulders his tools and follows the ditch forward. The transport party behind him stops; the lamp keeps burning beside the unused track.")},
    {TEXT("一段钢轨被弹片削开，接头不能再靠拧紧螺栓修好。他把工具背到肩上，沿旁边的沟向前走。后面的运输队停住，提灯在没人经过的铁轨边继续亮着。"), TEXT("A shell has cut the rail, beyond what tightening bolts can mend. He shoulders his tools and follows the ditch forward. The transport party behind him stops; the lamp keeps burning beside the unused track."), TEXT("一段钢轨被弹片削开，接头不能再靠拧紧螺栓修好。他把工具背到肩上，沿旁边的沟向前走。后面的运输队停住，提灯在没人经过的铁轨边继续亮着。")},
    {TEXT("一段钢轨被弹片削开，接头不能再靠拧紧螺栓修好。他把工具背到肩上，沿旁边的沟向前走。后面的运输队停住，提灯在没人经过的铁轨边继续亮着。"), TEXT("A shell has cut the rail, beyond what tightening bolts can mend. He shoulders his tools and follows the ditch forward. The transport party behind him stops; the lamp keeps burning beside the unused track."), TEXT("公路上挤着运弹车辆和担架，河谷入口越来越窄。观察员爬到高处，把列车的枪位报回。枪组搬开挡在脚边的枕木，远处的车轮仍未转动。")},
    {TEXT("一段钢轨被弹片削开，接头不能再靠拧紧螺栓修好。他把工具背到肩上，沿旁边的沟向前走。后面的运输队停住，提灯在没人经过的铁轨边继续亮着。"), TEXT("A shell has cut the rail, beyond what tightening bolts can mend. He shoulders his tools and follows the ditch forward. The transport party behind him stops; the lamp keeps burning beside the unused track."), TEXT("Ammunition vehicles and stretchers crowd the road into the valley. An observer climbs higher and reports the train's guns. The crew moves a sleeper out of its way. Beyond the cutting, the visible wheels have not yet begun to turn.")},
    {TEXT("塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("The Battle of the Selle was fought in October 1918."), TEXT("The Battle of the Selle was fought in October 1918.")},
    {TEXT("塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("The Battle of the Selle was fought in October 1918."), TEXT("塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。")},
    {TEXT("塞勒河进攻发生于一九一八年十月。"), TEXT("The Battle of the Selle was fought in October 1918."), TEXT("The Battle of the Selle was fought in October nineteen eighteen.")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 一九一八年十一月初")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Outside Valenciennes · Early November nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("翻译兵在瓦朗谢讷城外接住一辆手推车，车轮卡在碎砖间。老人指着街口，他听完便在地图上添一条窄线。车上的布包下露出半只裂开的盘子。"), TEXT("The interpreter steadies a handcart outside Valenciennes, its wheel caught in brick rubble. An old man points down the street. A narrow line goes onto the map; a cracked plate shows beneath the bundles."), TEXT("The interpreter steadies a handcart outside Valenciennes, its wheel caught in brick rubble. An old man points down the street. A narrow line goes onto the map; a cracked plate shows beneath the bundles.")},
    {TEXT("翻译兵在瓦朗谢讷城外接住一辆手推车，车轮卡在碎砖间。老人指着街口，他听完便在地图上添一条窄线。车上的布包下露出半只裂开的盘子。"), TEXT("The interpreter steadies a handcart outside Valenciennes, its wheel caught in brick rubble. An old man points down the street. A narrow line goes onto the map; a cracked plate shows beneath the bundles."), TEXT("翻译兵在瓦朗谢讷城外接住一辆手推车，车轮卡在碎砖间。老人指着街口，他听完便在地图上添一条窄线。车上的布包下露出半只裂开的盘子。")},
    {TEXT("翻译兵在瓦朗谢讷城外接住一辆手推车，车轮卡在碎砖间。老人指着街口，他听完便在地图上添一条窄线。车上的布包下露出半只裂开的盘子。"), TEXT("The interpreter steadies a handcart outside Valenciennes, its wheel caught in brick rubble. An old man points down the street. A narrow line goes onto the map; a cracked plate shows beneath the bundles."), TEXT("手推车停在路边，车上的包袱用绳子扎着。加拿大部队正在接近城市，居民还没有离开全部街区。观察员伏在果园边，仔细辨认残墙之间的枪口。")},
    {TEXT("翻译兵在瓦朗谢讷城外接住一辆手推车，车轮卡在碎砖间。老人指着街口，他听完便在地图上添一条窄线。车上的布包下露出半只裂开的盘子。"), TEXT("The interpreter steadies a handcart outside Valenciennes, its wheel caught in brick rubble. An old man points down the street. A narrow line goes onto the map; a cracked plate shows beneath the bundles."), TEXT("A handcart stands beside the road, its bundles tied with string. Canadian troops are approaching the town, where civilians remain in the streets. An observer lies at the orchard edge, studying a muzzle between the broken walls.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络官来问哪条街还有居民，翻译兵把铅笔移到另一块屋地。城里再次传来枪声，手推车便向沟边退了一点。他扶住车把，等道路前面让出空处。"), TEXT("The artillery liaison officer asks which streets still have inhabitants. The pencil moves to another block of houses. Gunfire starts in town and the cart edges towards the ditch; the interpreter holds it until the road clears."), TEXT("The artillery liaison officer asks which streets still have inhabitants. The pencil moves to another block of houses. Gunfire starts in town and the cart edges towards the ditch; the interpreter holds it until the road clears.")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络官来问哪条街还有居民，翻译兵把铅笔移到另一块屋地。城里再次传来枪声，手推车便向沟边退了一点。他扶住车把，等道路前面让出空处。"), TEXT("The artillery liaison officer asks which streets still have inhabitants. The pencil moves to another block of houses. Gunfire starts in town and the cart edges towards the ditch; the interpreter holds it until the road clears."), TEXT("炮兵联络官来问哪条街还有居民，翻译兵把铅笔移到另一块屋地。城里再次传来枪声，手推车便向沟边退了一点。他扶住车把，等道路前面让出空处。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络官来问哪条街还有居民，翻译兵把铅笔移到另一块屋地。城里再次传来枪声，手推车便向沟边退了一点。他扶住车把，等道路前面让出空处。"), TEXT("The artillery liaison officer asks which streets still have inhabitants. The pencil moves to another block of houses. Gunfire starts in town and the cart edges towards the ditch; the interpreter holds it until the road clears."), TEXT("担架队从军车旁走过，步枪手沿浅沟靠近出口。炮兵等着前沿报回位置，军士让后队暂留墙下。街道深处开了一扇门，观察员把望远镜转了过去。")},
    {TEXT("炮兵联络官来问哪条街还有居民，翻译兵把铅笔移到另一块屋地。城里再次传来枪声，手推车便向沟边退了一点。他扶住车把，等道路前面让出空处。"), TEXT("The artillery liaison officer asks which streets still have inhabitants. The pencil moves to another block of houses. Gunfire starts in town and the cart edges towards the ditch; the interpreter holds it until the road clears."), TEXT("A stretcher party passes the military vehicles. Riflemen follow a shallow ditch towards the exit. The batteries wait for a position from the forward posts. The NCO keeps the following men under the wall. A door opens farther down the street, and the observer turns his glasses.")},
    {TEXT("加拿大部队于十一月初攻占瓦朗谢讷。"), TEXT("Canadian troops took Valenciennes in early November."), TEXT("Canadian troops took Valenciennes in early November.")},
    {TEXT("加拿大部队于十一月初攻占瓦朗谢讷。"), TEXT("Canadian troops took Valenciennes in early November."), TEXT("加拿大部队于十一月初攻占瓦朗谢讷。")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日")},
    {TEXT("阵中日记 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("WAR DIARY · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("牧师把湿书放在城外的石阶上，先扶住一道快倒的门。桑布尔方向还有枪声，经过的人问有没有新的电报。他摇头，把书塞回外衣里。"), TEXT("The chaplain lays his wet book on a stone step and steadies a falling door. Guns still sound towards the Sambre. Men passing ask whether another dispatch has come."), TEXT("The chaplain lays his wet book on a stone step and steadies a falling door. Guns still sound towards the Sambre. Men passing ask whether another dispatch has come.")},
    {TEXT("牧师把湿书放在城外的石阶上，先扶住一道快倒的门。桑布尔方向还有枪声，经过的人问有没有新的电报。他摇头，把书塞回外衣里。"), TEXT("The chaplain lays his wet book on a stone step and steadies a falling door. Guns still sound towards the Sambre. Men passing ask whether another dispatch has come."), TEXT("牧师把湿书放在城外的石阶上，先扶住一道快倒的门。桑布尔方向还有枪声，经过的人问有没有新的电报。他摇头，把书塞回外衣里。")},
    {TEXT("牧师把湿书放在城外的石阶上，先扶住一道快倒的门。桑布尔方向还有枪声，经过的人问有没有新的电报。他摇头，把书塞回外衣里。"), TEXT("The chaplain lays his wet book on a stone step and steadies a falling door. Guns still sound towards the Sambre. Men passing ask whether another dispatch has come."), TEXT("当天的作战命令仍送到了连部，工兵带着工具走向运河。别处停战的消息已经传来，眼前的德军哨位却还在射击。城郊道路上有人推着家当经过。")},
    {TEXT("牧师把湿书放在城外的石阶上，先扶住一道快倒的门。桑布尔方向还有枪声，经过的人问有没有新的电报。他摇头，把书塞回外衣里。"), TEXT("The chaplain lays his wet book on a stone step and steadies a falling door. Guns still sound towards the Sambre. Men passing ask whether another dispatch has come."), TEXT("The day's orders reach headquarters. Sappers carry their tools towards the canal. News of armistices elsewhere has arrived, but the German posts ahead are still firing. A cart of household goods passes along the road through the outskirts.")},
    {TEXT("教堂窗玻璃落了一地，墙角的长凳还可坐人。牧师把它拖到避风处，替归来的士兵腾出一点空位。渡口的枪声稍歇，门外又有靴子踏过碎玻璃。"), TEXT("Glass covers the church floor, though a bench remains in the corner. He drags it out of the wind for soldiers returning from the line. The firing at the crossing eases; more boots pass through the glass outside."), TEXT("Glass covers the church floor, though a bench remains in the corner. He drags it out of the wind for soldiers returning from the line. The firing at the crossing eases; more boots pass through the glass outside.")},
    {TEXT("教堂窗玻璃落了一地，墙角的长凳还可坐人。牧师把它拖到避风处，替归来的士兵腾出一点空位。渡口的枪声稍歇，门外又有靴子踏过碎玻璃。"), TEXT("Glass covers the church floor, though a bench remains in the corner. He drags it out of the wind for soldiers returning from the line. The firing at the crossing eases; more boots pass through the glass outside."), TEXT("教堂窗玻璃落了一地，墙角的长凳还可坐人。牧师把它拖到避风处，替归来的士兵腾出一点空位。渡口的枪声稍歇，门外又有靴子踏过碎玻璃。")},
    {TEXT("教堂窗玻璃落了一地，墙角的长凳还可坐人。牧师把它拖到避风处，替归来的士兵腾出一点空位。渡口的枪声稍歇，门外又有靴子踏过碎玻璃。"), TEXT("Glass covers the church floor, though a bench remains in the corner. He drags it out of the wind for soldiers returning from the line. The firing at the crossing eases; more boots pass through the glass outside."), TEXT("步枪手沿渡口接近，军士让担架队留在墙边。后续部队等着前面的回报，携弹手把箱盖重新压紧。运河对岸冒出枪口的火光，传令兵又伏了下去。")},
    {TEXT("教堂窗玻璃落了一地，墙角的长凳还可坐人。牧师把它拖到避风处，替归来的士兵腾出一点空位。渡口的枪声稍歇，门外又有靴子踏过碎玻璃。"), TEXT("Glass covers the church floor, though a bench remains in the corner. He drags it out of the wind for soldiers returning from the line. The firing at the crossing eases; more boots pass through the glass outside."), TEXT("Riflemen approach the crossing. The NCO keeps the stretcher party beside a wall while the following troops wait for a report. A bearer presses his ammunition lid shut. A muzzle flashes across the canal, and the runner lies down again beside the ditch.")},
    {TEXT("十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。"), TEXT("The Western Front armistice took effect at 11 a.m. on 11 November."), TEXT("The Western Front armistice took effect at 11 a.m. on 11 November.")},
    {TEXT("十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。"), TEXT("The Western Front armistice took effect at 11 a.m. on 11 November."), TEXT("十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。")},
    {TEXT("十一月十一日十一时，西线停战生效。"), TEXT("The Western Front armistice took effect at 11 a.m. on 11 November."), TEXT("The Western Front armistice took effect at eleven on eleven November.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · 9 April 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · 9 April 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · 9 April 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · 9 April 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 一九一七年四月九日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 阿拉斯以东 · 1917年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · 9 April 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Arras · Nine April nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("线路兵沿白垩沟找到一截断线，铜丝上粘着湿粉。前哨的电话已经失声，雨雪里只能辨认最近的枪位。他用牙咬住套管，把两头绞在一起。"), TEXT("The linesman finds a broken wire in the chalk ditch, its copper coated with wet dust. The outpost telephone is silent. Sleet leaves only the nearest gun post visible."), TEXT("The linesman finds a broken wire in the chalk ditch, its copper coated with wet dust. The outpost telephone is silent. Sleet leaves only the nearest gun post visible.")},
    {TEXT("线路兵沿白垩沟找到一截断线，铜丝上粘着湿粉。前哨的电话已经失声，雨雪里只能辨认最近的枪位。他用牙咬住套管，把两头绞在一起。"), TEXT("The linesman finds a broken wire in the chalk ditch, its copper coated with wet dust. The outpost telephone is silent. Sleet leaves only the nearest gun post visible."), TEXT("线路兵沿白垩沟找到一截断线，铜丝上粘着湿粉。前哨的电话已经失声，雨雪里只能辨认最近的枪位。他用牙咬住套管，把两头绞在一起。")},
    {TEXT("线路兵沿白垩沟找到一截断线，铜丝上粘着湿粉。前哨的电话已经失声，雨雪里只能辨认最近的枪位。他用牙咬住套管，把两头绞在一起。"), TEXT("The linesman finds a broken wire in the chalk ditch, its copper coated with wet dust. The outpost telephone is silent. Sleet leaves only the nearest gun post visible."), TEXT("前哨的电话只有杂音。雨雪遮住白垩坡，英军已越过被炮击打断的前沿。洞穴里的士兵重新携枪出壕，枪位向连部报来缺弹。")},
    {TEXT("线路兵沿白垩沟找到一截断线，铜丝上粘着湿粉。前哨的电话已经失声，雨雪里只能辨认最近的枪位。他用牙咬住套管，把两头绞在一起。"), TEXT("The linesman finds a broken wire in the chalk ditch, its copper coated with wet dust. The outpost telephone is silent. Sleet leaves only the nearest gun post visible."), TEXT("The outpost telephone gives only static. Sleet hides the chalk slope and British troops have crossed the damaged forward line. Men come out of the caves with their rifles. The gun posts report that ammunition is running short.")},
    {TEXT("试话时，另一端先传来炮声，再传来半句坐标。线路兵在壕壁上记下地址，往松土里压好接头。反击队从身旁穿过，他把线圈举高，让最后一人先走。"), TEXT("When he tests the joint, gunfire comes through before half a coordinate. He marks the address on the trench wall and buries the splice in loose soil. A counterattack party passes; he lifts his coil clear of the last man."), TEXT("When he tests the joint, gunfire comes through before half a coordinate. He marks the address on the trench wall and buries the splice in loose soil. A counterattack party passes; he lifts his coil clear of the last man.")},
    {TEXT("试话时，另一端先传来炮声，再传来半句坐标。线路兵在壕壁上记下地址，往松土里压好接头。反击队从身旁穿过，他把线圈举高，让最后一人先走。"), TEXT("When he tests the joint, gunfire comes through before half a coordinate. He marks the address on the trench wall and buries the splice in loose soil. A counterattack party passes; he lifts his coil clear of the last man."), TEXT("试话时，另一端先传来炮声，再传来半句坐标。线路兵在壕壁上记下地址，往松土里压好接头。反击队从身旁穿过，他把线圈举高，让最后一人先走。")},
    {TEXT("试话时，另一端先传来炮声，再传来半句坐标。线路兵在壕壁上记下地址，往松土里压好接头。反击队从身旁穿过，他把线圈举高，让最后一人先走。"), TEXT("When he tests the joint, gunfire comes through before half a coordinate. He marks the address on the trench wall and buries the splice in loose soil. A counterattack party passes; he lifts his coil clear of the last man."), TEXT("反击队在白垩路旁集合。联络兵循断线找去，坡后的机枪继续射击。携弹手把箱子搬过担架，几个失联哨位尚未报回点名结果。")},
    {TEXT("试话时，另一端先传来炮声，再传来半句坐标。线路兵在壕壁上记下地址，往松土里压好接头。反击队从身旁穿过，他把线圈举高，让最后一人先走。"), TEXT("When he tests the joint, gunfire comes through before half a coordinate. He marks the address on the trench wall and buries the splice in loose soil. A counterattack party passes; he lifts his coil clear of the last man."), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble beside the chalk road. A runner follows the broken wire while the guns beyond the crest keep firing. Bearers carry their boxes past stretchers. Several silent posts have yet to return their rolls.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月中旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月中旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月中旬")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月中旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 一九一七年四月中旬")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 勒厄 · 1917年4月中旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Roeux · Mid-April nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("修理兵把油灯拆开放在厂房楼梯上，灯芯里积满砖粉。地下掩体又涌出一队人，皮带擦得墙灰往下掉。他把灯罩藏到膝间，等他们走完。"), TEXT("The lamp repairer opens an oil lamp on the factory stairs. Brick dust has clogged its wick. Men climb from the shelter, their belts scraping plaster from the wall."), TEXT("The lamp repairer opens an oil lamp on the factory stairs. Brick dust has clogged its wick. Men climb from the shelter, their belts scraping plaster from the wall.")},
    {TEXT("修理兵把油灯拆开放在厂房楼梯上，灯芯里积满砖粉。地下掩体又涌出一队人，皮带擦得墙灰往下掉。他把灯罩藏到膝间，等他们走完。"), TEXT("The lamp repairer opens an oil lamp on the factory stairs. Brick dust has clogged its wick. Men climb from the shelter, their belts scraping plaster from the wall."), TEXT("修理兵把油灯拆开放在厂房楼梯上，灯芯里积满砖粉。地下掩体又涌出一队人，皮带擦得墙灰往下掉。他把灯罩藏到膝间，等他们走完。")},
    {TEXT("修理兵把油灯拆开放在厂房楼梯上，灯芯里积满砖粉。地下掩体又涌出一队人，皮带擦得墙灰往下掉。他把灯罩藏到膝间，等他们走完。"), TEXT("The lamp repairer opens an oil lamp on the factory stairs. Brick dust has clogged its wick. Men climb from the shelter, their belts scraping plaster from the wall."), TEXT("地下掩体的出口落满碎砖，换防人员弯腰钻出。化工厂外已有英军接近，枪手隔着断墙观察壕口。电话线穿过厂房废墟，接线兵只找到一截断头。")},
    {TEXT("修理兵把油灯拆开放在厂房楼梯上，灯芯里积满砖粉。地下掩体又涌出一队人，皮带擦得墙灰往下掉。他把灯罩藏到膝间，等他们走完。"), TEXT("The lamp repairer opens an oil lamp on the factory stairs. Brick dust has clogged its wick. Men climb from the shelter, their belts scraping plaster from the wall."), TEXT("Bricks cover the dugout exit. Reliefs bend low to come out. British troops are approaching the chemical works, and a gunner watches the trench mouth through a broken wall. The linesman finds only a severed end among the factory ruins.")},
    {TEXT("墙外的枪声很近，地下却只看得到火苗照出的台阶。修理兵捻去灯芯上的黑结，把灯挂回出口。又有人把一只破灯递来，玻璃里夹着细小弹屑。"), TEXT("Firing is close outside, but below ground the flame lights only a few steps. He clears the blackened wick and hangs the lamp by the exit. Another broken lamp is handed down, with tiny fragments caught in its glass."), TEXT("Firing is close outside, but below ground the flame lights only a few steps. He clears the blackened wick and hangs the lamp by the exit. Another broken lamp is handed down, with tiny fragments caught in its glass.")},
    {TEXT("墙外的枪声很近，地下却只看得到火苗照出的台阶。修理兵捻去灯芯上的黑结，把灯挂回出口。又有人把一只破灯递来，玻璃里夹着细小弹屑。"), TEXT("Firing is close outside, but below ground the flame lights only a few steps. He clears the blackened wick and hangs the lamp by the exit. Another broken lamp is handed down, with tiny fragments caught in its glass."), TEXT("墙外的枪声很近，地下却只看得到火苗照出的台阶。修理兵捻去灯芯上的黑结，把灯挂回出口。又有人把一只破灯递来，玻璃里夹着细小弹屑。")},
    {TEXT("墙外的枪声很近，地下却只看得到火苗照出的台阶。修理兵捻去灯芯上的黑结，把灯挂回出口。又有人把一只破灯递来，玻璃里夹着细小弹屑。"), TEXT("Firing is close outside, but below ground the flame lights only a few steps. He clears the blackened wick and hangs the lamp by the exit. Another broken lamp is handed down, with tiny fragments caught in its glass."), TEXT("反击队沿铁路堤下集合，携弹兵把箱子交给仍在射击的枪组。军士指着被炮火切断的交通壕，重新安排去路。厂墙另一面的脚步听得很近。")},
    {TEXT("墙外的枪声很近，地下却只看得到火苗照出的台阶。修理兵捻去灯芯上的黑结，把灯挂回出口。又有人把一只破灯递来，玻璃里夹着细小弹屑。"), TEXT("Firing is close outside, but below ground the flame lights only a few steps. He clears the blackened wick and hangs the lamp by the exit. Another broken lamp is handed down, with tiny fragments caught in its glass."), TEXT("Counterattack parties assemble below the railway bank. Bearers hand boxes to a gun still firing. The NCO points to the communication trench cut by shellfire and directs men along another passage. Footsteps sound close on the other side of the wall.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 一九一七年五月三日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布勒库尔 · 1917年5月3日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · 3 May 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bullecourt · Three May nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("送水兵把水桶放到壕角，桶箍撞在枪架上响了一声。掩蔽部里的人正往上走，白垩粉落进还没盖好的桶口。他用外衣遮住水面。"), TEXT("The water carrier sets a bucket at the traverse, its hoop striking a gun mount. Men climb from the dugout. Chalk falls through the uncovered top, and he shelters the water with his coat."), TEXT("The water carrier sets a bucket at the traverse, its hoop striking a gun mount. Men climb from the dugout. Chalk falls through the uncovered top, and he shelters the water with his coat.")},
    {TEXT("送水兵把水桶放到壕角，桶箍撞在枪架上响了一声。掩蔽部里的人正往上走，白垩粉落进还没盖好的桶口。他用外衣遮住水面。"), TEXT("The water carrier sets a bucket at the traverse, its hoop striking a gun mount. Men climb from the dugout. Chalk falls through the uncovered top, and he shelters the water with his coat."), TEXT("送水兵把水桶放到壕角，桶箍撞在枪架上响了一声。掩蔽部里的人正往上走，白垩粉落进还没盖好的桶口。他用外衣遮住水面。")},
    {TEXT("送水兵把水桶放到壕角，桶箍撞在枪架上响了一声。掩蔽部里的人正往上走，白垩粉落进还没盖好的桶口。他用外衣遮住水面。"), TEXT("The water carrier sets a bucket at the traverse, its hoop striking a gun mount. Men climb from the dugout. Chalk falls through the uncovered top, and he shelters the water with his coat."), TEXT("掩蔽部里响起上壕的口令，枪榴弹正在胸墙外爆炸。铁丝之间还压着四月留下的残骸，英澳步兵又从缺口接近。枪组把弹带拖到射位旁边。")},
    {TEXT("送水兵把水桶放到壕角，桶箍撞在枪架上响了一声。掩蔽部里的人正往上走，白垩粉落进还没盖好的桶口。他用外衣遮住水面。"), TEXT("The water carrier sets a bucket at the traverse, its hoop striking a gun mount. Men climb from the dugout. Chalk falls through the uncovered top, and he shelters the water with his coat."), TEXT("The order to man the trench reaches the dugout as rifle grenades burst outside the parapet. April's wreckage still weighs down the wire. British and Australian infantry approach its gaps again. The crew pulls a belt beside the mounting.")},
    {TEXT("机枪旁的一只水壶已经空了，他侧身挤过去填满。胸墙外的枪榴弹又炸开，桶盖在脚边滚了一圈。前队喊着要水，他把壶递出去，桶里只剩浅浅一层。"), TEXT("An empty vessel waits beside the machine gun; he squeezes through to refill it. A rifle grenade bursts beyond the parapet and the bucket lid rolls away. Water is called for ahead; little remains at the bottom."), TEXT("An empty vessel waits beside the machine gun; he squeezes through to refill it. A rifle grenade bursts beyond the parapet and the bucket lid rolls away. Water is called for ahead; little remains at the bottom.")},
    {TEXT("机枪旁的一只水壶已经空了，他侧身挤过去填满。胸墙外的枪榴弹又炸开，桶盖在脚边滚了一圈。前队喊着要水，他把壶递出去，桶里只剩浅浅一层。"), TEXT("An empty vessel waits beside the machine gun; he squeezes through to refill it. A rifle grenade bursts beyond the parapet and the bucket lid rolls away. Water is called for ahead; little remains at the bottom."), TEXT("机枪旁的一只水壶已经空了，他侧身挤过去填满。胸墙外的枪榴弹又炸开，桶盖在脚边滚了一圈。前队喊着要水，他把壶递出去，桶里只剩浅浅一层。")},
    {TEXT("机枪旁的一只水壶已经空了，他侧身挤过去填满。胸墙外的枪榴弹又炸开，桶盖在脚边滚了一圈。前队喊着要水，他把壶递出去，桶里只剩浅浅一层。"), TEXT("An empty vessel waits beside the machine gun; he squeezes through to refill it. A rifle grenade bursts beyond the parapet and the bucket lid rolls away. Water is called for ahead; little remains at the bottom."), TEXT("携弹兵贴着深壕前送，换防队在转角停步。相邻哨位只见烟尘，军士让一名联络兵过去查看。坡面上露出钢盔又消失，枪手转动枪架追着看。")},
    {TEXT("机枪旁的一只水壶已经空了，他侧身挤过去填满。胸墙外的枪榴弹又炸开，桶盖在脚边滚了一圈。前队喊着要水，他把壶递出去，桶里只剩浅浅一层。"), TEXT("An empty vessel waits beside the machine gun; he squeezes through to refill it. A rifle grenade bursts beyond the parapet and the bucket lid rolls away. Water is called for ahead; little remains at the bottom."), TEXT("Bearers follow the deep trench while reliefs halt at a traverse. Smoke hides the neighbouring post. The NCO sends a runner to find it. A helmet appears above the slope and disappears; the gunner turns his mounting to search the ground again.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 一九一七年六月七日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷山脊 · 1917年6月7日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · 7 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Messines Ridge · Seven June nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("工兵用锹柄探到旧掩体入口，松土又从顶上落下。爆破后的坑岸遮住了原来的树，地下木撑只露出一角。他跪下把土拨开，里面传来敲击声。"), TEXT("The sapper probes a buried shelter entrance with his spade handle. More loose soil falls from above. A corner of timber shows beneath the crater edge; tapping comes from inside."), TEXT("The sapper probes a buried shelter entrance with his spade handle. More loose soil falls from above. A corner of timber shows beneath the crater edge; tapping comes from inside.")},
    {TEXT("工兵用锹柄探到旧掩体入口，松土又从顶上落下。爆破后的坑岸遮住了原来的树，地下木撑只露出一角。他跪下把土拨开，里面传来敲击声。"), TEXT("The sapper probes a buried shelter entrance with his spade handle. More loose soil falls from above. A corner of timber shows beneath the crater edge; tapping comes from inside."), TEXT("工兵用锹柄探到旧掩体入口，松土又从顶上落下。爆破后的坑岸遮住了原来的树，地下木撑只露出一角。他跪下把土拨开，里面传来敲击声。")},
    {TEXT("工兵用锹柄探到旧掩体入口，松土又从顶上落下。爆破后的坑岸遮住了原来的树，地下木撑只露出一角。他跪下把土拨开，里面传来敲击声。"), TEXT("The sapper probes a buried shelter entrance with his spade handle. More loose soil falls from above. A corner of timber shows beneath the crater edge; tapping comes from inside."), TEXT("旧壕入口被土埋住，报告里标出的树也找不到了。地下爆炸过后，英军炮火越过山脊。幸存枪位隔着新坑射击，联络兵爬上坑岸再伏下来。")},
    {TEXT("工兵用锹柄探到旧掩体入口，松土又从顶上落下。爆破后的坑岸遮住了原来的树，地下木撑只露出一角。他跪下把土拨开，里面传来敲击声。"), TEXT("The sapper probes a buried shelter entrance with his spade handle. More loose soil falls from above. A corner of timber shows beneath the crater edge; tapping comes from inside."), TEXT("Earth has buried the old trench entrance. The tree marked in the report has disappeared. British shellfire passes over the ridge after the underground explosions. A surviving gun fires across a fresh crater; the runner climbs its lip and drops down.")},
    {TEXT("他把一根横木压在裂口下，叫身旁的人递来铁锹。地面上的枪位已经换到坑边，电话线也垂进新沟里。木撑挪动了一点，他停住手，听里面的人再敲一次。"), TEXT("He braces a beam under the crack and calls for another spade. Guns above have moved to the crater rim, and telephone wire hangs into the new ditch. The support shifts slightly; he stops and listens for another tap."), TEXT("He braces a beam under the crack and calls for another spade. Guns above have moved to the crater rim, and telephone wire hangs into the new ditch. The support shifts slightly; he stops and listens for another tap.")},
    {TEXT("他把一根横木压在裂口下，叫身旁的人递来铁锹。地面上的枪位已经换到坑边，电话线也垂进新沟里。木撑挪动了一点，他停住手，听里面的人再敲一次。"), TEXT("He braces a beam under the crack and calls for another spade. Guns above have moved to the crater rim, and telephone wire hangs into the new ditch. The support shifts slightly; he stops and listens for another tap."), TEXT("他把一根横木压在裂口下，叫身旁的人递来铁锹。地面上的枪位已经换到坑边，电话线也垂进新沟里。木撑挪动了一点，他停住手，听里面的人再敲一次。")},
    {TEXT("他把一根横木压在裂口下，叫身旁的人递来铁锹。地面上的枪位已经换到坑边，电话线也垂进新沟里。木撑挪动了一点，他停住手，听里面的人再敲一次。"), TEXT("He braces a beam under the crack and calls for another spade. Guns above have moved to the crater rim, and telephone wire hangs into the new ditch. The support shifts slightly; he stops and listens for another tap."), TEXT("前来的步枪手沿碎土收拢人员，携弹兵试着下到塌壕里。对面出现新的英军枪口，军士把地图折回原处。他要找的交通壕已在陡壁另一面。")},
    {TEXT("他把一根横木压在裂口下，叫身旁的人递来铁锹。地面上的枪位已经换到坑边，电话线也垂进新沟里。木撑挪动了一点，他停住手，听里面的人再敲一次。"), TEXT("He braces a beam under the crack and calls for another spade. Guns above have moved to the crater rim, and telephone wire hangs into the new ditch. The support shifts slightly; he stops and listens for another tap."), TEXT("Arriving riflemen gather scattered men along the broken slope. Bearers try to reach the collapsed trench. A new British muzzle appears opposite. The NCO folds his map again. The communication trench he needs lies beyond the steep new bank.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · 9 June 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 1917年6月9日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 一九一七年六月九日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅西讷东坡 · 1917年6月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · 9 June 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Messines · Nine June nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("枪组的弹带修理手把湿带铺在膝上，挤出裂开的扣眼里那一粒泥。东坡的反击队还没有出发，机枪停在狭路尽头。他把缝线从弹药盒下抽出来。"), TEXT("The belt repairer spreads a wet belt across his knees and picks mud from a torn pocket. The counterattack party waits on the eastern slope. Its gun stands at the end of a narrow track."), TEXT("The belt repairer spreads a wet belt across his knees and picks mud from a torn pocket. The counterattack party waits on the eastern slope. Its gun stands at the end of a narrow track.")},
    {TEXT("枪组的弹带修理手把湿带铺在膝上，挤出裂开的扣眼里那一粒泥。东坡的反击队还没有出发，机枪停在狭路尽头。他把缝线从弹药盒下抽出来。"), TEXT("The belt repairer spreads a wet belt across his knees and picks mud from a torn pocket. The counterattack party waits on the eastern slope. Its gun stands at the end of a narrow track."), TEXT("枪组的弹带修理手把湿带铺在膝上，挤出裂开的扣眼里那一粒泥。东坡的反击队还没有出发，机枪停在狭路尽头。他把缝线从弹药盒下抽出来。")},
    {TEXT("枪组的弹带修理手把湿带铺在膝上，挤出裂开的扣眼里那一粒泥。东坡的反击队还没有出发，机枪停在狭路尽头。他把缝线从弹药盒下抽出来。"), TEXT("The belt repairer spreads a wet belt across his knees and picks mud from a torn pocket. The counterattack party waits on the eastern slope. Its gun stands at the end of a narrow track."), TEXT("集合处的军士指着坑岸，新接近路从那里转过去。山脊上的英军正在加固胸墙，旧德军壕道已被爆破切断。步枪手轮流爬高，辨认幸存哨位的方向。")},
    {TEXT("枪组的弹带修理手把湿带铺在膝上，挤出裂开的扣眼里那一粒泥。东坡的反击队还没有出发，机枪停在狭路尽头。他把缝线从弹药盒下抽出来。"), TEXT("The belt repairer spreads a wet belt across his knees and picks mud from a torn pocket. The counterattack party waits on the eastern slope. Its gun stands at the end of a narrow track."), TEXT("The NCO points from the assembly place towards a crater lip. The new approach turns there. British troops strengthen the ridge parapet above German trenches cut by explosions. Riflemen climb in turn to locate the surviving posts.")},
    {TEXT("坑岸上已经看得见英军搬动土袋，邻哨却迟迟没有回话。修理手逐节检查弹带，把歪掉的一发取下。命令从坡后送来，他卷好湿带，交给等在枪架旁的人。"), TEXT("British men move sandbags on the crater rim, but the neighbouring post gives no answer. He checks each pocket and removes a crooked round. An order arrives from behind the slope; the wet belt is rolled for the waiting gun."), TEXT("British men move sandbags on the crater rim, but the neighbouring post gives no answer. He checks each pocket and removes a crooked round. An order arrives from behind the slope; the wet belt is rolled for the waiting gun.")},
    {TEXT("坑岸上已经看得见英军搬动土袋，邻哨却迟迟没有回话。修理手逐节检查弹带，把歪掉的一发取下。命令从坡后送来，他卷好湿带，交给等在枪架旁的人。"), TEXT("British men move sandbags on the crater rim, but the neighbouring post gives no answer. He checks each pocket and removes a crooked round. An order arrives from behind the slope; the wet belt is rolled for the waiting gun."), TEXT("坑岸上已经看得见英军搬动土袋，邻哨却迟迟没有回话。修理手逐节检查弹带，把歪掉的一发取下。命令从坡后送来，他卷好湿带，交给等在枪架旁的人。")},
    {TEXT("坑岸上已经看得见英军搬动土袋，邻哨却迟迟没有回话。修理手逐节检查弹带，把歪掉的一发取下。命令从坡后送来，他卷好湿带，交给等在枪架旁的人。"), TEXT("British men move sandbags on the crater rim, but the neighbouring post gives no answer. He checks each pocket and removes a crooked round. An order arrives from behind the slope; the wet belt is rolled for the waiting gun."), TEXT("携弹队从东坡赶来，鞋上带着松土。枪组在狭路尽头等候，前面的联络兵尚未回来。反击队沿坡伏下，能看见对面有人搬动新装满的土袋。")},
    {TEXT("坑岸上已经看得见英军搬动土袋，邻哨却迟迟没有回话。修理手逐节检查弹带，把歪掉的一发取下。命令从坡后送来，他卷好湿带，交给等在枪架旁的人。"), TEXT("British men move sandbags on the crater rim, but the neighbouring post gives no answer. He checks each pocket and removes a crooked round. An order arrives from behind the slope; the wet belt is rolled for the waiting gun."), TEXT("Bearers arrive up the eastern slope with loose earth on their boots. The gun crew waits at the end of the narrow path. Its runner has not returned. The counterattack party lies along the bank, watching men move freshly filled sandbags on the opposite side.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · 31 July 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 一九一七年七月三十一日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 皮尔克姆 · 1917年7月31日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · 31 July 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Pilckem · Thirty-one July nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("修鞋兵把拔下的靴子倒过来，泥水从破缝里流出来。他用锥子穿过泡软的皮面，针线几次滑脱。木板路上的脚步停在积水前，又往旁边挪去。"), TEXT("The boot repairer turns a boot upside down and pours mud from its split seam. His awl goes through the soaked leather. Footsteps stop at a flooded duckboard, then shift aside."), TEXT("The boot repairer turns a boot upside down and pours mud from its split seam. His awl goes through the soaked leather. Footsteps stop at a flooded duckboard, then shift aside.")},
    {TEXT("修鞋兵把拔下的靴子倒过来，泥水从破缝里流出来。他用锥子穿过泡软的皮面，针线几次滑脱。木板路上的脚步停在积水前，又往旁边挪去。"), TEXT("The boot repairer turns a boot upside down and pours mud from its split seam. His awl goes through the soaked leather. Footsteps stop at a flooded duckboard, then shift aside."), TEXT("修鞋兵把拔下的靴子倒过来，泥水从破缝里流出来。他用锥子穿过泡软的皮面，针线几次滑脱。木板路上的脚步停在积水前，又往旁边挪去。")},
    {TEXT("修鞋兵把拔下的靴子倒过来，泥水从破缝里流出来。他用锥子穿过泡软的皮面，针线几次滑脱。木板路上的脚步停在积水前，又往旁边挪去。"), TEXT("The boot repairer turns a boot upside down and pours mud from its split seam. His awl goes through the soaked leather. Footsteps stop at a flooded duckboard, then shift aside."), TEXT("携弹兵停在陷下去的木板前，箱子只能从手上传过去。前沿各枪位被水隔开，英军在雨烟中接近。壕炮组等着炮弹，守望的人不断擦去镜片上的水。")},
    {TEXT("修鞋兵把拔下的靴子倒过来，泥水从破缝里流出来。他用锥子穿过泡软的皮面，针线几次滑脱。木板路上的脚步停在积水前，又往旁边挪去。"), TEXT("The boot repairer turns a boot upside down and pours mud from its split seam. His awl goes through the soaked leather. Footsteps stop at a flooded duckboard, then shift aside."), TEXT("A bearer stops at a sunken plank. His box must pass from hand to hand. Water separates the forward guns as British troops approach through rain and smoke. The mortar crew waits for ammunition. Its lookout keeps wiping the glass.")},
    {TEXT("靴底还没缝完，主人已经伸手来取。修鞋兵递过一条布，让他先裹住裂口。壕炮弹从身旁传过去，留下的鞋印很快灌满水，针还夹在两指之间。"), TEXT("Before the sole is sewn, its owner reaches for it. The repairer gives him cloth to wrap the split. Mortar bombs pass along the trench; the prints they leave fill with water while the needle stays between his fingers."), TEXT("Before the sole is sewn, its owner reaches for it. The repairer gives him cloth to wrap the split. Mortar bombs pass along the trench; the prints they leave fill with water while the needle stays between his fingers.")},
    {TEXT("靴底还没缝完，主人已经伸手来取。修鞋兵递过一条布，让他先裹住裂口。壕炮弹从身旁传过去，留下的鞋印很快灌满水，针还夹在两指之间。"), TEXT("Before the sole is sewn, its owner reaches for it. The repairer gives him cloth to wrap the split. Mortar bombs pass along the trench; the prints they leave fill with water while the needle stays between his fingers."), TEXT("靴底还没缝完，主人已经伸手来取。修鞋兵递过一条布，让他先裹住裂口。壕炮弹从身旁传过去，留下的鞋印很快灌满水，针还夹在两指之间。")},
    {TEXT("靴底还没缝完，主人已经伸手来取。修鞋兵递过一条布，让他先裹住裂口。壕炮弹从身旁传过去，留下的鞋印很快灌满水，针还夹在两指之间。"), TEXT("Before the sole is sewn, its owner reaches for it. The repairer gives him cloth to wrap the split. Mortar bombs pass along the trench; the prints they leave fill with water while the needle stays between his fingers."), TEXT("一条硬路从坑岸后通过，换防队蹲在路边等候。军士让送信的人先走，又向远处枪声张望。邻近的机枪还在响，后方却没有找到过去的路。")},
    {TEXT("靴底还没缝完，主人已经伸手来取。修鞋兵递过一条布，让他先裹住裂口。壕炮弹从身旁传过去，留下的鞋印很快灌满水，针还夹在两指之间。"), TEXT("Before the sole is sewn, its owner reaches for it. The repairer gives him cloth to wrap the split. Mortar bombs pass along the trench; the prints they leave fill with water while the needle stays between his fingers."), TEXT("A firm track passes behind the crater bank. Reliefs crouch beside it while the NCO sends a messenger ahead. He turns towards the distant firing again. The next machine gun can still be heard, but the men behind have found no path to it.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 一九一七年八月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 朗厄马尔克 · 1917年8月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Langemarck · August nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("观察员把潜望镜推过混凝土顶，镜面被雨打成一片灰。田野里的英军正沿窄路接近，他擦去水珠，再看那道农场矮墙。射孔旁的枪手等着他开口。"), TEXT("The observer raises a periscope above the concrete roof. Rain greys the glass. British troops approach along the narrow farm track, while the gunner waits beside the loophole."), TEXT("The observer raises a periscope above the concrete roof. Rain greys the glass. British troops approach along the narrow farm track, while the gunner waits beside the loophole.")},
    {TEXT("观察员把潜望镜推过混凝土顶，镜面被雨打成一片灰。田野里的英军正沿窄路接近，他擦去水珠，再看那道农场矮墙。射孔旁的枪手等着他开口。"), TEXT("The observer raises a periscope above the concrete roof. Rain greys the glass. British troops approach along the narrow farm track, while the gunner waits beside the loophole."), TEXT("观察员把潜望镜推过混凝土顶，镜面被雨打成一片灰。田野里的英军正沿窄路接近，他擦去水珠，再看那道农场矮墙。射孔旁的枪手等着他开口。")},
    {TEXT("观察员把潜望镜推过混凝土顶，镜面被雨打成一片灰。田野里的英军正沿窄路接近，他擦去水珠，再看那道农场矮墙。射孔旁的枪手等着他开口。"), TEXT("The observer raises a periscope above the concrete roof. Rain greys the glass. British troops approach along the narrow farm track, while the gunner waits beside the loophole."), TEXT("混凝土顶上落下灰尘，枪手把眼睛贴回射孔。农场外的田野已经积水，英军沿干路接近。送弹路经过掩体旁，换防人员侧身从弹箱之间穿过。")},
    {TEXT("观察员把潜望镜推过混凝土顶，镜面被雨打成一片灰。田野里的英军正沿窄路接近，他擦去水珠，再看那道农场矮墙。射孔旁的枪手等着他开口。"), TEXT("The observer raises a periscope above the concrete roof. Rain greys the glass. British troops approach along the narrow farm track, while the gunner waits beside the loophole."), TEXT("Dust falls from the concrete roof. The gunner returns his eye to the loophole. Water covers the field outside the farm, and British troops follow the dry approaches. Reliefs squeeze past ammunition boxes on the track beside the shelter.")},
    {TEXT("炮弹落在墙后，镜里只剩翻动的水和泥。观察员把镜杆降回胸前，从入口换到另一面。有人经过时碰响弹箱，他扶住箱盖，示意枪手仍看着原来的路。"), TEXT("A shell falls behind the wall, leaving water and mud turning in the mirror. He lowers the instrument and moves to the other side of the entrance. A passing man rattles an ammunition box; he steadies its lid and points back towards the track."), TEXT("A shell falls behind the wall, leaving water and mud turning in the mirror. He lowers the instrument and moves to the other side of the entrance. A passing man rattles an ammunition box; he steadies its lid and points back towards the track.")},
    {TEXT("炮弹落在墙后，镜里只剩翻动的水和泥。观察员把镜杆降回胸前，从入口换到另一面。有人经过时碰响弹箱，他扶住箱盖，示意枪手仍看着原来的路。"), TEXT("A shell falls behind the wall, leaving water and mud turning in the mirror. He lowers the instrument and moves to the other side of the entrance. A passing man rattles an ammunition box; he steadies its lid and points back towards the track."), TEXT("炮弹落在墙后，镜里只剩翻动的水和泥。观察员把镜杆降回胸前，从入口换到另一面。有人经过时碰响弹箱，他扶住箱盖，示意枪手仍看着原来的路。")},
    {TEXT("炮弹落在墙后，镜里只剩翻动的水和泥。观察员把镜杆降回胸前，从入口换到另一面。有人经过时碰响弹箱，他扶住箱盖，示意枪手仍看着原来的路。"), TEXT("A shell falls behind the wall, leaving water and mud turning in the mirror. He lowers the instrument and moves to the other side of the entrance. A passing man rattles an ammunition box; he steadies its lid and points back towards the track."), TEXT("迫击炮弹落在残墙后面，联络兵听不清邻哨的回答。军士让枪组继续守着入口，自己沿墙走到拐角。水面晃着几个倒影，干路上的脚步却停了。")},
    {TEXT("炮弹落在墙后，镜里只剩翻动的水和泥。观察员把镜杆降回胸前，从入口换到另一面。有人经过时碰响弹箱，他扶住箱盖，示意枪手仍看着原来的路。"), TEXT("A shell falls behind the wall, leaving water and mud turning in the mirror. He lowers the instrument and moves to the other side of the entrance. A passing man rattles an ammunition box; he steadies its lid and points back towards the track."), TEXT("Mortar bombs fall behind the ruined wall. A runner cannot hear the next post's reply. The NCO leaves the crew watching the entrance and follows the wall to its corner. Reflections move on the water, but footsteps on the dry track have stopped.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 一九一七年九月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 梅宁路 · 1917年9月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Menin Road · September nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("绘图员把图钉压在箱盖上，纸角仍被风掀起。林后送来的报告说旧枪位已失，他沿树桩的位置画下新线。墨瓶倾了一下，在边缘留下黑圈。"), TEXT("The draughtsman pins a sheet to a box lid, though wind keeps lifting its corner. A report says the old gun post is lost. He draws a new line along the stumps."), TEXT("The draughtsman pins a sheet to a box lid, though wind keeps lifting its corner. A report says the old gun post is lost. He draws a new line along the stumps.")},
    {TEXT("绘图员把图钉压在箱盖上，纸角仍被风掀起。林后送来的报告说旧枪位已失，他沿树桩的位置画下新线。墨瓶倾了一下，在边缘留下黑圈。"), TEXT("The draughtsman pins a sheet to a box lid, though wind keeps lifting its corner. A report says the old gun post is lost. He draws a new line along the stumps."), TEXT("绘图员把图钉压在箱盖上，纸角仍被风掀起。林后送来的报告说旧枪位已失，他沿树桩的位置画下新线。墨瓶倾了一下，在边缘留下黑圈。")},
    {TEXT("绘图员把图钉压在箱盖上，纸角仍被风掀起。林后送来的报告说旧枪位已失，他沿树桩的位置画下新线。墨瓶倾了一下，在边缘留下黑圈。"), TEXT("The draughtsman pins a sheet to a box lid, though wind keeps lifting its corner. A report says the old gun post is lost. He draws a new line along the stumps."), TEXT("观察员摊开图纸，把前沿标记向林后移了一点。英军炮火还在延伸，新胸墙已出现在树桩之间。预备队沿破路进入林地，枪组停下来等候侧翼消息。")},
    {TEXT("绘图员把图钉压在箱盖上，纸角仍被风掀起。林后送来的报告说旧枪位已失，他沿树桩的位置画下新线。墨瓶倾了一下，在边缘留下黑圈。"), TEXT("The draughtsman pins a sheet to a box lid, though wind keeps lifting its corner. A report says the old gun post is lost. He draws a new line along the stumps."), TEXT("The observer opens his sketch and shifts a forward mark farther into the wood. British shellfire continues to lift. New parapets appear among the stumps. Reserves enter along a broken path; the gun crew stops for news from the flank.")},
    {TEXT("预备队穿过路口，他先把各队去路画在草图上。另一个哨位没有回报，那个方框便留着空白。送图的人蹲在墙边等，他擦干纸面，把还未干的线折到里面。"), TEXT("Reserves pass the junction as he marks their routes on a sketch. Another post has sent no report, leaving its square blank. The runner waits against the wall; the damp sheet is folded with its fresh ink inside."), TEXT("Reserves pass the junction as he marks their routes on a sketch. Another post has sent no report, leaving its square blank. The runner waits against the wall; the damp sheet is folded with its fresh ink inside.")},
    {TEXT("预备队穿过路口，他先把各队去路画在草图上。另一个哨位没有回报，那个方框便留着空白。送图的人蹲在墙边等，他擦干纸面，把还未干的线折到里面。"), TEXT("Reserves pass the junction as he marks their routes on a sketch. Another post has sent no report, leaving its square blank. The runner waits against the wall; the damp sheet is folded with its fresh ink inside."), TEXT("预备队穿过路口，他先把各队去路画在草图上。另一个哨位没有回报，那个方框便留着空白。送图的人蹲在墙边等，他擦干纸面，把还未干的线折到里面。")},
    {TEXT("预备队穿过路口，他先把各队去路画在草图上。另一个哨位没有回报，那个方框便留着空白。送图的人蹲在墙边等，他擦干纸面，把还未干的线折到里面。"), TEXT("Reserves pass the junction as he marks their routes on a sketch. Another post has sent no report, leaving its square blank. The runner waits against the wall; the damp sheet is folded with its fresh ink inside."), TEXT("幸存哨位夹在两军之间，携弹兵不知道该在哪个壕口转弯。军士向断树后打出手势，前队逐人穿过开阔处。观察员的铅笔仍压在那条刚画出的线上。")},
    {TEXT("预备队穿过路口，他先把各队去路画在草图上。另一个哨位没有回报，那个方框便留着空白。送图的人蹲在墙边等，他擦干纸面，把还未干的线折到里面。"), TEXT("Reserves pass the junction as he marks their routes on a sketch. Another post has sent no report, leaving its square blank. The runner waits against the wall; the damp sheet is folded with its fresh ink inside."), TEXT("Surviving posts lie between the forces. A bearer is unsure which trench mouth to take. The NCO signals beyond a shattered tree, and the leading men cross the open patch one at a time. The observer's pencil rests on his fresh line.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · 30 November 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 1917年11月30日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 一九一七年十一月三十日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷突出部 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Salient · Thirty November nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("修理工把扳手放在缴获战车的履带上，手背仍沾着旧油。前沿要车的消息已经送到，车里拆开的零件还铺在地板上。他俯身试了试卡住的连杆。"), TEXT("The mechanic rests his spanner on a captured tank's track, oil still on his hands. The front has asked for vehicles. Dismantled parts cover the floor while he tests a jammed linkage."), TEXT("The mechanic rests his spanner on a captured tank's track, oil still on his hands. The front has asked for vehicles. Dismantled parts cover the floor while he tests a jammed linkage.")},
    {TEXT("修理工把扳手放在缴获战车的履带上，手背仍沾着旧油。前沿要车的消息已经送到，车里拆开的零件还铺在地板上。他俯身试了试卡住的连杆。"), TEXT("The mechanic rests his spanner on a captured tank's track, oil still on his hands. The front has asked for vehicles. Dismantled parts cover the floor while he tests a jammed linkage."), TEXT("修理工把扳手放在缴获战车的履带上，手背仍沾着旧油。前沿要车的消息已经送到，车里拆开的零件还铺在地板上。他俯身试了试卡住的连杆。")},
    {TEXT("修理工把扳手放在缴获战车的履带上，手背仍沾着旧油。前沿要车的消息已经送到，车里拆开的零件还铺在地板上。他俯身试了试卡住的连杆。"), TEXT("The mechanic rests his spanner on a captured tank's track, oil still on his hands. The front has asked for vehicles. Dismantled parts cover the floor while he tests a jammed linkage."), TEXT("反击命令送到枪位。田野里散着上次进攻留下的战车，英军正在修补新胸墙。炮兵向接近线开火，步枪手等待 MG 08/15 枪组收好弹带。")},
    {TEXT("修理工把扳手放在缴获战车的履带上，手背仍沾着旧油。前沿要车的消息已经送到，车里拆开的零件还铺在地板上。他俯身试了试卡住的连杆。"), TEXT("The mechanic rests his spanner on a captured tank's track, oil still on his hands. The front has asked for vehicles. Dismantled parts cover the floor while he tests a jammed linkage."), TEXT("The counterattack order reaches the gun post. Tanks from the earlier fighting lie in the fields. British troops are repairing their new parapets. Our batteries fire on the approaches while the riflemen wait for the MG 08/15 crews to pack their belts.")},
    {TEXT("修理场外的炮火开始了，运输车卷起干土从门口经过。修理工把一枚螺母放回铁盒，叫助手拿来另一根销。发动机暂时没有响，前线的电话又催来一次。"), TEXT("The guns start outside the workshop and transport passes the entrance in dry dust. He returns a nut to its tin and asks for another pin. The engine is still silent when the front telephones again."), TEXT("The guns start outside the workshop and transport passes the entrance in dry dust. He returns a nut to its tin and asks for another pin. The engine is still silent when the front telephones again.")},
    {TEXT("修理场外的炮火开始了，运输车卷起干土从门口经过。修理工把一枚螺母放回铁盒，叫助手拿来另一根销。发动机暂时没有响，前线的电话又催来一次。"), TEXT("The guns start outside the workshop and transport passes the entrance in dry dust. He returns a nut to its tin and asks for another pin. The engine is still silent when the front telephones again."), TEXT("修理场外的炮火开始了，运输车卷起干土从门口经过。修理工把一枚螺母放回铁盒，叫助手拿来另一根销。发动机暂时没有响，前线的电话又催来一次。")},
    {TEXT("修理场外的炮火开始了，运输车卷起干土从门口经过。修理工把一枚螺母放回铁盒，叫助手拿来另一根销。发动机暂时没有响，前线的电话又催来一次。"), TEXT("The guns start outside the workshop and transport passes the entrance in dry dust. He returns a nut to its tin and asks for another pin. The engine is still silent when the front telephones again."), TEXT("交通壕转过一处路口，前面的射孔便看不见了。携弹队在壕角让出通路，担架沿原路回送。修理场里的缴获车辆还未归队，枪手先用两肩把机枪送上坡。")},
    {TEXT("修理场外的炮火开始了，运输车卷起干土从门口经过。修理工把一枚螺母放回铁盒，叫助手拿来另一根销。发动机暂时没有响，前线的电话又催来一次。"), TEXT("The guns start outside the workshop and transport passes the entrance in dry dust. He returns a nut to its tin and asks for another pin. The engine is still silent when the front telephones again."), TEXT("A bend in the communication trench hides the next loophole. Bearers stand aside at the junction and stretchers pass back along the route. Captured vehicles have not left the repair yard; the crew carries its gun up the slope on their shoulders.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 一九一七年十一月三十日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 布尔隆林 · 1917年11月30日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · 30 November 1917"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Bourlon Wood · Thirty November nineteen seventeen")},
    {TEXT("护送兵在布尔隆林外扶住一个走不稳的人，先把他的步枪挎到肩上。林缘的机枪开始射击，浅洼里的人都低下头。伤员手里还攥着剪开的袖扣。"), TEXT("The escort supports an unsteady man outside Bourlon Wood and takes his rifle. A gun starts at the tree line. Heads go down in the hollow; the casualty still holds a cut sleeve button."), TEXT("The escort supports an unsteady man outside Bourlon Wood and takes his rifle. A gun starts at the tree line. Heads go down in the hollow; the casualty still holds a cut sleeve button.")},
    {TEXT("护送兵在布尔隆林外扶住一个走不稳的人，先把他的步枪挎到肩上。林缘的机枪开始射击，浅洼里的人都低下头。伤员手里还攥着剪开的袖扣。"), TEXT("The escort supports an unsteady man outside Bourlon Wood and takes his rifle. A gun starts at the tree line. Heads go down in the hollow; the casualty still holds a cut sleeve button."), TEXT("护送兵在布尔隆林外扶住一个走不稳的人，先把他的步枪挎到肩上。林缘的机枪开始射击，浅洼里的人都低下头。伤员手里还攥着剪开的袖扣。")},
    {TEXT("护送兵在布尔隆林外扶住一个走不稳的人，先把他的步枪挎到肩上。林缘的机枪开始射击，浅洼里的人都低下头。伤员手里还攥着剪开的袖扣。"), TEXT("The escort supports an unsteady man outside Bourlon Wood and takes his rifle. A gun starts at the tree line. Heads go down in the hollow; the casualty still holds a cut sleeve button."), TEXT("浅洼里的人压低枪口，前面林缘又响起一阵机枪声。英军把枪位转向道路，突出部的伤员还在往外送。反击队沿受损壕沟接近，携弹兵跟着最后一人。")},
    {TEXT("护送兵在布尔隆林外扶住一个走不稳的人，先把他的步枪挎到肩上。林缘的机枪开始射击，浅洼里的人都低下头。伤员手里还攥着剪开的袖扣。"), TEXT("The escort supports an unsteady man outside Bourlon Wood and takes his rifle. A gun starts at the tree line. Heads go down in the hollow; the casualty still holds a cut sleeve button."), TEXT("Men in the hollow lower their muzzles as another burst comes from the tree line. British guns face the road, where wounded men are still leaving the salient. The counterattack follows a damaged trench with bearers behind the last rifleman.")},
    {TEXT("路口有车逆着人流往前走，护送兵让到断树后等候。炮兵联络兵经过，问他们从哪个壕口出来。他指向林里，又把伤员扶起，沿有脚印的那一侧继续走。"), TEXT("A vehicle moves against the foot traffic, forcing them behind a broken tree. An artillery runner asks which trench they came from. The escort points into the wood, helps the man stand and follows the side of the road marked by footprints."), TEXT("A vehicle moves against the foot traffic, forcing them behind a broken tree. An artillery runner asks which trench they came from. The escort points into the wood, helps the man stand and follows the side of the road marked by footprints.")},
    {TEXT("路口有车逆着人流往前走，护送兵让到断树后等候。炮兵联络兵经过，问他们从哪个壕口出来。他指向林里，又把伤员扶起，沿有脚印的那一侧继续走。"), TEXT("A vehicle moves against the foot traffic, forcing them behind a broken tree. An artillery runner asks which trench they came from. The escort points into the wood, helps the man stand and follows the side of the road marked by footprints."), TEXT("路口有车逆着人流往前走，护送兵让到断树后等候。炮兵联络兵经过，问他们从哪个壕口出来。他指向林里，又把伤员扶起，沿有脚印的那一侧继续走。")},
    {TEXT("路口有车逆着人流往前走，护送兵让到断树后等候。炮兵联络兵经过，问他们从哪个壕口出来。他指向林里，又把伤员扶起，沿有脚印的那一侧继续走。"), TEXT("A vehicle moves against the foot traffic, forcing them behind a broken tree. An artillery runner asks which trench they came from. The escort points into the wood, helps the man stand and follows the side of the road marked by footprints."), TEXT("断树把邻队遮住，炮兵联络兵在壕口停下来核对位置。道路上有车辆逆着退回的人流前行。军士伏到沟边，伸手拦住准备穿过缺口的步枪手。")},
    {TEXT("路口有车逆着人流往前走，护送兵让到断树后等候。炮兵联络兵经过，问他们从哪个壕口出来。他指向林里，又把伤员扶起，沿有脚印的那一侧继续走。"), TEXT("A vehicle moves against the foot traffic, forcing them behind a broken tree. An artillery runner asks which trench they came from. The escort points into the wood, helps the man stand and follows the side of the road marked by footprints."), TEXT("Broken trees hide the next party. An artillery runner stops at the trench mouth to check his position. Vehicles move against the returning traffic on the road. The NCO lies beside the ditch and stops a rifleman about to cross the gap.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 一九一八年二月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 康布雷前线 · 1918年2月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Cambrai Front · February nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("勤务兵把怀表放在掩体桌上，拨针的人刚报完出发时刻。他听见外面的巡逻扣紧装具，又用干布擦去表盖上的霜。炉里的余火只照亮半张地图。"), TEXT("The orderly lays a pocket watch on the dugout table after the departure time is read. Outside, a patrol tightens its equipment. He wipes frost from the case in the low stove light."), TEXT("The orderly lays a pocket watch on the dugout table after the departure time is read. Outside, a patrol tightens its equipment. He wipes frost from the case in the low stove light.")},
    {TEXT("勤务兵把怀表放在掩体桌上，拨针的人刚报完出发时刻。他听见外面的巡逻扣紧装具，又用干布擦去表盖上的霜。炉里的余火只照亮半张地图。"), TEXT("The orderly lays a pocket watch on the dugout table after the departure time is read. Outside, a patrol tightens its equipment. He wipes frost from the case in the low stove light."), TEXT("勤务兵把怀表放在掩体桌上，拨针的人刚报完出发时刻。他听见外面的巡逻扣紧装具，又用干布擦去表盖上的霜。炉里的余火只照亮半张地图。")},
    {TEXT("勤务兵把怀表放在掩体桌上，拨针的人刚报完出发时刻。他听见外面的巡逻扣紧装具，又用干布擦去表盖上的霜。炉里的余火只照亮半张地图。"), TEXT("The orderly lays a pocket watch on the dugout table after the departure time is read. Outside, a patrol tightens its equipment. He wipes frost from the case in the low stove light."), TEXT("壕边的雪里有新脚印，前哨却没有回话。接线兵收起断头，顺着湿沟查找另一段线。轻装队把松动的器材系紧，等天色暗下来再离开胸墙。")},
    {TEXT("勤务兵把怀表放在掩体桌上，拨针的人刚报完出发时刻。他听见外面的巡逻扣紧装具，又用干布擦去表盖上的霜。炉里的余火只照亮半张地图。"), TEXT("The orderly lays a pocket watch on the dugout table after the departure time is read. Outside, a patrol tightens its equipment. He wipes frost from the case in the low stove light."), TEXT("Fresh tracks mark the snow beside the trench, but the outpost gives no answer. The linesman collects a broken end and searches along the wet ditch. A light party fastens its loose equipment before leaving the parapet after dark.")},
    {TEXT("军官带走地图，桌上只剩一枚脱下的手套。勤务兵把表交回去，到入口看看巡逻是否已经出壕。照明弹升起时，门帘被风掀开，他伸手把它压住。"), TEXT("The officer takes the map, leaving a glove behind. The orderly returns the watch and checks whether the patrol has left. A flare rises; wind lifts the entrance curtain, and he holds it down with his hand."), TEXT("The officer takes the map, leaving a glove behind. The orderly returns the watch and checks whether the patrol has left. A flare rises; wind lifts the entrance curtain, and he holds it down with his hand.")},
    {TEXT("军官带走地图，桌上只剩一枚脱下的手套。勤务兵把表交回去，到入口看看巡逻是否已经出壕。照明弹升起时，门帘被风掀开，他伸手把它压住。"), TEXT("The officer takes the map, leaving a glove behind. The orderly returns the watch and checks whether the patrol has left. A flare rises; wind lifts the entrance curtain, and he holds it down with his hand."), TEXT("军官带走地图，桌上只剩一枚脱下的手套。勤务兵把表交回去，到入口看看巡逻是否已经出壕。照明弹升起时，门帘被风掀开，他伸手把它压住。")},
    {TEXT("军官带走地图，桌上只剩一枚脱下的手套。勤务兵把表交回去，到入口看看巡逻是否已经出壕。照明弹升起时，门帘被风掀开，他伸手把它压住。"), TEXT("The officer takes the map, leaving a glove behind. The orderly returns the watch and checks whether the patrol has left. A flare rises; wind lifts the entrance curtain, and he holds it down with his hand."), TEXT("留守的枪组听见远处零星射击，换防队已经到达后壕。巡逻队在拐角留下一个人，前队消失在铁丝后面。军士靠着壕壁等候，手里的电话没有响。")},
    {TEXT("军官带走地图，桌上只剩一枚脱下的手套。勤务兵把表交回去，到入口看看巡逻是否已经出壕。照明弹升起时，门帘被风掀开，他伸手把它压住。"), TEXT("The officer takes the map, leaving a glove behind. The orderly returns the watch and checks whether the patrol has left. A flare rises; wind lifts the entrance curtain, and he holds it down with his hand."), TEXT("The remaining gun crew hears scattered shots. Reliefs have reached the rear trench. The patrol leaves a man at the bend and vanishes beyond the wire. The duty NCO waits against the wall, with the silent telephone receiver still held beside his ear.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 一九一八年三月二十一日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 圣康坦方向 · 1918年3月21日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · 21 March 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · St Quentin Sector · Twenty-one March nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("工兵把剪钳推到旧铁丝下面，雾里只看得清最近的一根立柱。先遣队已向破壕走去，他压住钳柄，让断股贴着地面落下。棉手套上挂满细刺。"), TEXT("The sapper slips his cutters beneath old wire. Only the nearest post shows in the fog. The leading troops reach the broken trench as he lowers a severed strand to the ground."), TEXT("The sapper slips his cutters beneath old wire. Only the nearest post shows in the fog. The leading troops reach the broken trench as he lowers a severed strand to the ground.")},
    {TEXT("工兵把剪钳推到旧铁丝下面，雾里只看得清最近的一根立柱。先遣队已向破壕走去，他压住钳柄，让断股贴着地面落下。棉手套上挂满细刺。"), TEXT("The sapper slips his cutters beneath old wire. Only the nearest post shows in the fog. The leading troops reach the broken trench as he lowers a severed strand to the ground."), TEXT("工兵把剪钳推到旧铁丝下面，雾里只看得清最近的一根立柱。先遣队已向破壕走去，他压住钳柄，让断股贴着地面落下。棉手套上挂满细刺。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把剪钳推到旧铁丝下面，雾里只看得清最近的一根立柱。先遣队已向破壕走去，他压住钳柄，让断股贴着地面落下。棉手套上挂满细刺。"), TEXT("The sapper slips his cutters beneath old wire. Only the nearest post shows in the fog. The leading troops reach the broken trench as he lowers a severed strand to the ground."), TEXT("先遣步枪手越过破壕，雾里只看得见最近的人。英军第五集团军的支点之间有缺口，炮火继续向后延伸。枪组抬着器材跟上，携弹队还在寻找穿过旧铁丝的路。")},
    {TEXT("工兵把剪钳推到旧铁丝下面，雾里只看得清最近的一根立柱。先遣队已向破壕走去，他压住钳柄，让断股贴着地面落下。棉手套上挂满细刺。"), TEXT("The sapper slips his cutters beneath old wire. Only the nearest post shows in the fog. The leading troops reach the broken trench as he lowers a severed strand to the ground."), TEXT("The leading riflemen cross a broken trench. Only the nearest men show in the fog. Gaps open between British Fifth Army strongpoints while the barrage moves farther back. The gun crew follows with its equipment; bearers search for a path through the old wire.")},
    {TEXT("枪架从缺口抬过去，后面的人又把弹箱卡在丝上。工兵转回半步，剪开剩下那一股。炮声向更远处延伸，他把断丝卷到立柱旁，跟着最后一只箱子离开。"), TEXT("A gun mount passes the gap, but an ammunition box catches behind it. He cuts the remaining strand. The guns shift farther away; he rolls the loose wire against the post and leaves after the last box."), TEXT("A gun mount passes the gap, but an ammunition box catches behind it. He cuts the remaining strand. The guns shift farther away; he rolls the loose wire against the post and leaves after the last box.")},
    {TEXT("枪架从缺口抬过去，后面的人又把弹箱卡在丝上。工兵转回半步，剪开剩下那一股。炮声向更远处延伸，他把断丝卷到立柱旁，跟着最后一只箱子离开。"), TEXT("A gun mount passes the gap, but an ammunition box catches behind it. He cuts the remaining strand. The guns shift farther away; he rolls the loose wire against the post and leaves after the last box."), TEXT("枪架从缺口抬过去，后面的人又把弹箱卡在丝上。工兵转回半步，剪开剩下那一股。炮声向更远处延伸，他把断丝卷到立柱旁，跟着最后一只箱子离开。")},
    {TEXT("枪架从缺口抬过去，后面的人又把弹箱卡在丝上。工兵转回半步，剪开剩下那一股。炮声向更远处延伸，他把断丝卷到立柱旁，跟着最后一只箱子离开。"), TEXT("A gun mount passes the gap, but an ammunition box catches behind it. He cuts the remaining strand. The guns shift farther away; he rolls the loose wire against the post and leaves after the last box."), TEXT("前队已经接近公路，侧翼却没有报回位置。联络兵在壕口摊开地图，军士向他指了指身后的长路。弹箱上的绳子磨松了，携弹手停下重新打结。")},
    {TEXT("枪架从缺口抬过去，后面的人又把弹箱卡在丝上。工兵转回半步，剪开剩下那一股。炮声向更远处延伸，他把断丝卷到立柱旁，跟着最后一只箱子离开。"), TEXT("A gun mount passes the gap, but an ammunition box catches behind it. He cuts the remaining strand. The guns shift farther away; he rolls the loose wire against the post and leaves after the last box."), TEXT("The road is close ahead, but the flank has sent no position. A runner opens his map at the trench mouth. The NCO points back along their lengthening route. A loose rope on an ammunition box needs tying again.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 一九一八年四月九日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 利斯河低地 · 1918年4月9日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · 9 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Lys Lowlands · Nine April nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("信鸽兵把鸽笼靠在利斯河沟旁，鸟爪扣着被雨打湿的木条。刚递来的纸片只有一行地址，他把它卷进小管。河对岸的枪声让笼里的翅膀碰响两次。"), TEXT("The pigeon keeper sets a basket beside a Lys ditch. Claws grip its wet wooden slats. He rolls a message bearing a single address into the capsule as gunfire disturbs the wings inside."), TEXT("The pigeon keeper sets a basket beside a Lys ditch. Claws grip its wet wooden slats. He rolls a message bearing a single address into the capsule as gunfire disturbs the wings inside.")},
    {TEXT("信鸽兵把鸽笼靠在利斯河沟旁，鸟爪扣着被雨打湿的木条。刚递来的纸片只有一行地址，他把它卷进小管。河对岸的枪声让笼里的翅膀碰响两次。"), TEXT("The pigeon keeper sets a basket beside a Lys ditch. Claws grip its wet wooden slats. He rolls a message bearing a single address into the capsule as gunfire disturbs the wings inside."), TEXT("信鸽兵把鸽笼靠在利斯河沟旁，鸟爪扣着被雨打湿的木条。刚递来的纸片只有一行地址，他把它卷进小管。河对岸的枪声让笼里的翅膀碰响两次。")},
    {TEXT("信鸽兵把鸽笼靠在利斯河沟旁，鸟爪扣着被雨打湿的木条。刚递来的纸片只有一行地址，他把它卷进小管。河对岸的枪声让笼里的翅膀碰响两次。"), TEXT("The pigeon keeper sets a basket beside a Lys ditch. Claws grip its wet wooden slats. He rolls a message bearing a single address into the capsule as gunfire disturbs the wings inside."), TEXT("枪架在软土里陷下去，后面的携弹兵赶来帮忙。前队已经越过河沟，向葡英阵位之间的缺口前进。路口还有英军哨位射击，水沟两侧的人都伏下来。")},
    {TEXT("信鸽兵把鸽笼靠在利斯河沟旁，鸟爪扣着被雨打湿的木条。刚递来的纸片只有一行地址，他把它卷进小管。河对岸的枪声让笼里的翅膀碰响两次。"), TEXT("The pigeon keeper sets a basket beside a Lys ditch. Claws grip its wet wooden slats. He rolls a message bearing a single address into the capsule as gunfire disturbs the wings inside."), TEXT("The mounting sinks into soft ground. Bearers behind the crew help lift it. The leading men have crossed the ditch towards a gap between Portuguese and British positions. A British post still fires from the junction, forcing both banks down.")},
    {TEXT("前队已经越过河沟，渡口的车辆还没有动。他掀开笼门，把鸟托到避风的一面。鸽子飞过低墙便看不见了，空笼里只留下沾在门轴上的一片灰羽。"), TEXT("The leading troops have crossed the ditch, but vehicles wait at the ford. He opens the basket and lifts the bird out of the wind. It disappears beyond a low wall; a grey feather remains at the hinge."), TEXT("The leading troops have crossed the ditch, but vehicles wait at the ford. He opens the basket and lifts the bird out of the wind. It disappears beyond a low wall; a grey feather remains at the hinge.")},
    {TEXT("前队已经越过河沟，渡口的车辆还没有动。他掀开笼门，把鸟托到避风的一面。鸽子飞过低墙便看不见了，空笼里只留下沾在门轴上的一片灰羽。"), TEXT("The leading troops have crossed the ditch, but vehicles wait at the ford. He opens the basket and lifts the bird out of the wind. It disappears beyond a low wall; a grey feather remains at the hinge."), TEXT("前队已经越过河沟，渡口的车辆还没有动。他掀开笼门，把鸟托到避风的一面。鸽子飞过低墙便看不见了，空笼里只留下沾在门轴上的一片灰羽。")},
    {TEXT("前队已经越过河沟，渡口的车辆还没有动。他掀开笼门，把鸟托到避风的一面。鸽子飞过低墙便看不见了，空笼里只留下沾在门轴上的一片灰羽。"), TEXT("The leading troops have crossed the ditch, but vehicles wait at the ford. He opens the basket and lifts the bird out of the wind. It disappears beyond a low wall; a grey feather remains at the hinge."), TEXT("军士沿较硬的地面寻找邻队，传令兵从另一条沟里回来。后方的补给尚在渡口，枪组只能先把现有弹箱搬上岸。前队的手势隔着水面显得很小。")},
    {TEXT("前队已经越过河沟，渡口的车辆还没有动。他掀开笼门，把鸟托到避风的一面。鸽子飞过低墙便看不见了，空笼里只留下沾在门轴上的一片灰羽。"), TEXT("The leading troops have crossed the ditch, but vehicles wait at the ford. He opens the basket and lifts the bird out of the wind. It disappears beyond a low wall; a grey feather remains at the hinge."), TEXT("The NCO follows firmer ground in search of the next party. A runner returns through another ditch. Supplies remain at the crossing. The crew carries its remaining boxes onto the bank, watching a small hand signal from the men across the water.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 一九一八年四月二十四日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 维莱布勒托讷 · 1918年4月24日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · 24 April 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Villers-Bretonneux · Twenty-four April nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("车组助手从发动机旁钻出来，袖口在热管上擦过。村口的战车正在转向，他摸到松开的扣带，把器材重新系紧。果园外有人敲响车壁。"), TEXT("The crew assistant climbs away from the engine, his sleeve brushing a hot pipe. The tank turns at the village entrance. He tightens a loose strap as someone knocks on the hull outside."), TEXT("The crew assistant climbs away from the engine, his sleeve brushing a hot pipe. The tank turns at the village entrance. He tightens a loose strap as someone knocks on the hull outside.")},
    {TEXT("车组助手从发动机旁钻出来，袖口在热管上擦过。村口的战车正在转向，他摸到松开的扣带，把器材重新系紧。果园外有人敲响车壁。"), TEXT("The crew assistant climbs away from the engine, his sleeve brushing a hot pipe. The tank turns at the village entrance. He tightens a loose strap as someone knocks on the hull outside."), TEXT("车组助手从发动机旁钻出来，袖口在热管上擦过。村口的战车正在转向，他摸到松开的扣带，把器材重新系紧。果园外有人敲响车壁。")},
    {TEXT("车组助手从发动机旁钻出来，袖口在热管上擦过。村口的战车正在转向，他摸到松开的扣带，把器材重新系紧。果园外有人敲响车壁。"), TEXT("The crew assistant climbs away from the engine, his sleeve brushing a hot pipe. The tank turns at the village entrance. He tightens a loose strap as someone knocks on the hull outside."), TEXT("村口的战车转向路口，步兵借着车侧经过果园。英军装甲在近郊开火，断墙后也有步枪声。车组看不见小巷，前队停在墙角，等后面的人靠近。")},
    {TEXT("车组助手从发动机旁钻出来，袖口在热管上擦过。村口的战车正在转向，他摸到松开的扣带，把器材重新系紧。果园外有人敲响车壁。"), TEXT("The crew assistant climbs away from the engine, his sleeve brushing a hot pipe. The tank turns at the village entrance. He tightens a loose strap as someone knocks on the hull outside."), TEXT("A tank turns at the village entrance and infantry pass the orchard beside its flank. British armour fires from the outskirts. Rifles answer behind a broken wall. The crew cannot see the lane, where the leading men wait for those behind.")},
    {TEXT("前面的车组看不见侧巷，他俯到观察口寻找步兵手势。炮弹打起的碎砖遮住了路牌，枪声从门洞里传来。他用手指在隔板上划出方向，等驾驶员再转一次。"), TEXT("The driver cannot see the side alley, so the assistant looks for infantry gestures through a port. Broken brick hides the signpost and firing comes from a doorway. He traces a direction on the partition and waits for another turn."), TEXT("The driver cannot see the side alley, so the assistant looks for infantry gestures through a port. Broken brick hides the signpost and firing comes from a doorway. He traces a direction on the partition and waits for another turn.")},
    {TEXT("前面的车组看不见侧巷，他俯到观察口寻找步兵手势。炮弹打起的碎砖遮住了路牌，枪声从门洞里传来。他用手指在隔板上划出方向，等驾驶员再转一次。"), TEXT("The driver cannot see the side alley, so the assistant looks for infantry gestures through a port. Broken brick hides the signpost and firing comes from a doorway. He traces a direction on the partition and waits for another turn."), TEXT("前面的车组看不见侧巷，他俯到观察口寻找步兵手势。炮弹打起的碎砖遮住了路牌，枪声从门洞里传来。他用手指在隔板上划出方向，等驾驶员再转一次。")},
    {TEXT("前面的车组看不见侧巷，他俯到观察口寻找步兵手势。炮弹打起的碎砖遮住了路牌，枪声从门洞里传来。他用手指在隔板上划出方向，等驾驶员再转一次。"), TEXT("The driver cannot see the side alley, so the assistant looks for infantry gestures through a port. Broken brick hides the signpost and firing comes from a doorway. He traces a direction on the partition and waits for another turn."), TEXT("携弹兵沿村道赶来，军士让一班步枪手进入侧巷。履带声绕过建筑又传回来，车影已经被挡住。门洞里一阵射击，走在最前面的人立刻贴住砖墙。")},
    {TEXT("前面的车组看不见侧巷，他俯到观察口寻找步兵手势。炮弹打起的碎砖遮住了路牌，枪声从门洞里传来。他用手指在隔板上划出方向，等驾驶员再转一次。"), TEXT("The driver cannot see the side alley, so the assistant looks for infantry gestures through a port. Broken brick hides the signpost and firing comes from a doorway. He traces a direction on the partition and waits for another turn."), TEXT("Bearers arrive along the village road. The NCO sends a section into a side alley. Tracks can be heard beyond the buildings, but the vehicle is hidden. A burst comes from a doorway and the first rifleman presses against the bricks.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 一九一八年八月八日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 亚眠以东 · 1918年8月8日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · 8 August 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · East of Amiens · Eight August nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("传令兵在雾里找到约定的矮墙，墙后却只剩一只翻倒的电话。他把纸袋贴在胸前，沿发动机声传来的方向蹲下。路上有部队退回来，没人说清前队在哪里。"), TEXT("The runner finds the appointed wall in the fog, with only an overturned telephone behind it. He holds his envelope close and crouches towards the engine noise. Retreating men cannot locate the leading troops."), TEXT("The runner finds the appointed wall in the fog, with only an overturned telephone behind it. He holds his envelope close and crouches towards the engine noise. Retreating men cannot locate the leading troops.")},
    {TEXT("传令兵在雾里找到约定的矮墙，墙后却只剩一只翻倒的电话。他把纸袋贴在胸前，沿发动机声传来的方向蹲下。路上有部队退回来，没人说清前队在哪里。"), TEXT("The runner finds the appointed wall in the fog, with only an overturned telephone behind it. He holds his envelope close and crouches towards the engine noise. Retreating men cannot locate the leading troops."), TEXT("传令兵在雾里找到约定的矮墙，墙后却只剩一只翻倒的电话。他把纸袋贴在胸前，沿发动机声传来的方向蹲下。路上有部队退回来，没人说清前队在哪里。")},
    {TEXT("传令兵在雾里找到约定的矮墙，墙后却只剩一只翻倒的电话。他把纸袋贴在胸前，沿发动机声传来的方向蹲下。路上有部队退回来，没人说清前队在哪里。"), TEXT("The runner finds the appointed wall in the fog, with only an overturned telephone behind it. He holds his envelope close and crouches towards the engine noise. Retreating men cannot locate the leading troops."), TEXT("前哨的报告上写着战车，送信的人却说不清邻队在哪里。雾中的田野传来发动机声，路口挤满返回部队。反坦克枪组把器材放下，朝来路寻找射位。")},
    {TEXT("传令兵在雾里找到约定的矮墙，墙后却只剩一只翻倒的电话。他把纸袋贴在胸前，沿发动机声传来的方向蹲下。路上有部队退回来，没人说清前队在哪里。"), TEXT("The runner finds the appointed wall in the fog, with only an overturned telephone behind it. He holds his envelope close and crouches towards the engine noise. Retreating men cannot locate the leading troops."), TEXT("The report names tanks, but its runner cannot place the neighbouring unit. Engines sound across the misty fields. Returning troops crowd the junction. The anti-tank crew lowers its equipment and searches for a position facing the approach.")},
    {TEXT("新枪位在另一处残墙下，他把命令交给满身泥土的军官。纸上写的路口已经堵满车辆，铅笔便划向旁边的小沟。传令兵收好回执，鞋带断了一头也没有停下。"), TEXT("At another wall he gives the order to a mud-covered officer. Vehicles fill the junction named on the sheet, so a pencil points to a side ditch. The runner pockets the receipt and leaves with one lace broken."), TEXT("At another wall he gives the order to a mud-covered officer. Vehicles fill the junction named on the sheet, so a pencil points to a side ditch. The runner pockets the receipt and leaves with one lace broken.")},
    {TEXT("新枪位在另一处残墙下，他把命令交给满身泥土的军官。纸上写的路口已经堵满车辆，铅笔便划向旁边的小沟。传令兵收好回执，鞋带断了一头也没有停下。"), TEXT("At another wall he gives the order to a mud-covered officer. Vehicles fill the junction named on the sheet, so a pencil points to a side ditch. The runner pockets the receipt and leaves with one lace broken."), TEXT("新枪位在另一处残墙下，他把命令交给满身泥土的军官。纸上写的路口已经堵满车辆，铅笔便划向旁边的小沟。传令兵收好回执，鞋带断了一头也没有停下。")},
    {TEXT("新枪位在另一处残墙下，他把命令交给满身泥土的军官。纸上写的路口已经堵满车辆，铅笔便划向旁边的小沟。传令兵收好回执，鞋带断了一头也没有停下。"), TEXT("At another wall he gives the order to a mud-covered officer. Vehicles fill the junction named on the sheet, so a pencil points to a side ditch. The runner pockets the receipt and leaves with one lace broken."), TEXT("机枪掩护孤立阵位撤出的人，增援在另一侧逆向通过。军士把携弹手叫到残墙下，逐个问前面的情况。一名满身泥土的士兵指向雾里，手仍没有放下。")},
    {TEXT("新枪位在另一处残墙下，他把命令交给满身泥土的军官。纸上写的路口已经堵满车辆，铅笔便划向旁边的小沟。传令兵收好回执，鞋带断了一头也没有停下。"), TEXT("At another wall he gives the order to a mud-covered officer. Vehicles fill the junction named on the sheet, so a pencil points to a side ditch. The runner pockets the receipt and leaves with one lace broken."), TEXT("A machine gun covers men leaving isolated posts while reinforcements pass the other way. The NCO calls bearers under the ruined wall and asks each about the front. One soldier covered in mud points into the mist. His arm stays raised as more men pass.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月下旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月下旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月下旬")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月下旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 一九一八年八月下旬")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 斯卡尔普 · 1918年8月下旬"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Scarpe · Late August nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("葬埋兵从白垩里取出一块姓名牌，把它擦净放进布袋。旧铁丝横过撤回路，旁边的铲柄已经裂开。他换到较软的地面，先让过经过的炮车。"), TEXT("The burial detail recovers a name tag from the chalk and wipes it clean for a cloth bag. Old wire crosses the withdrawal route. With a split spade handle, he waits for a gun wagon to pass."), TEXT("The burial detail recovers a name tag from the chalk and wipes it clean for a cloth bag. Old wire crosses the withdrawal route. With a split spade handle, he waits for a gun wagon to pass.")},
    {TEXT("葬埋兵从白垩里取出一块姓名牌，把它擦净放进布袋。旧铁丝横过撤回路，旁边的铲柄已经裂开。他换到较软的地面，先让过经过的炮车。"), TEXT("The burial detail recovers a name tag from the chalk and wipes it clean for a cloth bag. Old wire crosses the withdrawal route. With a split spade handle, he waits for a gun wagon to pass."), TEXT("葬埋兵从白垩里取出一块姓名牌，把它擦净放进布袋。旧铁丝横过撤回路，旁边的铲柄已经裂开。他换到较软的地面，先让过经过的炮车。")},
    {TEXT("葬埋兵从白垩里取出一块姓名牌，把它擦净放进布袋。旧铁丝横过撤回路，旁边的铲柄已经裂开。他换到较软的地面，先让过经过的炮车。"), TEXT("The burial detail recovers a name tag from the chalk and wipes it clean for a cloth bag. Old wire crosses the withdrawal route. With a split spade handle, he waits for a gun wagon to pass."), TEXT("旧铁丝横在撤回路上，工兵蹲下把断股搬开。加拿大部队已穿过前方阵位，村边的枪组还在射击。炮火又翻出遗弃弹药，白垩土里露着一枚弹尖。")},
    {TEXT("葬埋兵从白垩里取出一块姓名牌，把它擦净放进布袋。旧铁丝横过撤回路，旁边的铲柄已经裂开。他换到较软的地面，先让过经过的炮车。"), TEXT("The burial detail recovers a name tag from the chalk and wipes it clean for a cloth bag. Old wire crosses the withdrawal route. With a split spade handle, he waits for a gun wagon to pass."), TEXT("Old wire crosses the withdrawal route. A pioneer crouches to move the broken strands. Canadian troops have passed the forward works, and guns still fire beside the village. Shellfire exposes abandoned ammunition, leaving a pointed shell in the chalk.")},
    {TEXT("村口枪声没有停，另一名士兵送来一张位置草图。他把新土旁的木桩扶直，在纸上记下田界。撤离口令从路上传来，他捡起断铲，袋口仍用手按着。"), TEXT("Firing continues at the village as another man brings a location sketch. He straightens a stake beside the fresh earth and marks the field boundary. The withdrawal order comes down the road; he gathers the broken spade and closes the bag."), TEXT("Firing continues at the village as another man brings a location sketch. He straightens a stake beside the fresh earth and marks the field boundary. The withdrawal order comes down the road; he gathers the broken spade and closes the bag.")},
    {TEXT("村口枪声没有停，另一名士兵送来一张位置草图。他把新土旁的木桩扶直，在纸上记下田界。撤离口令从路上传来，他捡起断铲，袋口仍用手按着。"), TEXT("Firing continues at the village as another man brings a location sketch. He straightens a stake beside the fresh earth and marks the field boundary. The withdrawal order comes down the road; he gathers the broken spade and closes the bag."), TEXT("村口枪声没有停，另一名士兵送来一张位置草图。他把新土旁的木桩扶直，在纸上记下田界。撤离口令从路上传来，他捡起断铲，袋口仍用手按着。")},
    {TEXT("村口枪声没有停，另一名士兵送来一张位置草图。他把新土旁的木桩扶直，在纸上记下田界。撤离口令从路上传来，他捡起断铲，袋口仍用手按着。"), TEXT("Firing continues at the village as another man brings a location sketch. He straightens a stake beside the fresh earth and marks the field boundary. The withdrawal order comes down the road; he gathers the broken spade and closes the bag."), TEXT("携弹队与换防人员在田界碰面，伤员从窄路中间送走。军士先让担架过去，再叫后面的人沿沟走。枪手回头找自己的携弹兵，路口已被车辆堵住。")},
    {TEXT("村口枪声没有停，另一名士兵送来一张位置草图。他把新土旁的木桩扶直，在纸上记下田界。撤离口令从路上传来，他捡起断铲，袋口仍用手按着。"), TEXT("Firing continues at the village as another man brings a location sketch. He straightens a stake beside the fresh earth and marks the field boundary. The withdrawal order comes down the road; he gathers the broken spade and closes the bag."), TEXT("Bearers meet reliefs at a field boundary while wounded men pass between them. The NCO lets a stretcher through first, then directs the others along the ditch. A gunner turns to find his bearer, but vehicles have blocked the junction behind the position.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · 29 September 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 一九一八年九月二十九日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 里克瓦尔 · 1918年9月29日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · 29 September 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Riqueval · Twenty-nine September nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("船工把长篙靠在运河墙上，先摸过破船里的漏口。纤道上全是刚落下的碎土，岸边的枪手催他靠近一点。他用旧布堵住裂缝，让船沿绳慢慢移过去。"), TEXT("The boatman rests his pole against the canal wall and feels for the leak in a damaged boat. Fresh earth covers the towpath. He plugs the crack with cloth and draws the boat along a rope."), TEXT("The boatman rests his pole against the canal wall and feels for the leak in a damaged boat. Fresh earth covers the towpath. He plugs the crack with cloth and draws the boat along a rope.")},
    {TEXT("船工把长篙靠在运河墙上，先摸过破船里的漏口。纤道上全是刚落下的碎土，岸边的枪手催他靠近一点。他用旧布堵住裂缝，让船沿绳慢慢移过去。"), TEXT("The boatman rests his pole against the canal wall and feels for the leak in a damaged boat. Fresh earth covers the towpath. He plugs the crack with cloth and draws the boat along a rope."), TEXT("船工把长篙靠在运河墙上，先摸过破船里的漏口。纤道上全是刚落下的碎土，岸边的枪手催他靠近一点。他用旧布堵住裂缝，让船沿绳慢慢移过去。")},
    {TEXT("船工把长篙靠在运河墙上，先摸过破船里的漏口。纤道上全是刚落下的碎土，岸边的枪手催他靠近一点。他用旧布堵住裂缝，让船沿绳慢慢移过去。"), TEXT("The boatman rests his pole against the canal wall and feels for the leak in a damaged boat. Fresh earth covers the towpath. He plugs the crack with cloth and draws the boat along a rope."), TEXT("纤道上落满碎土，送弹队要从这里到达岸上枪位。烟把对面坡脚遮住，英军正在接近运河。工兵沿受损岸路查看，枪手俯身从高处寻找水边的动静。")},
    {TEXT("船工把长篙靠在运河墙上，先摸过破船里的漏口。纤道上全是刚落下的碎土，岸边的枪手催他靠近一点。他用旧布堵住裂缝，让船沿绳慢慢移过去。"), TEXT("The boatman rests his pole against the canal wall and feels for the leak in a damaged boat. Fresh earth covers the towpath. He plugs the crack with cloth and draws the boat along a rope."), TEXT("Loose earth covers the towpath carrying ammunition to the guns above. Smoke hides the opposite slope as British troops approach the canal. Pioneers examine the damaged bank route. A gunner bends over his position to watch the water below.")},
    {TEXT("预备队在高岸后等候，弹箱从坡上滑到船边。船工扶稳船沿，叫他们把重量分到两端。对岸起烟时，他收回长篙，水面上只剩船底带出的一道浑痕。"), TEXT("Reserves wait behind the high bank while boxes slide towards the boat. He steadies the gunwale and spreads the load between both ends. Smoke rises opposite; the pole comes aboard, leaving a muddy line in the water."), TEXT("Reserves wait behind the high bank while boxes slide towards the boat. He steadies the gunwale and spreads the load between both ends. Smoke rises opposite; the pole comes aboard, leaving a muddy line in the water.")},
    {TEXT("预备队在高岸后等候，弹箱从坡上滑到船边。船工扶稳船沿，叫他们把重量分到两端。对岸起烟时，他收回长篙，水面上只剩船底带出的一道浑痕。"), TEXT("Reserves wait behind the high bank while boxes slide towards the boat. He steadies the gunwale and spreads the load between both ends. Smoke rises opposite; the pole comes aboard, leaving a muddy line in the water."), TEXT("预备队在高岸后等候，弹箱从坡上滑到船边。船工扶稳船沿，叫他们把重量分到两端。对岸起烟时，他收回长篙，水面上只剩船底带出的一道浑痕。")},
    {TEXT("预备队在高岸后等候，弹箱从坡上滑到船边。船工扶稳船沿，叫他们把重量分到两端。对岸起烟时，他收回长篙，水面上只剩船底带出的一道浑痕。"), TEXT("Reserves wait behind the high bank while boxes slide towards the boat. He steadies the gunwale and spreads the load between both ends. Smoke rises opposite; the pole comes aboard, leaving a muddy line in the water."), TEXT("预备队在前哨后等候，换防人员带回道路被打断的消息。军士让两个人抬起一只弹箱，改从斜坡接近。枪声没有停，纤道尽头却已看不到联络兵。")},
    {TEXT("预备队在高岸后等候，弹箱从坡上滑到船边。船工扶稳船沿，叫他们把重量分到两端。对岸起烟时，他收回长篙，水面上只剩船底带出的一道浑痕。"), TEXT("Reserves wait behind the high bank while boxes slide towards the boat. He steadies the gunwale and spreads the load between both ends. Smoke rises opposite; the pole comes aboard, leaving a muddy line in the water."), TEXT("Reserves wait behind the posts. Returning reliefs report a break in the path. The NCO has two men lift a box and take it towards the slope instead. The guns continue firing, but the runner at the far end of the towpath is gone.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 一九一八年十月")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 塞勒河谷 · 1918年10月"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Selle Valley · October nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("信号兵从车站拿出提灯，灯罩的一面已经碎了。列车在切口里向谷口开火，调车轨旁还堆着未装走的木箱。他站到路堤边，把灯口转向司机。"), TEXT("The signalman takes a lamp from the station, one pane broken. A train fires along the valley from the cutting. Boxes remain by the siding as he turns the light towards its driver."), TEXT("The signalman takes a lamp from the station, one pane broken. A train fires along the valley from the cutting. Boxes remain by the siding as he turns the light towards its driver.")},
    {TEXT("信号兵从车站拿出提灯，灯罩的一面已经碎了。列车在切口里向谷口开火，调车轨旁还堆着未装走的木箱。他站到路堤边，把灯口转向司机。"), TEXT("The signalman takes a lamp from the station, one pane broken. A train fires along the valley from the cutting. Boxes remain by the siding as he turns the light towards its driver."), TEXT("信号兵从车站拿出提灯，灯罩的一面已经碎了。列车在切口里向谷口开火，调车轨旁还堆着未装走的木箱。他站到路堤边，把灯口转向司机。")},
    {TEXT("信号兵从车站拿出提灯，灯罩的一面已经碎了。列车在切口里向谷口开火，调车轨旁还堆着未装走的木箱。他站到路堤边，把灯口转向司机。"), TEXT("The signalman takes a lamp from the station, one pane broken. A train fires along the valley from the cutting. Boxes remain by the siding as he turns the light towards its driver."), TEXT("车站还在装运，切口里的列车向谷口开火。公路上有部队撤过来，炮弹落在路堤另一面。守着接近路的步枪手回头，看见携弹兵正从车站跑来。")},
    {TEXT("信号兵从车站拿出提灯，灯罩的一面已经碎了。列车在切口里向谷口开火，调车轨旁还堆着未装走的木箱。他站到路堤边，把灯口转向司机。"), TEXT("The signalman takes a lamp from the station, one pane broken. A train fires along the valley from the cutting. Boxes remain by the siding as he turns the light towards its driver."), TEXT("Loading continues at the station. The train in the cutting fires towards the valley entrance as troops withdraw along the road. Shells fall beyond the embankment. Riflemen covering the approach turn to see bearers coming from the station.")},
    {TEXT("退下来的部队从轨道上经过，司机暂时看不见手势。信号兵把灯举高，等最后一队走出道岔。车轮响过损坏接头时，他又放低灯口，照着下一根枕木。"), TEXT("Retreating troops cross the rails and hide his signal. He raises the lamp until the last party clears the points. Wheels strike a damaged joint; he lowers the light again to show the next sleeper."), TEXT("Retreating troops cross the rails and hide his signal. He raises the lamp until the last party clears the points. Wheels strike a damaged joint; he lowers the light again to show the next sleeper.")},
    {TEXT("退下来的部队从轨道上经过，司机暂时看不见手势。信号兵把灯举高，等最后一队走出道岔。车轮响过损坏接头时，他又放低灯口，照着下一根枕木。"), TEXT("Retreating troops cross the rails and hide his signal. He raises the lamp until the last party clears the points. Wheels strike a damaged joint; he lowers the light again to show the next sleeper."), TEXT("退下来的部队从轨道上经过，司机暂时看不见手势。信号兵把灯举高，等最后一队走出道岔。车轮响过损坏接头时，他又放低灯口，照着下一根枕木。")},
    {TEXT("退下来的部队从轨道上经过，司机暂时看不见手势。信号兵把灯举高，等最后一队走出道岔。车轮响过损坏接头时，他又放低灯口，照着下一根枕木。"), TEXT("Retreating troops cross the rails and hide his signal. He raises the lamp until the last party clears the points. Wheels strike a damaged joint; he lowers the light again to show the next sleeper."), TEXT("换防队沿河岸进入阵地，军士把来路交代给新枪手。路堤遮住列车侧面，只露出上面的枪位。车站方向又响起装车声，担架队等着前面的车辆先走。")},
    {TEXT("退下来的部队从轨道上经过，司机暂时看不见手势。信号兵把灯举高，等最后一队走出道岔。车轮响过损坏接头时，他又放低灯口，照着下一根枕木。"), TEXT("Retreating troops cross the rails and hide his signal. He raises the lamp until the last party clears the points. Wheels strike a damaged joint; he lowers the light again to show the next sleeper."), TEXT("Reliefs enter along the riverbank. The NCO explains the approach to a new gunner. The embankment hides the train's side, leaving its upper guns visible. More loading can be heard behind them. The stretcher party waits for the vehicles ahead to move out.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 一九一八年十一月初")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 瓦朗谢讷外围 · 1918年11月初"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Outside Valenciennes · Early November nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("押送兵让俘虏贴着路边走，腾出中间给载满伤员的车。瓦朗谢讷外围还在射击，一名俘虏扶着另一人的胳膊。押送兵压低枪口，先去推开卡住的车轮。"), TEXT("The escort keeps prisoners beside the road to leave room for a casualty wagon. Firing continues outside Valenciennes. One prisoner supports another; the escort lowers his rifle to help free the wheel."), TEXT("The escort keeps prisoners beside the road to leave room for a casualty wagon. Firing continues outside Valenciennes. One prisoner supports another; the escort lowers his rifle to help free the wheel.")},
    {TEXT("押送兵让俘虏贴着路边走，腾出中间给载满伤员的车。瓦朗谢讷外围还在射击，一名俘虏扶着另一人的胳膊。押送兵压低枪口，先去推开卡住的车轮。"), TEXT("The escort keeps prisoners beside the road to leave room for a casualty wagon. Firing continues outside Valenciennes. One prisoner supports another; the escort lowers his rifle to help free the wheel."), TEXT("押送兵让俘虏贴着路边走，腾出中间给载满伤员的车。瓦朗谢讷外围还在射击，一名俘虏扶着另一人的胳膊。押送兵压低枪口，先去推开卡住的车轮。")},
    {TEXT("押送兵让俘虏贴着路边走，腾出中间给载满伤员的车。瓦朗谢讷外围还在射击，一名俘虏扶着另一人的胳膊。押送兵压低枪口，先去推开卡住的车轮。"), TEXT("The escort keeps prisoners beside the road to leave room for a casualty wagon. Firing continues outside Valenciennes. One prisoner supports another; the escort lowers his rifle to help free the wheel."), TEXT("枪组身旁经过一辆平民手推车，车轮在碎砖上颠簸。加拿大部队正向外围逼近，后卫还守着出口。换防人员沿果园过来，其他部队从残墙后退向城外。")},
    {TEXT("押送兵让俘虏贴着路边走，腾出中间给载满伤员的车。瓦朗谢讷外围还在射击，一名俘虏扶着另一人的胳膊。押送兵压低枪口，先去推开卡住的车轮。"), TEXT("The escort keeps prisoners beside the road to leave room for a casualty wagon. Firing continues outside Valenciennes. One prisoner supports another; the escort lowers his rifle to help free the wheel."), TEXT("A civilian handcart passes the gun, its wheels jolting over broken bricks. Canadian troops approach the outskirts while the rearguard holds the exit. Reliefs come through the orchard and other parties withdraw beyond the ruined walls.")},
    {TEXT("居民的手推车从果园里出来，双方都在碎砖前停了一下。他用手指向较平的沟边，让队伍逐人过去。俘虏回头看城里，押送兵拍了拍身旁的立柱，催后队跟上。"), TEXT("A civilian handcart emerges from the orchard and both parties stop at the rubble. He points towards the smoother ditch edge and sends them through one by one. A prisoner looks back at the town; the escort calls the rear party forward."), TEXT("A civilian handcart emerges from the orchard and both parties stop at the rubble. He points towards the smoother ditch edge and sends them through one by one. A prisoner looks back at the town; the escort calls the rear party forward.")},
    {TEXT("居民的手推车从果园里出来，双方都在碎砖前停了一下。他用手指向较平的沟边，让队伍逐人过去。俘虏回头看城里，押送兵拍了拍身旁的立柱，催后队跟上。"), TEXT("A civilian handcart emerges from the orchard and both parties stop at the rubble. He points towards the smoother ditch edge and sends them through one by one. A prisoner looks back at the town; the escort calls the rear party forward."), TEXT("居民的手推车从果园里出来，双方都在碎砖前停了一下。他用手指向较平的沟边，让队伍逐人过去。俘虏回头看城里，押送兵拍了拍身旁的立柱，催后队跟上。")},
    {TEXT("居民的手推车从果园里出来，双方都在碎砖前停了一下。他用手指向较平的沟边，让队伍逐人过去。俘虏回头看城里，押送兵拍了拍身旁的立柱，催后队跟上。"), TEXT("A civilian handcart emerges from the orchard and both parties stop at the rubble. He points towards the smoother ditch edge and sends them through one by one. A prisoner looks back at the town; the escort calls the rear party forward."), TEXT("路上挤着伤员和军车，军士不断示意前面继续走。步枪手伏在浅沟里等候，墙另一侧有射击声。手推车卡在一块砖上，旁边的人伸手扶了一把。")},
    {TEXT("居民的手推车从果园里出来，双方都在碎砖前停了一下。他用手指向较平的沟边，让队伍逐人过去。俘虏回头看城里，押送兵拍了拍身旁的立柱，催后队跟上。"), TEXT("A civilian handcart emerges from the orchard and both parties stop at the rubble. He points towards the smoother ditch edge and sends them through one by one. A prisoner looks back at the town; the escort calls the rear party forward."), TEXT("Wounded men and military vehicles fill the road. The NCO keeps signalling those ahead to move. Riflemen wait in a shallow ditch, hearing shots beyond the wall. The handcart catches on a brick beside them; a passing man reaches over to steady its loaded frame.")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 一九一八年十一月四日")},
    {TEXT("战时日志 · 桑布尔接近地 · 1918年11月4日"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · 4 November 1918"), TEXT("WAR LOG · Sambre Approaches · Four November nineteen eighteen")},
    {TEXT("药务兵在路口打开铁盒，瓶身上的纸签已经湿透。后卫仍向桑布尔渡口射击，空药瓶随着车轮震动轻轻相碰。他把干布铺在箱底，重新放好剩下的药。"), TEXT("The medical orderly opens a tin at the junction, its bottle labels soaked. The rearguard still fires towards the Sambre crossing. Empty bottles knock together as he lines the box with dry cloth."), TEXT("The medical orderly opens a tin at the junction, its bottle labels soaked. The rearguard still fires towards the Sambre crossing. Empty bottles knock together as he lines the box with dry cloth.")},
    {TEXT("药务兵在路口打开铁盒，瓶身上的纸签已经湿透。后卫仍向桑布尔渡口射击，空药瓶随着车轮震动轻轻相碰。他把干布铺在箱底，重新放好剩下的药。"), TEXT("The medical orderly opens a tin at the junction, its bottle labels soaked. The rearguard still fires towards the Sambre crossing. Empty bottles knock together as he lines the box with dry cloth."), TEXT("药务兵在路口打开铁盒，瓶身上的纸签已经湿透。后卫仍向桑布尔渡口射击，空药瓶随着车轮震动轻轻相碰。他把干布铺在箱底，重新放好剩下的药。")},
    {TEXT("药务兵在路口打开铁盒，瓶身上的纸签已经湿透。后卫仍向桑布尔渡口射击，空药瓶随着车轮震动轻轻相碰。他把干布铺在箱底，重新放好剩下的药。"), TEXT("The medical orderly opens a tin at the junction, its bottle labels soaked. The rearguard still fires towards the Sambre crossing. Empty bottles knock together as he lines the box with dry cloth."), TEXT("后卫机枪朝着运河渡口，预备队留在路口等人。别处停战的消息到了，今天的撤离命令也到了。城郊公路上，居民推着家当夹在撤回的纵队之间。")},
    {TEXT("药务兵在路口打开铁盒，瓶身上的纸签已经湿透。后卫仍向桑布尔渡口射击，空药瓶随着车轮震动轻轻相碰。他把干布铺在箱底，重新放好剩下的药。"), TEXT("The medical orderly opens a tin at the junction, its bottle labels soaked. The rearguard still fires towards the Sambre crossing. Empty bottles knock together as he lines the box with dry cloth."), TEXT("The rearguard gun faces the canal crossing. Reserves wait at the junction for men still forward. News of armistices elsewhere has arrived with today's withdrawal orders. Civilians push their belongings between the returning columns on the outskirts road.")},
    {TEXT("一个士兵来领包扎布，递上的手掌还沾着枪油。药务兵把整卷布交给他，将空盒系回车旁。居民与军车开始往后走，他在车板上坐稳，留出一只手抓住缰绳。"), TEXT("A soldier comes for dressings with gun oil on his palm. The orderly hands him a whole roll and ties the empty tin to the cart. Civilians and wagons begin moving back; he settles on the board with a hand free for the reins."), TEXT("A soldier comes for dressings with gun oil on his palm. The orderly hands him a whole roll and ties the empty tin to the cart. Civilians and wagons begin moving back; he settles on the board with a hand free for the reins.")},
    {TEXT("一个士兵来领包扎布，递上的手掌还沾着枪油。药务兵把整卷布交给他，将空盒系回车旁。居民与军车开始往后走，他在车板上坐稳，留出一只手抓住缰绳。"), TEXT("A soldier comes for dressings with gun oil on his palm. The orderly hands him a whole roll and ties the empty tin to the cart. Civilians and wagons begin moving back; he settles on the board with a hand free for the reins."), TEXT("一个士兵来领包扎布，递上的手掌还沾着枪油。药务兵把整卷布交给他，将空盒系回车旁。居民与军车开始往后走，他在车板上坐稳，留出一只手抓住缰绳。")},
    {TEXT("一个士兵来领包扎布，递上的手掌还沾着枪油。药务兵把整卷布交给他，将空盒系回车旁。居民与军车开始往后走，他在车板上坐稳，留出一只手抓住缰绳。"), TEXT("A soldier comes for dressings with gun oil on his palm. The orderly hands him a whole roll and ties the empty tin to the cart. Civilians and wagons begin moving back; he settles on the board with a hand free for the reins."), TEXT("前哨还有人员没有回来，携弹兵把剩余箱子放在墙下。军士望着来路，示意最后一队先通过障碍。枪手握住已经发热的握把，河岸那边又传来步枪声。")},
    {TEXT("一个士兵来领包扎布，递上的手掌还沾着枪油。药务兵把整卷布交给他，将空盒系回车旁。居民与军车开始往后走，他在车板上坐稳，留出一只手抓住缰绳。"), TEXT("A soldier comes for dressings with gun oil on his palm. The orderly hands him a whole roll and ties the empty tin to the cart. Civilians and wagons begin moving back; he settles on the board with a hand free for the reins."), TEXT("Some men remain at the outposts. Bearers put their last boxes under a wall. The NCO watches the approach and signals another party through the damaged obstacles. The gunner holds the warm grips. Rifle fire sounds again from the bank beyond the crossing.")},
