    {TEXT("请直接观察屏幕上的亮块与十字。"), TEXT("Judge the patches and crosses directly on the display."), TEXT("The patches below use real HDR output. Judge them directly on your display.")},
    {TEXT("请直接观察屏幕上的亮块与十字。"), TEXT("Judge the patches and crosses directly on the display."), TEXT("请直接观察屏幕上的亮块与十字。")},
    {TEXT("请直接观察屏幕上的亮块与十字。"), TEXT("Judge the patches and crosses directly on the display."), TEXT("Judge the patches and crosses directly on the display.")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。\n范围 200–4000 nit；步长 50 nit。")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak.\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps.")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n\n以显示器或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调整到亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕持续保留十字，使用已校准的峰值。\n\n范围：200–4000 nit。步进：50 nit。")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，是游戏最亮高光的显示目标。1 nit = 1 cd/m²。\n\n保持平时的屏幕亮度和局部调光设置，以显示器或系统 HDR 校准的峰值起步。左侧亮块的十字比背景暗 10%%；逐步调到十字刚好消失。若始终可见，屏幕可能在映射亮部，请沿用已校准的峰值，不必一直推高。\n\n200–4000 nit；每次调整 50 nit。")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the target for the brightest highlights. 1 nit = 1 cd/m².\n\nKeep your usual display brightness and local dimming. Start with the peak established by your display or Windows HDR calibration. The cross in the bright patch is 10%% darker than its background; adjust until it just disappears. If it stays visible, your display may be tone-mapping highlights. Keep the calibrated peak instead of raising it indefinitely.\n\n200–4000 nits; 50-nit steps.")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\n\nStart with your display or Windows HDR calibration value. Adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display keeps the cross visible, retain its calibrated peak.\n\nRange: 200–4000 nits. Step: 50 nits.")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。")},
    {TEXT("峰值亮度：%.0f nit。\n以屏幕或 Windows HDR 校准结果为起点，调至亮块中的十字刚好消失。若屏幕自行压缩高光，沿用已校准峰值。"), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak."), TEXT("Peak luminance: %.0f nits.\nStart with the display or Windows HDR calibration, then adjust until the cross in the bright patch just disappears. If the display compresses highlights, keep its calibrated peak.")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n普通白色与漫反射亮度。白色应舒适，十字保持可辨。\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nSets ordinary white and diffuse brightness. White should feel comfortable and the cross remain visible.\nAutomatic mode uses this display's Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps.")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，决定普通白色和漫反射物体的亮度基准，不是火光的最高亮度。%s\n\n默认跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，无法读取时使用 203 nit。峰值亮度不能代替纸白。手动调整后会为这块屏幕保留，恢复推荐值可再次跟随系统。\n\n白色应自然舒适，块内十字应能分辨，不要以让它消失为目标。80–1000 nit，最高为屏幕峰值的 80%%；每次调整 10 nit。")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n\n控制普通白色与漫反射表面的亮度。调至白色舒适、十字清晰可辨。\n\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度；无可用数据时为 203 nit。手动值按屏幕保存。\n\n范围：80–1000 nit，上限为屏幕峰值的 80%%。步进：10 nit。")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the reference brightness for ordinary white and diffuse surfaces, not the peak of flames. %s\n\nAutomatic mode follows this display's Windows white level, using 203 nits when unavailable. Peak brightness cannot replace paper white. Manual values are remembered for each display; restore recommendations to follow Windows again.\n\nWhite should look natural and comfortable, with the cross still distinguishable. Do not try to make it disappear. 80–1000 nits, limited to 80%% of display peak; 10-nit steps.")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\n\nSets the brightness of ordinary white and diffuse surfaces. Choose a comfortable white with the cross clearly visible.\n\nAutomatic values follow Windows white luminance for this display, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual settings are saved per display.\n\nRange: 80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of display peak. Step: 10 nits.")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。")},
    {TEXT("纸白亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n画面里普通白色的亮度。调到白色看着舒服、十字仍能分辨为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Paper white: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright ordinary white appears. Adjust until white is comfortable and the cross is still visible.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display.")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n控制文字、照片与操作台的亮度。以文字清楚、亮边柔和为准；仅作用于界面。\n自动值跟随 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时为 203 nit；手动值按屏幕保存。\n范围 80–1000 nit，最高为峰值的 80%%；步长 10 nit。")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nSets text, photographs and console brightness. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Applies to the interface only.\nAutomatic mode uses Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual values are saved per display.\n80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of peak; 10-nit steps.")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("当前 %.0f nit，单独控制文字、照片和操作台的亮度；不改变战场曝光或高光峰值。%s\n\n默认跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度，读取失败时使用 203 nit。先把画面纸白调舒服，再看本页文字与战场操作台。降低刺眼的字和亮边，提高到文字清楚即可。\n\n每块屏幕独立保留手动值。80–1000 nit，最高为屏幕峰值的 80%%；每次调整 10 nit。")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n\n控制文字、照片和操作台的亮度。调至文字清楚、亮边柔和。战场曝光保持不变。\n\n自动值跟随当前屏幕的 Windows 白亮度；无可用数据时为 203 nit。手动值按屏幕保存。\n\n范围：80–1000 nit，上限为屏幕峰值的 80%%。步进：10 nit。")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Currently %.0f nits: the separate brightness of text, photographs and the console. It does not change battlefield exposure or peak highlights. %s\n\nAutomatic mode follows this display's Windows white level, using 203 nits when unavailable. Set comfortable paper white first, then judge the text here and the battlefield console. Reduce glare while keeping the lettering clear.\n\nManual values are saved per display. 80–1000 nits, limited to 80%% of display peak; 10-nit steps.")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\n\nSets the brightness of text, photographs and the console. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable. Battlefield exposure is unchanged.\n\nAutomatic values follow Windows white luminance, or 203 nits when unavailable. Manual settings are saved per display.\n\nRange: 80–1000 nits, capped at 80%% of display peak. Step: 10 nits.")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。")},
    {TEXT("界面亮度：%.0f nit。%s\n文字、照片与控制台的亮度。调到文字清楚、亮边柔和为止。\n自动时跟随 Windows 的设置；手动调过的值会按屏幕记住。"), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display."), TEXT("Interface luminance: %.0f nits. %s\nHow bright text, photographs and the console appear. Keep lettering clear and bright edges comfortable.\nAutomatic follows Windows; manual values are remembered for each display.")},
    {TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响观察；此项只调整参照图。"), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nCheck near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the view. This changes the reference patch only."), TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响判断；此项仅调整参照图。\n范围 0.0001–0.1 nit，每步减半或加倍。")},
    {TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响观察；此项只调整参照图。"), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nCheck near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the view. This changes the reference patch only."), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nChecks near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the test. This control changes the reference patch only.\n0.0001–0.1 nits; each step halves or doubles the value.")},
    {TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响观察；此项只调整参照图。"), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nCheck near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the view. This changes the reference patch only."), TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n\n用于检查近黑层次。十字应隐约可辨；室内反光会影响判断。此项仅调整参照图。\n\n范围：0.0001–0.1 nit。每步减半或加倍。")},
    {TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响观察；此项只调整参照图。"), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nCheck near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the view. This changes the reference patch only."), TEXT("右侧参照块为 %.4f nit，十字为 %.4f nit。它只用来观察屏幕的近黑层次，不改变战场曝光或黑位。\n\n从接近纯黑开始，看十字是否仍能辨认。若暗部被室内反光盖住，先调整环境；不要用这个参照去抬亮整幅游戏。\n\n0.0001–0.1 nit；每次减半或加倍。")},
    {TEXT("参照块：%.4f nit。十字：%.4f nit。\n检查近黑层次，十字应隐约可辨。室内反光会影响观察；此项只调整参照图。"), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\nCheck near-black detail; the cross should be faintly visible. Room reflections affect the view. This changes the reference patch only."), TEXT("Reference patch: %.4f nits. Cross: %.4f nits.\n\nChecks near-black detail. The cross should be faintly visible; room reflections affect this test. This control adjusts the reference patch only.\n\nRange: 0.0001–0.1 nits. Each step halves or doubles the value.")},
