    {TEXT("按实际游玩的屏幕校准。\n\n保持平时的屏幕亮度和局部调光设置，以显示器或 Windows HDR 校准的峰值起步。\n\n悬停每一行可阅读数值含义及校准方法。手动值按屏幕分别保留。\n\n先把画面纸白调到自然舒适，再调整界面亮度，让文字清楚而不刺眼。"), TEXT("Calibrate for the display you use to play.\n\nKeep your usual screen brightness and local dimming. Begin with the peak brightness from your monitor or Windows HDR calibration.\n\nHover each brightness row for its measurement and calibration instructions. Manual values are retained for this display.\n\nSet paper white to a comfortable ordinary white, then adjust UI luminance for clear, comfortable text."), TEXT("按实际游玩的屏幕校准。\n\n保持平时的屏幕亮度和局部调光设置，以显示器或 Windows HDR 校准的峰值起步。\n\n悬停每一行可阅读数值含义及校准方法。手动值按屏幕分别保留。\n\n先把画面纸白调到自然舒适，再调整界面亮度，让文字清楚而不刺眼。")},
    {TEXT("按实际游玩的屏幕校准。\n\n保持平时的屏幕亮度和局部调光设置，以显示器或 Windows HDR 校准的峰值起步。\n\n悬停每一行可阅读数值含义及校准方法。手动值按屏幕分别保留。\n\n先把画面纸白调到自然舒适，再调整界面亮度，让文字清楚而不刺眼。"), TEXT("Calibrate for the display you use to play.\n\nKeep your usual screen brightness and local dimming. Begin with the peak brightness from your monitor or Windows HDR calibration.\n\nHover each brightness row for its measurement and calibration instructions. Manual values are retained for this display.\n\nSet paper white to a comfortable ordinary white, then adjust UI luminance for clear, comfortable text."), TEXT("Calibrate for the display you use to play.\n\nKeep your usual screen brightness and local dimming. Begin with the peak brightness from your monitor or Windows HDR calibration.\n\nHover each brightness row for its measurement and calibration instructions. Manual values are retained for this display.\n\nSet paper white to a comfortable ordinary white, then adjust UI luminance for clear, comfortable text.")},
