    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本连须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("三月二十一日的雾里，旧前线已经消失。第五集团军的传令兵不断向西跑，军官带着补充兵赶来；先接回被切断的一段路，才能把更多人带出雾。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("In the fog of 21 March, the old front has vanished. Fifth Army runners hurry west while an officer brings up replacements. Reopen one severed road before more men are lost in the mist.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("三月的雾里，前沿电话陆续中断。步枪班与机枪接起相邻支点，指挥组观察近处通路。接替部队与首轮炮火将较早抵达。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("Forward telephones fall silent in the March fog. Rifles and machine guns connect the neighbouring posts while the command party watches the approaches. Reliefs and the opening fire are given priority.")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("夺回中央与下一处支点，打通被截断的后撤路线。机枪掩护，烟幕遮住轮换；第五集团军仍在后撤，先把断线两侧的人接起来。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("夺回中央交通壕，打通后撤部队的退路。提防穿过烟雾的自动武器突击组；保护观察员，以机枪掩护反击，击溃切断交通线的追兵。")},
    {TEXT("三月二十一日，米夏埃尔攻势冲破浓雾。第五集团军正在后撤，本部须接通被截断的道路，掩护失散部队归队。"), TEXT("On 21 March, Operation Michael breaks through the fog. Fifth Army withdraws. Reopen the severed road and cover the return of isolated troops."), TEXT("Retake the centre and next post to reconnect the withdrawal route. Machine guns cover relief behind smoke. Fifth Army is still falling back; link the men on either side of the breach.")},
