    {TEXT("命令面板"), TEXT("Trench orders"), TEXT("命令面板")},
    {TEXT("命令面板"), TEXT("Trench orders"), TEXT("Trench orders")},
    {TEXT("鼠标靠近友壕时打开命令面板，离开后收起。点击一支驻军的肖像令它出击；整壕前进令全体守军出发。"), TEXT("Move the pointer near a friendly trench to open its orders; move away to close them. Select a garrison portrait to advance that section, or send the whole trench forward."), TEXT("鼠标靠近友壕时打开命令面板，离开后收起。点击一支驻军的肖像令它出击；整壕前进令全体守军出发。")},
    {TEXT("鼠标靠近友壕时打开命令面板，离开后收起。点击一支驻军的肖像令它出击；整壕前进令全体守军出发。"), TEXT("Move the pointer near a friendly trench to open its orders; move away to close them. Select a garrison portrait to advance that section, or send the whole trench forward."), TEXT("Move the pointer near a friendly trench to open its orders; move away to close them. Select a garrison portrait to advance that section, or send the whole trench forward.")},
    {TEXT("关闭入壕不会令驻军出击。后续小队从壕旁通过，满员的友壕也能绕过。进入敌壕前，先清除守军。"), TEXT("Closing entry leaves the garrison in place and lets following sections pass. Full friendly trenches can also be passed. Clear the defenders before entering an enemy trench."), TEXT("关闭入壕不会令驻军出击。后续小队从壕旁通过，满员的友壕也能绕过。进入敌壕前，先清除守军。")},
    {TEXT("关闭入壕不会令驻军出击。后续小队从壕旁通过，满员的友壕也能绕过。进入敌壕前，先清除守军。"), TEXT("Closing entry leaves the garrison in place and lets following sections pass. Full friendly trenches can also be passed. Clear the defenders before entering an enemy trench."), TEXT("Closing entry leaves the garrison in place and lets following sections pass. Full friendly trenches can also be passed. Clear the defenders before entering an enemy trench.")},
    {TEXT("军士与军官附近的友军获得指挥。金星标示指挥者，银星标示受指挥的小队。多名指挥者同时在场时，采用较强的指挥。"), TEXT("NCOs and officers command nearby troops. Gold stars mark the leaders; silver stars mark sections under orders. Where several leaders are present, the strongest command is used."), TEXT("军士与军官附近的友军获得指挥。金星标示指挥者，银星标示受指挥的小队。多名指挥者同时在场时，采用较强的指挥。")},
    {TEXT("军士与军官附近的友军获得指挥。金星标示指挥者，银星标示受指挥的小队。多名指挥者同时在场时，采用较强的指挥。"), TEXT("NCOs and officers command nearby troops. Gold stars mark the leaders; silver stars mark sections under orders. Where several leaders are present, the strongest command is used."), TEXT("NCOs and officers command nearby troops. Gold stars mark the leaders; silver stars mark sections under orders. Where several leaders are present, the strongest command is used.")},
    {TEXT("指挥者受重压、阵亡或离开部队后，指挥中断。军士停步时重整；德军军官在行进中也能重整。"), TEXT("Heavy suppression, death or separation breaks command. NCOs rally troops while halted; German officers can also rally them on the move."), TEXT("指挥者受重压、阵亡或离开部队后，指挥中断。军士停步时重整；德军军官在行进中也能重整。")},
    {TEXT("指挥者受重压、阵亡或离开部队后，指挥中断。军士停步时重整；德军军官在行进中也能重整。"), TEXT("Heavy suppression, death or separation breaks command. NCOs rally troops while halted; German officers can also rally them on the move."), TEXT("Heavy suppression, death or separation breaks command. NCOs rally troops while halted; German officers can also rally them on the move.")},
    {TEXT("查看驻军，决定哪些小队出击、哪些留守。关闭入壕，让后续部队通过。"), TEXT("Review the garrison and decide which sections advance and which remain. Close entry to let following troops pass."), TEXT("查看驻军，决定哪些小队出击、哪些留守。关闭入壕，让后续部队通过。")},
    {TEXT("查看驻军，决定哪些小队出击、哪些留守。关闭入壕，让后续部队通过。"), TEXT("Review the garrison and decide which sections advance and which remain. Close entry to let following troops pass."), TEXT("Review the garrison and decide which sections advance and which remain. Close entry to let following troops pass.")},
    {TEXT("战场工事"), TEXT("Field positions"), TEXT("战场工事")},
    {TEXT("战场工事"), TEXT("Field positions"), TEXT("Field positions")},
    {TEXT("清除敌军后，步兵连续驻守 8 秒可夺取工事。至少两名守军在位时，工事才提供火力或补给。敌军进入后，夺取过程受阻。"), TEXT("After clearing the enemy, hold a position with infantry for 8 uninterrupted seconds to capture it. At least two defenders are needed to operate its guns or stores. Enemy troops interrupt capture."), TEXT("清除敌军后，步兵连续驻守 8 秒可夺取工事。至少两名守军在位时，工事才提供火力或补给。敌军进入后，夺取过程受阻。")},
    {TEXT("清除敌军后，步兵连续驻守 8 秒可夺取工事。至少两名守军在位时，工事才提供火力或补给。敌军进入后，夺取过程受阻。"), TEXT("After clearing the enemy, hold a position with infantry for 8 uninterrupted seconds to capture it. At least two defenders are needed to operate its guns or stores. Enemy troops interrupt capture."), TEXT("After clearing the enemy, hold a position with infantry for 8 uninterrupted seconds to capture it. At least two defenders are needed to operate its guns or stores. Enemy troops interrupt capture.")},
    {TEXT("工兵在无敌军争夺的友壕内停步施工。连续作业 12 秒完成壕肩工事；受到压制时施工中断。"), TEXT("Pioneers halt to work in an uncontested friendly trench. Twelve uninterrupted seconds complete the revetment; suppression interrupts construction."), TEXT("工兵在无敌军争夺的友壕内停步施工。连续作业 12 秒完成壕肩工事；受到压制时施工中断。")},
    {TEXT("工兵在无敌军争夺的友壕内停步施工。连续作业 12 秒完成壕肩工事；受到压制时施工中断。"), TEXT("Pioneers halt to work in an uncontested friendly trench. Twelve uninterrupted seconds complete the revetment; suppression interrupts construction."), TEXT("Pioneers halt to work in an uncontested friendly trench. Twelve uninterrupted seconds complete the revetment; suppression interrupts construction.")},
    {TEXT("完成工事并留守两人，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。火焰与侧翼火力可绕过掩护，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("A completed revetment with two defenders reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%. Flame and flanking fire bypass its cover; shellfire can destroy it."), TEXT("完成工事并留守两人，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。火焰与侧翼火力可绕过掩护，炮击能摧毁工事。")},
    {TEXT("完成工事并留守两人，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%。火焰与侧翼火力可绕过掩护，炮击能摧毁工事。"), TEXT("A completed revetment with two defenders reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%. Flame and flanking fire bypass its cover; shellfire can destroy it."), TEXT("A completed revetment with two defenders reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%. Flame and flanking fire bypass its cover; shellfire can destroy it.")},
    {TEXT("工兵接近可疑地面后检查地雷。掩护工兵作业，避免其他小队抢先穿过危险地段。"), TEXT("Pioneers inspect suspect ground as they approach. Cover their work and keep other sections from entering the dangerous ground first."), TEXT("工兵接近可疑地面后检查地雷。掩护工兵作业，避免其他小队抢先穿过危险地段。")},
    {TEXT("工兵接近可疑地面后检查地雷。掩护工兵作业，避免其他小队抢先穿过危险地段。"), TEXT("Pioneers inspect suspect ground as they approach. Cover their work and keep other sections from entering the dangerous ground first."), TEXT("Pioneers inspect suspect ground as they approach. Cover their work and keep other sections from entering the dangerous ground first.")},
    {TEXT("先清除敌军，再让步兵接管工事。守军留在阵位，设备才能继续提供火力或补给。"), TEXT("Clear the enemy, then let infantry take over the position. Its defenders keep the guns or stores in operation."), TEXT("先清除敌军，再让步兵接管工事。守军留在阵位，设备才能继续提供火力或补给。")},
    {TEXT("先清除敌军，再让步兵接管工事。守军留在阵位，设备才能继续提供火力或补给。"), TEXT("Clear the enemy, then let infantry take over the position. Its defenders keep the guns or stores in operation."), TEXT("Clear the enemy, then let infantry take over the position. Its defenders keep the guns or stores in operation.")},
