    {TEXT("装甲部件"), TEXT("Armour parts"), TEXT("Armour parts")},
    {TEXT("车体、行走机构与机枪可分别损坏。车体被毁才记为击毁；履带损坏会限制行进，损坏的枪位不能开火。"), TEXT("Hull, running gear and machine guns can be damaged separately. Only a destroyed hull counts as a kill. Broken tracks limit movement and damaged gun stations cannot fire."), TEXT("车体、行走机构与机枪可分别损坏。车体被毁才记为击毁；履带损坏会限制行进，损坏的枪位不能开火。")},
    {TEXT("车体、行走机构与机枪可分别损坏。车体被毁才记为击毁；履带损坏会限制行进，损坏的枪位不能开火。"), TEXT("Hull, running gear and machine guns can be damaged separately. Only a destroyed hull counts as a kill. Broken tracks limit movement and damaged gun stations cannot fire."), TEXT("Hull, running gear and machine guns can be damaged separately. Only a destroyed hull counts as a kill. Broken tracks limit movement and damaged gun stations cannot fire.")},
    {TEXT("第 9 次行动起，工兵可抢修履带。连续作业 12 秒恢复该侧 50% 耐久，每侧可修一次；附近交火或重压会中断作业。"), TEXT("From operation 9, pioneers can repair tracks. Twelve uninterrupted seconds restore 50% durability to that side, once per side. Nearby fighting or heavy pressure interrupts work."), TEXT("第 9 次行动起，工兵可抢修履带。连续作业 12 秒恢复该侧 50% 耐久，每侧可修一次；附近交火或重压会中断作业。")},
    {TEXT("第 9 次行动起，工兵可抢修履带。连续作业 12 秒恢复该侧 50% 耐久，每侧可修一次；附近交火或重压会中断作业。"), TEXT("From operation 9, pioneers can repair tracks. Twelve uninterrupted seconds restore 50% durability to that side, once per side. Nearby fighting or heavy pressure interrupts work."), TEXT("From operation 9, pioneers can repair tracks. Twelve uninterrupted seconds restore 50% durability to that side, once per side. Nearby fighting or heavy pressure interrupts work.")},
    {TEXT("研究枪位抢修后，工兵可修复一处损坏机枪。连续作业 8 秒恢复 50% 耐久，每辆可修一处；11 米内有敌军时不能维修。"), TEXT("After gun-recovery research, pioneers can restore one damaged machine gun per vehicle. Eight uninterrupted seconds restore 50% durability. Work cannot proceed with enemy troops or armour within 11 metres."), TEXT("研究枪位抢修后，工兵可修复一处损坏机枪。连续作业 8 秒恢复 50% 耐久，每辆可修一处；11 米内有敌军时不能维修。")},
    {TEXT("研究枪位抢修后，工兵可修复一处损坏机枪。连续作业 8 秒恢复 50% 耐久，每辆可修一处；11 米内有敌军时不能维修。"), TEXT("After gun-recovery research, pioneers can restore one damaged machine gun per vehicle. Eight uninterrupted seconds restore 50% durability. Work cannot proceed with enemy troops or armour within 11 metres."), TEXT("After gun-recovery research, pioneers can restore one damaged machine gun per vehicle. Eight uninterrupted seconds restore 50% durability. Work cannot proceed with enemy troops or armour within 11 metres.")},
    {TEXT("两种配属装甲共用整备，各型等待时间不同。Mark IV 雄型与雌型在出战前择一；换装只影响之后出动的车辆。"), TEXT("The two assigned vehicles share readiness, with a different wait for each model. Choose Male or Female Mark IV before departure; the choice affects vehicles called out afterwards."), TEXT("两种配属装甲共用整备，各型等待时间不同。Mark IV 雄型与雌型在出战前择一；换装只影响之后出动的车辆。")},
    {TEXT("两种配属装甲共用整备，各型等待时间不同。Mark IV 雄型与雌型在出战前择一；换装只影响之后出动的车辆。"), TEXT("The two assigned vehicles share readiness, with a different wait for each model. Choose Male or Female Mark IV before departure; the choice affects vehicles called out afterwards."), TEXT("The two assigned vehicles share readiness, with a different wait for each model. Choose Male or Female Mark IV before departure; the choice affects vehicles called out afterwards.")},
