    {TEXT("战斗与电报带来研究点。先完成所列前置研究，再研究相接的条令。装备仍依作战命令配属。"), TEXT("Battles and dispatches provide research points. Complete the listed prerequisites before researching the next doctrine. Equipment is assigned through operation orders."), TEXT("战斗与电报带来研究点。先完成所列前置研究，再研究相接的条令。装备仍依作战命令配属。")},
    {TEXT("战斗与电报带来研究点。先完成所列前置研究，再研究相接的条令。装备仍依作战命令配属。"), TEXT("Battles and dispatches provide research points. Complete the listed prerequisites before researching the next doctrine. Equipment is assigned through operation orders."), TEXT("Battles and dispatches provide research points. Complete the listed prerequisites before researching the next doctrine. Equipment is assigned through operation orders.")},
    {TEXT("完成观察研究后，指挥组与同队一名同伴停稳 2 秒，并看清目标，即可校射。野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。"), TEXT("After observation research, a command section can register fire by halting for 2 seconds with a section companion and a clear view of the target. The opening field-gun or mortar salvo arrives 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter is reduced by 30%."), TEXT("完成观察研究后，指挥组与同队一名同伴停稳 2 秒，并看清目标，即可校射。野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。")},
    {TEXT("完成观察研究后，指挥组与同队一名同伴停稳 2 秒，并看清目标，即可校射。野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。"), TEXT("After observation research, a command section can register fire by halting for 2 seconds with a section companion and a clear view of the target. The opening field-gun or mortar salvo arrives 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter is reduced by 30%."), TEXT("After observation research, a command section can register fire by halting for 2 seconds with a section companion and a clear view of the target. The opening field-gun or mortar salvo arrives 2.5 seconds sooner; scatter is reduced by 30%.")},
    {TEXT("研究伴随枪组后，在出战序列中切换固定与伴随编组。两种编制共用整备，改动只影响之后征募的小队。"), TEXT("After researching mobile gun sections, switch between fixed and mobile crews in the order of battle. Both share readiness; the change affects sections recruited afterwards."), TEXT("研究伴随枪组后，在出战序列中切换固定与伴随编组。两种编制共用整备，改动只影响之后征募的小队。")},
    {TEXT("研究伴随枪组后，在出战序列中切换固定与伴随编组。两种编制共用整备，改动只影响之后征募的小队。"), TEXT("After researching mobile gun sections, switch between fixed and mobile crews in the order of battle. Both share readiness; the change affects sections recruited afterwards."), TEXT("After researching mobile gun sections, switch between fixed and mobile crews in the order of battle. Both share readiness; the change affects sections recruited afterwards.")},
    {TEXT("步兵贴近坦克，在 9 米内帮助车载机枪辨认目标。完成步坦协同研究后，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%；附近更多步兵不会继续提高。"), TEXT("Infantry within 9 metres help the tank gunners identify targets. Close-escort research raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; additional infantry do not increase it further."), TEXT("步兵贴近坦克，在 9 米内帮助车载机枪辨认目标。完成步坦协同研究后，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%；附近更多步兵不会继续提高。")},
    {TEXT("步兵贴近坦克，在 9 米内帮助车载机枪辨认目标。完成步坦协同研究后，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%；附近更多步兵不会继续提高。"), TEXT("Infantry within 9 metres help the tank gunners identify targets. Close-escort research raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; additional infantry do not increase it further."), TEXT("Infantry within 9 metres help the tank gunners identify targets. Close-escort research raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; additional infantry do not increase it further.")},
    {TEXT("驻壕士兵受压较低，5 秒没有发现目标且弹仓不足半数时，会自行装填。德军留守掩护研究令枪组掩护整壕冲锋；前方 16 米内有己方冲锋步兵时，火力得到加强。"), TEXT("Men in the trench top up their magazines when suppression is low, no target has appeared for 5 seconds and less than half the ammunition remains. German rear-cover research keeps gun sections firing during a trench advance; assault troops within 16 metres ahead receive stronger covering fire."), TEXT("驻壕士兵受压较低，5 秒没有发现目标且弹仓不足半数时，会自行装填。德军留守掩护研究令枪组掩护整壕冲锋；前方 16 米内有己方冲锋步兵时，火力得到加强。")},
